{"job":{"id":19939845,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"M7 Services","title":"Documentation of Hotel Network","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Pre Visit Requirements:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Download all the documents attached on the work order</strong></li></ol><p><strong>***********************************************************************************************</strong></p><p><strong>Note :&nbsp;</strong>Attire: No T-Shirts, Shorts, or Jeans. Needed Collared Shirt, Button Up Shirt, Slacks, or Dress Pants are acceptable.</p><p>***********************************************************************************************</p><p><strong>Onsite Mandatory Steps:</strong></p><p><strong>Top priority will be to complete the M7 Marriott Mobile Key&nbsp;tasks within FieldNation, we ask the on-site resource verifies with us before leaving property to confirm we have the needed information within this documentation.</strong></p><p><strong>CHECK IN and CHECK OUT MUST BE THROUGH M7 ENGINEER OR WORK ORDER MANAGER</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Onsite technician to connect with&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***** ******** </del></strong><del>*************</del><strong>&nbsp;on arrival. In the event that meeting is no open please call and if phone is unanswered, please send an email to&nbsp;<del>************************</del></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>**</del></strong></li><li><strong>Tech Needs to complete Section wise assessments (IT Vendor Site Assessment) of the property in order to assist M7 with evaluation of current Key System.</strong></li><li><strong>Tech to follow PDF form showing the requested questions with more details on information to gather. Must be able to follow step-by-step guide provided.</strong></li><li><strong>Tech needs to Answer questions provided on \"Providers Custom Fields\" From Section A - Section F</strong></li><li><strong>Technician to also provide pictures of each section requirement following guidelines from Site Survey Checklist.</strong></li><li><strong>Technician to complete deliverables by taking photos of the location in areas such as the Front Desk, MDF, IDF, and any offices that include networking equipment and Key related items. (Tasks list below pictures required)</strong></li></ol><p>If there are any questions and/or concerns that the property may reflect to the technician, please refer them to the Work Order Manager for discussion. M7 is ONLY completing the items that are requested on the PDF and Provider Custom Field Questions.</p><p>**************************************************************************************************</p><p><strong>Required Equipment</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop with internet access</li><li>Digital camera or cell phone with clear picture capability</li><li>Basic networking Tool Kit</li><li>Cable Toner</li><li>Flashlight</li><li>Basic Networking Tools</li></ul><p><strong>Escalation Path</strong>&nbsp;- Contact Project Manager, Work Order Manager, or Project Engineer</p><p><strong>Additional Hours and expenses</strong>&nbsp;- All expenses must include receipts and any overage in hours must have prior written approval from Project Manager.</p><p><strong>Deliverables&nbsp;</strong>- FieldNation technician to provide all pictures required in Tasks list and Provider Custom Fields. Onsite technician to also gather information related to IT Assessment Form attached to Work Order.</p>","markdown":"**Pre Visit Requirements:**\n\n1. **Download all the documents attached on the work order**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Note :** Attire: No T-Shirts, Shorts, or Jeans. Needed Collared Shirt, Button Up Shirt, Slacks, or Dress Pants are acceptable.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Onsite Mandatory Steps:**\n\n**Top priority will be to complete the M7 Marriott Mobile Key tasks within FieldNation, we ask the on-site resource verifies with us before leaving property to confirm we have the needed information within this documentation.**\n\n**CHECK IN and CHECK OUT MUST BE THROUGH M7 ENGINEER OR WORK ORDER MANAGER**\n\n1. **Onsite technician to connect with** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* **on arrival. In the event that meeting is no open please call and if phone is unanswered, please send an email to \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*****\\*\\***\n2. **Tech Needs to complete Section wise assessments (IT Vendor Site Assessment) of the property in order to assist M7 with evaluation of current Key System.**\n3. **Tech to follow PDF form showing the requested questions with more details on information to gather. Must be able to follow step-by-step guide provided.**\n4. **Tech needs to Answer questions provided on \"Providers Custom Fields\" From Section A - Section F**\n5. **Technician to also provide pictures of each section requirement following guidelines from Site Survey Checklist.**\n6. **Technician to complete deliverables by taking photos of the location in areas such as the Front Desk, MDF, IDF, and any offices that include networking equipment and Key related items. (Tasks list below pictures required)**\n\nIf there are any questions and/or concerns that the property may reflect to the technician, please refer them to the Work Order Manager for discussion. M7 is ONLY completing the items that are requested on the PDF and Provider Custom Field Questions.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Required Equipment**\n\n- Laptop with internet access\n- Digital camera or cell phone with clear picture capability\n- Basic networking Tool Kit\n- Cable Toner\n- Flashlight\n- Basic Networking Tools\n\n**Escalation Path** - Contact Project Manager, Work Order Manager, or Project Engineer\n\n**Additional Hours and expenses** - All expenses must include receipts and any overage in hours must have prior written approval from Project Manager.\n\n**Deliverables** - FieldNation technician to provide all pictures required in Tasks list and Provider Custom Fields. Onsite technician to also gather information related to IT Assessment Form attached to Work Order.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-15T11:00","end":"2026-09-15T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":220,"max":220},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":56},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $220 is below minimum threshold $250"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-18T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-Th