{"job":{"id":19874784,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Reinstall  pin pads and new brackets on the xerox self serve printer","description":{"html":"<p>Call command center once onsite.</p>\n<p>Scope of Work:</p>\n<p>Reinstall pin pads and new brackets on the xerox self serve printer. Brackets may be in top drawer of xerox self serve printer. Use Staples pin pad replacement guide</p>\n<p>IF BRACKETS ARE NOT FOUND BY MOD, THEY SHOULD BE IN TOP DRAWER OF PRINTER.</p>\n<p><strong>Required tools</strong></p>\n<p><strong> Torx T-15 Security bit</strong></p>\n<p><strong> Number 1 Phillips screwdriver&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>Call command center with serial number and tracking information.</p>\n<p>Letter of Authorization Shyft Global doc. Is needed to be able to perform task.</p>\n<p><strong>***NOTE***</strong> Please check the Confidential Information section for PM and Help Desk / Command Center numbers.</p>\n<p><strong>DO NOT</strong> leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Especially if you are requesting something...instead, give us a call.</p>\n<p><strong>Please do not request a schedule change. Schedule change requests cannot be accommodated. If you are not able to make it to the site as scheduled. Please Report a Problem within the work order and remove yourself.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Travel must be requested prior to assignment by counteroffer or by speaking with us., or it will be declined.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Please message any rate counter offers, but do not request bundle as-is unless you are in agreement with the rate and schedule</strong></p>","markdown":"Call command center once onsite.\n\nScope of Work:\n\nReinstall pin pads and new brackets on the xerox self serve printer. Brackets may be in top drawer of xerox self serve printer. Use Staples pin pad replacement guide\n\nIF BRACKETS ARE NOT FOUND BY MOD, THEY SHOULD BE IN TOP DRAWER OF PRINTER.\n\n**Required tools**\n\n