\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\n\n**REQUIREMENTS**\n\n- **Dress code**-- Casual business attire, including**COLLARED SHIRT (WITHOUT LOGOS)**, jeans, and comfortable shoes during the entire installation process. **UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD: hats, baggy jeans, open-toed shoes, fatigues, or sweat suits be worn.** Clothes must be worn in a professional manner, neatly pressed and tidy.\n- **NCR Voyix identification badge** must be worn and visible at all times.\n- Work Order MUST BE fully completed while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (**Smartphone**)\n\n**YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS**\n\n- **• Cordless Electric Drill – Very important**\n- **• Box cutter with new blades – Important**\n- **• Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-function screwdriver with multiple tips is preferred. - Important**\n- **• 11/32 nut driver – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" socket with extension – Important**\n- **• 8mm socket - Important**\n- **• Needle nose and regular pliers – Important**\n- **• Diagonal cutters - Important**\n- **• 10\" crescent wrench – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" open-ended combination wrench – Important**\n- **• Cable ties – Important**\n- **• Complete socket set – Needed**\n- **Packing Tape**\n\n**ESCALATION PATH**\n\n- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**CANCELLATION POLICY**\n\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site in the first hour: 50% to the tech\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site after the first hour: 100% to the tech","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T20:30","end":"2026-09-24T30:30"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":450},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":10,"distance":57},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No in-hours counter slot available\nRequested: Thu, Sep 24, 8:30 PM\nChecked: Thu, Sep 24, Fri, Sep 25, Mon, Sep 28 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-18T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974873-1820 at Centennial-EPIK Survey Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco C9300 switches"},{"start":"2026-09-14T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Service Ticket #218916 - Audio | 3rd Party AMP | Amplifier & Speaker Upgrade"},{"start":"2026-09-11T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-11T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"SMALL BACKBOARD/ DATA REMOTE INSTALL/ MUST HAVE BUTT-SET/MULTIMETER-DIS148477"},{"start":"2026-09-10T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-10T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Maintenance Kit Swap - Apex, NC"},{"start":"2026-09-04T13:30:00.000Z","end":"20