{"job":{"id":19758102,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Direct Source","title":"POS and Register Refresh- Tech 2","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Services:</u></strong></p><p>An overview of the services to be performed by the Technician include, but are not limited to:</p><ul><li>Check in with Direct Source Support Desk upon arrival at each site to check in.</li><li>Pre-Installation inventory of new hardware at the store location.</li><li>Installation of firewall grounding cable on back-office rack/switch. (select stores)</li><li>Complete back-up of PC1</li><li>Installation of HP Registers and Monitors</li><li>Installation of peripherals:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Epson Receipt Printers</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Cash Drawers</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Data Logic Flatbed Scanners</li><li>Test all register equipment with peripherals</li><li>Installation of EDA52 PDT</li><li>Installation of PC2/Thin Client in the breakroom/stockroom</li><li>Move Thin Client into breakroom/stockroom</li><li>Installation of Lexmark Laser Printer in the office</li><li>Installation of HIP printer</li><li>Testing of Thin Client and Laser Printer</li><li>&nbsp;Use a laser tape measure to measure ceiling heights in the sales floor and stockroom. Record the ceiling heights and ceiling types/materials on the SAF, and report them to the DSI Support Desk.</li><li>Clean-up of all legacy equipment and work areas need to be neat</li><li>Package all old equipment to return to Greentech or Direct Source per installation guide</li><li>Obtain a full set of deliverables per installation guide</li><li>Ensure a placard with Store Number, Date, Register Number, and Tech Name is used in all images provided</li><li>&nbsp;Check out with Direct Source Support Desk prior to leaving each site to complete a check out procedure and to record unique DSI checkout code on the SAF (voice mail is not an acceptable check out and could result in the Technician returning to the site at the Techni