{"job":{"id":19907080,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Velocity Tech Solutions","title":"Troubleshoot wall jacks","description":{"html":"<p><em>PLEASE NOTE THAT YOU ARE TO REPRESENT VTS AT ALL TIMES WHILE ONSITE.</em></p><p><strong><u>Overview:</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"> None of the network wall jacks are working.  Can we please dispatch a tech ASAP to assist with troubleshooting.  I verified they are patched into the switch but we don't get link when we plug anything in.  Plugging directly into the switch works.</span></p><p><strong><u>IT Support:</u></strong> <del>**** ********* ************</del></p><p><strong><u>ONSITE PoC:</u></strong>&nbsp;<del>******* ******** *************</del></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1. Scope of Work</strong></p><p><strong><u>The technician is responsible for performing onsite work as outlined below. All steps must be completed in the order listed unless otherwise directed by Support or the Work Order Manager.</u></strong></p><p><strong>Task Sequence:</strong></p><ol><li>Confirm scheduled work <strong>24 hours prior</strong> and again <strong>1 hour prior</strong> to site arrival.</li><li>Upon arrival, <strong>call or text the Work Order Manager</strong> to check in.</li><li><strong>Make contact with the Local Contact</strong> and confirm site access and work area.</li><li><strong>Locate required parts and equipment</strong> as outlined in the work order.</li><li>Take <strong>BEFORE photos</strong> of all work areas and existing equipment.</li><li><strong>Check in with IT Support</strong> prior to making any changes or beginning installation work.</li><li><strong>Complete the work as specified</strong> in the work order or project documentation.</li><li>Take <strong>AFTER photos</strong> of completed work.</li><li><strong>Test and verify functionality</strong> with IT Support (checkout process).</li><li><strong>Clean up</strong> all work areas and ensure no debris or packaging remains.</li><l