{"job":{"id":19932423,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"DecisionPoint Technologies Inc","title":"Retail POS Service Dispatch - Equip Swap- 'Logic Display Pole for POS01 (On-site Est. 2 hr)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>INTRODUCTION:</strong></p>\n<p>On-site visit requires tech to swap the following POS equipment with the assistance of a Helpdesk representative.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Tracking Information:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;UPS Tracking: 1za93a710140486440</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Shipping:&nbsp;&nbsp;UPS Next Day Air Saver®&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Arrival: Estimated delivery day 9/14/26 before 5PM.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Seeking technician who will present himself/herself in a professional and confident manner, with solid hands-on experience in installation, maintenance and repair of Retail/POS and networking equipment. Ability to effectively resolve customer questions and issues.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>REQUIRED EQUIPMENT:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cable Tester</li>\n<li>Cordless impact driver or drill</li>\n<li>Screwdriver Set</li>\n<li>Velcro wraps / Velcro fasteners</li>\n<li>Patch Cable 5ft</li>\n<li>Label maker and wrapping tape</li>\n<li>Datavac or Compressed Air</li>\n<li>Working laptop with Console Cable</li>\n<li>Working cell phone with clear photo capability</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>OVERVIEW: POS Equipment Swap - Repair/Installation</strong></p>\n<p>1 - TEXT <del>*************</del> Project Coordinator to check-in upon arrival. See Confidential Information section for phone number.</p>\n<p>2 - Ask for Store Manager when you arrive to:<strong><em>NAUTICA</em></strong></p>\n<p>2a - Review with him/her the scope of your visit: Install replacement POS equipment</p>\n<p>2b - Request the POS replacement equipment shipped to the store - POS01 'Logic Display Pole</p>\n<p>3 - Call the<del>**************</del> POS Technical Assistance Queue<del>*</del> <strong><del>************</del></strong><del>******</del> Option 2, option 6 for Nautica for On-site Technical Assistance&nbsp;providing ticket#INC02316482&nbsp;for onsite instructions.</p>\n<p>4 - Install replacement equipment and run test transactions on registers/POS devices to confirm working properly.</p>\n<p>5 - Package up old equip, put the provided UPS / FedEx return label on the box and it hand-off to store mgr / associate. Request her/him to call UPS (800-PICK-UPS or&nbsp;800-742-5877) to request a store pick-up for the equip return.</p>\n<p>6a - FINAL STEPS - Capture store manager/associate signature after register/POS test transaction(s) are confirmed and working properly.</p>\n<p>6b - FINAL STEPS - FINAL STEPS - Upload photos of newly install POS equipment and/or items worked on during store visit.</p>\n<p>7 - TEXT <del>*************</del> Project Coordinator to close-out and be released from the site. See Confidential Information section for phone number.</p>","markdown":"**INTRODUCTION:**\n\nOn-site visit requires tech to swap the following POS equipment with the assistance of a Helpdesk representative.\n\n**Tracking Information:**\n\n **UPS Tracking: 1za93a710140486440**\n\n **Shipping: UPS Next Day Air Saver®**\n\n **Arrival: Estimated delivery day 9/14/26 before 5PM.**\n\nSeeking technician who will present himself/herself in a professional and confident manner, with solid hands-on experience in installation, maintenance and repair of Retail/POS and networking equipment. Ability to effectively resolve customer questions and issues.\n\n**REQUIRED EQUIPMENT:**\n\n- Cable Tester\n- Cordless impact driver or drill\n- Screwdriver Set\n- Velcro wraps / Velcro fasteners\n- Patch Cable 5ft\n- Label maker and wrapping tape\n- Datavac or Compressed Air\n- Working laptop with Console Cable\n- Working cell phone with clear photo capability\n\n**OVERVIEW: POS Equipment Swap - Repair/Installation**\n\n1 - TEXT \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Project Coordinator to check-in upon arrival. See Confidential Information section for phone number.\n\n2 - Ask for Store Manager when you arrive to:***NAUTICA***\n\n2a - Review with him/her the scope of your visit: Install replacement POS equipment\n\n2b - Request the POS replacement equipment shipped to the store - POS01 'Logic Display Pole\n\n3 - Call the\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* POS Technical Assistance Queue\\* **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Option 2, option 6 for Nautica for On-site Technical Assistance providing ticket#INC02316482 for onsite instructions.\n\n4 - Install replacement equipment and run test transactions on registers/POS devices to confirm working properly.\n\n5 - Package up old equip, put the provided UPS / FedEx return label on the box and it hand-off to store mgr / associate. Request her/him to call UPS (800-PICK-UPS or 800-742-5877) to request a store pick-up for the equip return.\n\n6a - FINAL STEPS - Capture store manager/associate signature after register/POS test transaction(s) are confirmed and working properly.\n\n6b - FINAL STEPS - FINAL STEPS - Upload photos of newly install POS equipment and/or items worked on during store visit.\n\n7 - TEXT \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Project Coordinator to close-out and be released from the site. See Confidential Information section for phone number.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-15T12:00","end":"2026-09-15T14:00","latestStart":"2026-09-15T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":66,"max":132},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":66,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":35},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $132 (countered: $132) is below minimum threshold $250"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2