{"job":{"id":"6470353797","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Circa Lighting Lumana Core Device Installation","description":"<p>SCOPE OF WORK:</p><p><br></p><p>Technician required to install customer supplied pre-programmed Mini Switches \\( Lumana Core Device \\) including enough self provided patch cables for at least 6 devices if needed. Tech will also be connecting the APC to the Network.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>\\*\\* DOWNLOAD AND FOLLOW THE PROVIDED DOCUMENT\\*\\*</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Some sites require Multiple Mini Devices to be installed, please work with the Site contact for additional information.</p><p>Arrive onsite and introduce yourself to the LCON.</p><p>Contact Support Troy Roberts 346-898-3213</p><p>Locate the equipment for installation. \\( determine qty \\) </p><p><br></p><p>\\*\\* REVIEW DOCUMENT FOR INSTALLATION\\*\\*</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>\\*\\* REQUIRED TOOLS\\*\\*</p><p>Laptop \\(10/100 network card or better\\) with Ethernet port \\(or adapter\\)</p><p>Console Cable</p><p>Assorted patch cables</p><p>Velcro Straps</p><p>Phillips, Slotted and Torx bits</p><p>Basic hand tools</p><p>Label maker</p><p>Charger</p><p>Printed files attached on Workmarket Ticket</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>\\*\\* REQUIREMENTS \\*\\*</p><p>⦁ TAKE PICTURES OF EACH INSTALLED Lumana Core Device</p><p>⦁ DOCUMENT THE NAME OF SUPPORT/LCON YOU WORKED WITH</p><p>⦁ PROVIDE FULL DESCRIPTION OF WORK PERFORMED ONSITE</p><p>⦁ CLEAN UP WORK AREA </p><p>⦁ HAVE THE MANAGER ON DUTY SIGN YOUR WORK ORDER BEFOR LEAVING.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-10T11:00","end":"2026-09-10T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/10/2026, 11:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-