{"job":{"id":"3261648467","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1131123.1 HP E731 - 57.00.02","description":"<p>Customer Reference: **** 08272026 - 2 --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- **** ABM FEDERAL</p><p><br></p><p>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---</p><p><br></p><p>ETA pending parts</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.</p><p>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Initial notes: HP E731 - 57.00.02 </p><p><br></p><p>Parts Ordered: HP LJ E731 LVPS FDB Fan</p><p><br></p><p>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.</p><p>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login </p><p>techlink user name and password are the call number 1131123</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>General Instructions for All Calls-</p><p>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.</p><p>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot before replacing any parts.</p><p>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.</p><p>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.</p><p>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.</p><p>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.</p><p>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>⁠</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-01T08:00","end":"2026-09-01T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":53.6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/1/2026, 8:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-02T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-03T18:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-04T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-04T13:30:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-01T11:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-02T02:30:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-02T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso day 2"},{"start":"2026-09-03T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-03T18:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-09-18T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974873-1820 at Centennial-EPIK Survey Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco