{"job":{"id":"4391671117","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"8349100050177816 VTM (IW and HCL Tech) 9/16 1pm Hard start","description":"VTM ( Granite IW and HCL Tech) 9/6 1pm Hard start<br><br>BBR ticket number:  6870251<br><br>Required Equipment:<br><br><br>Tech will need a laptop with Windows 10 or higher, ethernet ports gig capable of speeds over 100M, and charger with admin rights to prove connectivity, a patch cord, a splitter, and a minimum of 3 filters. Cell phone, Cell phone charger, but set and Minimum of 150’ of cable. Cat5e/or higher, and Coax. <br><br>Scope of Work:<br><br><br>Tech must check in via WorkMarket <br><br>Check in with LCON<br><br><br>Locate make/model modem for CID:  8349100050177816<br><br>Check all IW from DMARC to the modem and replace as needed<br><br><br>Tech must call Granite NOC to review SOW. If tech is unable to reach a BBR rep, tech must select call back option. Broadband Repair at 844-492-2557. Option: <br><br>Provide BBR with the modem information (such as make/modem, MAC, SN and location) if missing from the ticket.<br><br><br>Confirm the modem is configured correctly <br><br>IP Type: STATIC<br>IP Address: 70.60.237.86<br>Subnet Mask: 255.255.255.252<br>Gateway: 70.60.237.85<br>DNS 1: 209.18.47.61<br><br><br><br>verify surf from modem directly wired in with customer equipment removed (either by assigning IP or via DHCP, depending on configuration)<br><br><br>Once tech confirms surf off the modem, tech must confirm their IP address by running ipconfig in cmd prompt <br><br>Tech must run 2-3 speed tests. Ping-500 “ping –n 500 8.8.8.8” <br><br>Email results: bbrepair@granitenet.com and Granite NOC tech<br><br><br>Subject: BBR/IW ticket # 6870251<br><br>After work is complete, tech must locate customer equipment and reconnect to the modem.<br><br><br>Tech must remain onsite while Granite NOC confirms services with customer contact <br>HCL NOC - 4083287792 <br>Internal ticket INC8115606<br><br>Tech must clean up, complete close-outs, and check out via WorkMarket.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00","end":"2026-09-16T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":18.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":260,"estHours":4,"travelExpense":40,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974873-1820 at Centennial-EPIK Survey Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco C9300 switches"},{"start":"2026-09-14T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Service Ticket #218916 - Audio | 3rd Party AMP | Amplifier & Speaker Upgrade"},{"start":"2026-09-11T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-11T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"SMALL BACKBOARD/ DATA REMOTE INSTALL/ MUST HAVE BUTT-SET/MULTIMETER-DIS148477"},{"start":"2026-09-10T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-10T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Maintenance Kit Swap - Apex, NC"},{"start":"2026-09-04T13:30: