{"job":{"id":19944574,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"PNC - Network Upgrade - Delivery Receipt","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Pre Installation and Delivery Technician</u></strong></p><p>WWT has been contracted to assist in the deployment of new standardized network stacks at PNC Bank facilities in North America. The overall solution includes two separated processes: (a) LVV and (b) the Installation Cut-Over.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>There is a material delivery that takes place on the day of installation.</p><p><strong><u>Please be onsite the entire time of the visit, due to multiple deliveries.</u></strong></p><p>You are required to be onsite from 1pm to 4pm to supervise any delivery, document what was delivered, and take pictures of the existing network room.</p><p><strong><u>There will NOT be a bridge, instead we will have to answer some questions in Field Nation.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Be onsite for the delivery and collect basic information from the site.</strong> Including detailed photos of the network room.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>IMPORTANT / CRITICAL: NO NETWORK OUTAGES ARE ALLOWED. </strong></p><p>DO NOT touch the rack or step on any cables. Do not move cables, this is just a picture survey</p><p><strong><u>Technicians Expectations:</u></strong></p><ul><li>·Photos of completed delivery showing all boxes neatly stacked</li><li>MIN of 8<strong> WIDE ANGLE pictures </strong>of the network room, showing walls, plugs, and network rack. Go to 4 corners and take pictures toward the rack, and 4 pictures from the rack to the walls showing ceiling to floor. If this cannot be accomplished, please take multiple pictures.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Upload these picture to this work order.</strong></p><p><strong>A fixed rate is a fixed rate, we do not accept counteroffers, and we do not allow substitutions.</strong></p>","markdown":"**Pre Installation and Delivery Technician**\n\nWWT has been contracted to assist in the deployment of new standardized network stacks at PNC Bank facilities in North America. The overall solution includes two separated processes: (a) LVV and (b) the Installation Cut-Over.\n\nThere is a material delivery that takes place on the day of installation.\n\n**Please be onsite the entire time of the visit, due to multiple deliveries.**\n\nYou are required to be onsite from 1pm to 4pm to supervise any delivery, document what was delivered, and take pictures of the existing network room.\n\n**There will NOT be a bridge, instead we will have to answer some questions in Field Nation.**\n\n**Be onsite for the delivery and collect basic information from the site.** Including detailed photos of the network room.\n\n**IMPORTANT / CRITICAL: NO NETWORK OUTAGES ARE ALLOWED.**\n\nDO NOT touch the rack or step on any cables. Do not move cables, this is just a picture survey\n\n**Technicians Expectations:**\n\n- ·Photos of completed delivery showing all boxes neatly stacked\n- MIN of 8 **WIDE ANGLE pictures** of the network room, showing walls, plugs, and network rack. Go to 4 corners and take pictures toward the rack, and 4 pictures from the rack to the walls showing ceiling to floor. If this cannot be accomplished, please take multiple pictures.\n\n**Upload these picture to this work order.**\n\n**A fixed rate is a fixed rate, we do not accept counteroffers, and we do not allow substitutions.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00","end":"2026-09-28T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 is below minimum threshold $350"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10