{"job":{"id":19944426,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Eye Catch","title":"Troubleshoot HDMI Splitters","description":{"html":"<p><strong>**PLEASE CALL 9546366095 WHEN ARRIVING SITE**</strong></p><p><strong>**IT’S MANDATORY TO DOWNLOAD AND INSTALL WHATSAPP MESSENGER ON THE PHONE, WE SEND MESSAGES THROUGH A WHATSAPP GROUP**</strong></p><p><strong>**PLEASE TAKE PICTURES OF ALL THE TASKS BEING MADE**</strong></p><p><strong>**IMPORTANT TAKE PICTURES OF ALL TASKS**</strong></p><p><strong>**CALL 9546366095 WHEN ARRIVING SITE**</strong></p><p>Some TVs that are connected to each other with a splitter are experiencing glitching and flickering; we believe this is due to the HDMI splitter or the HDMI cables. please troubleshoot and solve issues.</p><p><strong>Tasks:</strong></p><ol><li>Check the connections between the TVS and the splitter.</li><li>Check the HDMI cords to find issues.</li><li>test all devices and troubleshoot</li></ol><p><strong>Tools needed: Ladder, laptop. HDMI cables</strong></p><p><strong>***Provider assigned must send progress pictures &amp; videos by SMS to the EYECATCH TEAM*****</strong></p><p><strong>**CALL 954-636-5366 BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE**</strong></p><p><strong>**IMPORTANT TAKE PICTURES OF ALL TASKS**</strong></p><p><strong>**PLEASE CALL 954-636-5366 BEFORE LEAVING SITE**</strong></p><p><strong>**PLEASE TAKE PICTURES OF ALL THE TASKS BEING MADE**</strong></p><p><strong>PLEASE ARRIVE ON SITE AT THE PROPOSED TIME.</strong></p>","markdown":"**\\*\\*PLEASE CALL 9546366095 WHEN ARRIVING SITE\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*IT’S MANDATORY TO DOWNLOAD AND INSTALL WHATSAPP MESSENGER ON THE PHONE, WE SEND MESSAGES THROUGH A WHATSAPP GROUP\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*PLEASE TAKE PICTURES OF ALL THE TASKS BEING MADE\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*IMPORTANT TAKE PICTURES OF ALL TASKS\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*CALL 9546366095 WHEN ARRIVING SITE\\*\\***\n\nSome TVs that are connected to each other with a splitter are experiencing glitching and flickering; we believe this is due to the HDMI splitter or the HDMI cables. please troubleshoot and solve issues.\n\n**Tasks:**\n\n1. Check the connections between the TVS and the splitter.\n2. Check the HDMI cords to find issues.\n3. test all devices and troubleshoot\n\n**Tools needed: Ladder, laptop. HDMI cables**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Provider assigned must send progress pictures & videos by SMS to the EYECATCH TEAM\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*CALL 954-636-5366 BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*IMPORTANT TAKE PICTURES OF ALL TASKS\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*PLEASE CALL 954-636-5366 BEFORE LEAVING SITE\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*PLEASE TAKE PICTURES OF ALL THE TASKS BEING MADE\\*\\***\n\n**PLEASE ARRIVE ON SITE AT THE PROPOSED TIME.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-14T15:00","end":"2026-09-14T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":120},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":16},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-14T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-14T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"FN"},{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974873-1820 at Centennial-EPIK Survey Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK