</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Fish tape or cable pull string (to get cables through millwork)</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Crossover cable &ndash; Specifically required; techs were reminded to bring one, and pink patch cables in PNC branches were identified as crossover cables</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rollover cable &ndash; Explicitly called out alongside crossover cables as required inventory</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">RJ45 crossover adapter (male&ndash;female red adapterPNC - LVT Template Update: ) &ndash; Mentioned as a small adapter that comes with switches/routers and should be available if included in care packs</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Power over Ethernet (PoE) switch &ndash; Required to power access points during testing and wipe activities</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">PoE injector &ndash; Identified as an alternative if a PoE switch is not available</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Windows laptop computer &ndash; Required software including PuTTY</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">﻿</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lead Technician per-site equipment and supplies</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2' x 4' fire-rated plywood for wall cabinet backer board</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mounting hardware such as</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2\" wood screws for mounting on wood studs</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3/16\" or 1/4\" toggle bolts or \"zip-its\" for mounting the board on a hollow wall</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Masonry screw kit for mounting on block walls</span></li></ul>","markdown":"**IMPORTANT:** REVIEW ALL EQUIPMENT LISTED IN THIS SCOPE, IN