 PoE switch is not available\n- Windows laptop computer – Required software including PuTTY\n\n﻿\n\n **Lead Technician per-site equipment and supplies**\n\n- 2' x 4' fire-rated plywood for wall cabinet backer board\n- Mounting hardware such as\n- 2\" wood screws for mounting on wood studs\n- 3/16\" or 1/4\" toggle bolts or \"zip-its\" for mounting the board on a hollow wall\n- Masonry screw kit for mounting on block walls","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-28T16:30","end":"2026-09-28T26:30"},"payRange":{"min":500,"max":500},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":10,"distance":15},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"fixed","counterRate":60,"baseAmount":600,"estHours":10,"travelExpense":35,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974873-1820 at Centennial-EPIK Survey Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco C9300 switches"},{"start":"2026-09-14T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T14:00:00.