{"job":{"id":"4668308588","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Kinettix","title":"FSDP-2617-269375: 2 Techs | Screen Replacement @McDonalds | Hard Start!","description":"<p><strong><u>***KINETTIX IS A FAST FUND APPROVED VENDOR</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>***THIS TICKET HAS A HARD START DATE/TIME. RESCHEDULE REQUESTS WITH LESS THAN 24HRS NOTICE WILL RESULT TO THE CANCELLATION OF THE TICKET.</u></strong></p><p><em><u>The Tech must call KINETTIX DISPATCH TEAM&nbsp;upon arrival and before leaving the site.</u></em></p><p><strong><u>Failure to do so will result in the tech or work order NOT be paid.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>WORK DESCRIPTION: Techs go onsite with crimping tools, Samsung remote control, and bring Spare HDMI cables. We need to replace the 6 screens on the ODMB. We need to set up all the connections and make sure that the screen is connected to the network. Set the screen up with Device ID 1 and set up the auto source switching. Check the cable connections. Please make sure to install the screens completely aligned, with no tilts or gaps between them, and check the power, source, and Ethernet connections. The RS232 cable is correctly placed. Verify the cables are not physically damaged and re-crimp them or re-end the cables if necessary. Check the Device ID that needs to be set to 0 for Stratacache's media players and 1 for Coates MP's. Auto switch sourcing ON and set to HDMI 1 and 2 for the screens, make sure to have the devices displaying content properly. Call Coates 1 (866) 963-0770 for check-in and checkout procedures. Please share pictures of the screen with the content, with the right device ID and the right auto switch source settings, and lastly, a picture of the cable connections in the back of the screens to ensure the cables are correct. Make sure to leave the area clear of any debris left from the installation. Network settings IP/Subnet: 192.168.92.0/23 Gateway: 192.168.92.1 DNS: 208.67.222.222 208.67.220.220 Subnet Mask: 255.255.254.0 Screen Device ID: 1 VLAN: 492 Please keep in mind that additional troubleshooting may be required.</p><p>Expected time on site (Additional troubleshooting steps and additional on site may be required): 4</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>REMINDER: tech must secure a release code before checking out from the site.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>SCREEN REPLACEMENTS SOW ONLY</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>•&nbsp;Old Screens that are replaced must be boxed up in the packaging the new screen came in and turned over to the&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;manager on duty.&nbsp;No exceptions to this.&nbsp;Photo of old screens boxed up inside the building are required for release</p><ul><li>under no circumstances is a tech to remove or dispose of a screen.&nbsp;Even if Coates and/or the Manager on duty requests removal of old screen</li><li>must collect photo of old Serial Number and the Serial Number of the newly installed screen</li><li>must provide photo of replaced screen at the location that they leave onsite. it is McD or Coates responsibilities to dispose of it</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Presell 210 lane 1 SN 0CM1HNTN600267E</p><p><strong>Required Tech: 2 Techs</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools: </strong>Basic tools,<strong> </strong>9mm socket, Allen Tools, needle nose pliers, security T40 and security T20 bit, deep socket kit, Adjustable Wrench capable of 1/2”-1” sizes, Cones/Safety Cones.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Parts Shipped: </strong>FEDEX FREIGHT 300431866883</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>\"All parts requested for installation must be completed as requested unless specifically requested otherwise by Coates Support. Under no other circumstance should it be determined that parts requested for installation are not necessary\"</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Note:</em></strong><em> Please take before and after photos and give a short summary of the work done.</em></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"star