{"job":{"id":19945791,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Intelisite, LLC","title":"Server and Switch Install - Greensboro","description":{"html":"<p>Scope of Work</p><p>The onsite technician will provide hands-on installation assistance for a new video management server and switch, support the remote deployment team during system commissioning.</p><p><strong>Primary Responsibilities</strong>:</p><p>•\tMount and secure the provided server in the equipment rack. If no rack is available, place the server securely on an appropriate shelf or other approved location.</p><p>•\tConnect the server to the designated network switch and verify proper power and network connectivity.</p><p>•\tEnsure the server has access to the site's camera network.</p><p>•\tAssist with moving or reconnecting camera network connections to the new switching infrastructure, if required.</p><p>•\tRemain onsite while our remote engineering team connects to the server to perform system configuration.</p><p><strong>During Remote Configuration, the Technician May Be Asked To</strong>:</p><p>•\tVerify physical network connections.</p><p>•\tReconnect or move Ethernet cables as directed.</p><p>•\tConfirm camera link lights and switch port activity.</p><p>•\tAssist with basic troubleshooting if cameras or network devices are not communicating.</p><p>•\tVerify internet connectivity for cloud services.</p><p>•\tConfirm camera video is being received after onboarding.</p><p>•\tPerform basic validation of remote access and camera operation as directed by the remote engineer.</p><p>The technician should plan to remain onsite until the remote engineering team confirms that installation and commissioning have been successfully completed.</p>","markdown":"Scope of Work\n\nThe onsite technician will provide hands-on installation assistance for a new video management server and switch, support the remote deployment team during system commissioning.\n\n**Primary Responsibilities**:\n\n• Mount and secure the provided server in the equipment rack. If no rack is available, place the server securely on an appropriate shelf or other approved location.\n\n• Connect the server to the designated network switch and verify proper power and network connectivity.\n\n• Ensure the server has access to the site's camera network.\n\n• Assist with moving or reconnecting camera network connections to the new switching infrastructure, if required.\n\n• Remain onsite while our remote engineering team connects to the server to perform system configuration.\n\n**During Remote Configuration, the Technician May Be Asked To**:\n\n• Verify physical network connections.\n\n• Reconnect or move Ethernet cables as directed.\n\n• Confirm camera link lights and switch port activity.\n\n• Assist with basic troubleshooting if cameras or network devices are not communicating.\n\n• Verify internet connectivity for cloud services.\n\n• Confirm camera video is being received after onboarding.\n\n• Perform basic validation of remote access and camera operation as directed by the remote engineer.\n\nThe technician should plan to remain onsite until the remote engineering team confirms that installation and commissioning have been successfully completed.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T09:00","end":"2026-09-25T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":59},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $195 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $350"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-