{"job":{"id":19907485,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nationwide SCS","title":"SMART HANDS - PPE NEEDED","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>MUST COMPLETE PREP TASKS UPON ASSIGNMENT AND ONSITE TASKS WHILE ONSITE FOR PAYMENT</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>NOTE - MUST PRINT SIGN OFF - NO DIGITAL SIGNATURES ALLOWED</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>SCOPE:<br />\n******************<br />\nTO BE DETERMINED:<br />\n******************<br />\n1. Is new UPS on site<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n*******************<br />\nSMART HANDS<br />\n*******************<br />\n<br />\nProvide project scheduling, labor and materials to:<br />\n<br />\n* Check In with Technical Contact<br />\n* Assist site in moving PDU from old UPS to the new UPS. Call Technical Contact before proceeding with any disconnections.<br />\n<br />\n(1) Look at LCD screen of UPS. Select option to provide power to all outlets.<br />\n(2) Once confirmed UPS has power, move current PDU from being plugged to old PDU to plug into this new UPS.<br />\n<br />\n* Check out with Technical Contact<br />\n* Obtain physical sign off from Local Contact<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n******************<br />\nPPE REQUIREMENTS<br />\n******************<br />\n- STEEL TOE BOOTS<br />\n- HIGH VIZ VEST<br />\n- EYE PROTECTION (safety glasses)<br />\n- HARD HAT<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n******************<br />\nPROJECT NOTES:<br />\n******************<br />\n* Any Old Equipment if removed should be left with Local Contact.<br />\n* Equipment Requirements: (Laptop, Console, WiFi, Cable Tester, etc)<br />\n* Lift Required: Unknown<br />\n* Reference picture found in floor plan (no actual floor plan showing where work is to be done)<br />\n<br />\n******************************************************<br />\nPROJECT DELIVERABLES - REQUIRED FOR PAYMENT<br />\n******************************************************<br />\n* Paper sign off from LCON for each trip<br />\n* Picture (labeled “Before” &amp; “After”) of Rack<br />\n* Picture (labeled “Before” &amp; “After”) of Work</strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>ARRIVAL TIME</u></strong></p>\n<p>Please note that a 10% penalty will be applied to labor if technician assigned is more than 15 minutes late.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</u></strong></p>\n<p>Only One Technician is authorized to go onsite unless otherwise noted and approved through FN Messaging OR in FN WORK ORDER TITLE**</p>\n<p>Any technician swaps must be completed through FN. Service Companies MUST assign the actual tech showing up to site.</p>\n<p>All logged time must match customer signoffs.</p>\n<p>ALL communications regarding this service call should be summarized in FN Messaging if text or phone calls occur.</p>\n<p>Tech must bring all necessary tools to complete scope of work and is to supply materials needed for this job - reimbursement pricing spreadsheet is attached to ticket.</p>\n<p>All lifts will be scheduled and confirmed for specific days. If technicians do not arrive on time adding rental time, do not show for work order on lift rental days or have to reschedule without 24 hours notice, it is agreed lift rental charges will be deducted from work order pay.</p>\n<p><strong><u>PAYMENT TERMS</u></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Work orders will be approved for payment on Fridays before 1PM Eastern, if in work done status by COB Thursday and all deliverables have been completed/uploaded.&nbsp;If WO was not closed with deliverables within 48 hours of service a 10% penalty reduction may apply.</p>\n<p>All logged time must match customer signoffs.</p>\n<p>If customer signed sign off sheet is not completed, there will be a delay of up to 21 days for payment, pending acceptance from customer.</p>\n<p>Logout Code from PM required prior to leaving site for payment.</p>\n<p>If \"PROJECT DELIVERABLES\" are not uploaded while onsite a penalty of up to 30% may be deducted from pay if not received within 48 hours.</p>","markdown":"**MUST COMPLETE PREP TASKS UPON ASSIGNMENT AND ONSITE TASKS WHILE ONSITE FOR PAYMENT**\n\n**NOTE - MUST PRINT SIGN OFF - NO DIGITAL SIGNATURES ALLOWED**\n\n**SCOPE:  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \nTO BE DETERMINED:  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \n1\\. Is new UPS on site  \n  \n  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \nSMART HANDS  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \n  \nProvide project scheduling, labor and materials to:  \n  \n\\* Check In with Technical Contact  \n\\* Assist site in moving PDU from old UPS to the new UPS. Call Technical Contact before proceeding with any disconnections.  \n  \n(1) Look at LCD screen of UPS. Select option to provide power to all outlets.  \n(2) Once confirmed UPS has power, move current PDU from being plugged to old PDU to plug into this new UPS.  \n  \n\\* Check out with Technical Contact  \n\\* Obtain physical sign off from Local Contact  \n  \n  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \nPPE REQUIREMENTS  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \n\\- STEEL TOE BOOTS  \n\\- HIGH VIZ VEST  \n\\- EYE PROTECTION (safety glasses)  \n\\- HARD HAT  \n  \n  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \nPROJECT NOTES:  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \n\\* Any Old Equipment if removed should be left with Local Contact.  \n\\* Equipment Requirements: (Laptop, Console, WiFi, Cable Tester, etc)  \n\\* Lift Required: Unknown  \n\\* Reference picture found in floor plan (no actual floor plan showing where work is to be done)  \n  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \nPROJECT DELIVERABLES - REQUIRED FOR PAYMENT  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \n\\* Paper sign off from LCON for each trip  \n\\* Picture (labeled “Before” & “After”) of Rack  \n\\* Picture (labeled “Before” & “After”) of Work**\n\n**ARRIVAL TIME**\n\nPlease note that a 10% penalty will be applied to labor if technician assigned is more than 15 minutes late.\n\n**TERMS & CONDITIONS**\n\nOnly One Technician is authorized to go onsite unless otherwise noted and approved through FN Messaging OR in FN WORK ORDER TITLE\\*\\*\n\nAny technician swaps must be completed through FN. Service Companies MUST assign the actual tech showing up to site.\n\nAll logged time must match customer signoffs.\n\nALL communications regarding this service call should be summarized in FN Messaging if text or phone calls occur.\n\nTech must bring all necessary tools to complete scope of work and is to supply materials needed for this job - reimbursement pricing spreadsheet is attached to ticket.\n\nAll lifts will be scheduled and confirmed for specific days. If technicians do not arrive on time adding rental time, do not show for work order on lift rental days or have to reschedule without 24 hours notice, it is agreed lift rental charges will be deducted from work order pay.\n\n**PAYMENT TERMS**\n\nWork orders will be approved for payment on Fridays before 1PM Eastern, if in work done status by COB Thursday and all deliverables have been completed/uploaded. If WO was not closed with deliverables within 48 hours of service a 10% penalty reduction may apply.\n\nAll logged time must match customer signoffs.\n\nIf customer signed sign off sheet is not completed, there will be a delay of up to 21 days for payment, pending acceptance from customer.\n\nLogout Code from PM required prior to leaving site for payment.\n\nIf \"PROJECT DELIVERABLES\" are not uploaded while onsite a penalty of up to 30% may be deducted from pay if not received within 48 hours.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T11:00","end":"2026-09-16T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":68},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $140) is below minimum threshold $250"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974873-1820 at Centennial-EPIK Survey Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco C9300 switches"},{"start":"2026-09-14T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Service Ticket #218916 - Audio | 3rd Party AMP | Amplifier & Speaker Upgrade"},{"start":"2026-09-11T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-11T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"SMALL BACKBOARD/ DATA REMOTE INSTALL/ MUST HAVE BUTT-SET/MULTIMETER-DIS148477"},{"start":"2026-09-10T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-10T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Maintenance Kit Swap - Apex, NC"},{"start":"2026-09-04T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-05T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"DSS 9223 - Install (1) QNAP + UPS + Switch, Install (3) TP-Link Wireless Bridge, Install (3) 8 Port PoE Switch, Replace (15) Analog Cameras w/ (15) IP Cameras + Cable Runs - Lead Tech"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1789395219462}
