{"job":{"id":19949131,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Mattress Firm - Network Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p>Check-in Requirements:</p>\n<p>-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Check in with Simplify 877-467-5439 opt 4, ticket number 922972</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>While Onsite:</p>\n<p>-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed</p>\n<p>-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW</p>\n<p>-Tech support: Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>SOW: Need tech on site to help trouble shoot primary connection issues. Tech will need to verify cabling and reboot equipment. Please have the tech call Simplify.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tech must bring a laptop to test connectivity at the carrier modem.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Simplify - 877-467-5439 opt 4</p>\n<p>Simplify ticket – 922972</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Checkout Requirements:</p>\n<p>-Check out with Simplify, 877-467-5439 opt 4</p>\n<p>-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Tech must document store manager's name and Simplify support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout</p>\n<p>-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Required Tools:</p>\n<p>-Basic Cabling Tools</p>\n<p>-Butt set</p>\n<p>-Cable toner</p>\n<p>-Cable Tester</p>\n<p>-Label Maker</p>\n<p>-CAT 6 cabling</p>\n<p>-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends</p>\n<p>-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights</p>","markdown":"Check-in Requirements:\n\n-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1\n\n-Check in with Simplify 877-467-5439 opt 4, ticket number 922972\n\nWhile Onsite:\n\n-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed\n\n-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW\n\n-Tech support: Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite\n\nSOW: Need tech on site to help trouble shoot primary connection issues. Tech will need to verify cabling and reboot equipment. Please have the tech call Simplify.\n\nTech must bring a laptop to test connectivity at the carrier modem.\n\nSimplify - 877-467-5439 opt 4\n\nSimplify ticket – 922972\n\nCheckout Requirements:\n\n-Check out with Simplify, 877-467-5439 opt 4\n\n-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1\n\n-Tech must document store manager's name and Simplify support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout\n\n-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out\n\nRequired Tools:\n\n-Basic Cabling Tools\n\n-Butt set\n\n-Cable toner\n\n-Cable Tester\n\n-Label Maker\n\n-CAT 6 cabling\n\n-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends\n\n-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-15T11:00","end":"2026-09-15T13:00","latestStart":"2026-09-15T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z",