{"job":{"id":19948182,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Torch Networks","title":"FS// #6029 - Raleigh, NC | Site Pre-Walk for Cameras","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Purpose:</strong></p><p>Conduct a detailed site readiness inspection for low voltage cabling installation. This visit is critical to verify construction progress, identify potential blocking issues, and gather photo documentation for planning. The technician will be guided remotely by a Torch representative and is expected to follow instructions precisely, capture and upload well-labeled photos, and present professionally onsite.</p><p><strong>Scope of Work – Fixed Format (Typically 1 Hour On-Site)</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Site Readiness Assessment</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Walk the entire site with a Torch team member on a live call</li><li><strong>Call &amp; Coordination</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Join Microsoft Teams call with Torch Networks Remote Team - Note Call will be recorded</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Follow all walkthrough guidance and relay issues in real time</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Supplied by Torch</strong></p><ul><li>Remote guide and coordination during call</li></ul>","markdown":"**Purpose:**\n\nConduct a detailed site readiness inspection for low voltage cabling installation. This visit is critical to verify construction progress, identify potential blocking issues, and gather photo documentation for planning. The technician will be guided remotely by a Torch representative and is expected to follow instructions precisely, capture and upload well-labeled photos, and present professionally onsite.\n\n**Scope of Work – Fixed Format (Typically 1 Hour On-Site)**\n\n- **Site Readiness Assessment**\n- Walk the entire site with a Torch team member on a live call\n- **Call & Coordination**\n- Join Microsoft Teams call with Torch Networks Remote Team - Note Call will be recorded\n- Follow all walkthrough guidance and relay issues in real time\n\n**Supp