{"job":{"id":"5233170211","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Flowater, Inc","title":"2x Repair FloWater Refill Station - 4579136","description":"<ul><li>Address:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/245+Lakewood+School+Road+Salemburg+NC+28385+US?entry=gmail&amp;source=g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">245 Lakewood School Road Salemburg NC 28385 US</a></li><li>Case Details: 2x Repair - Not dispensing</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Up to 2 hour on site</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download and print FloWater Services Sign Off Sheet prior to arrival. You must get name and signature of POC before leaving site.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Repair checklist:</strong></p><p><strong>1) </strong>Unplug Refill Station and plug it back in to cycle the ozonator</p><p><strong>2) </strong>After ozonator has finished it's cycle (1-2 minutes) unplug unit and replace all supplied parts</p><p><strong>3)</strong> Plug Refill Station back in and confirm the issue is resolved</p><p><strong>4) </strong>Clean inline filter on back of unit (before and after photo required)</p><p><strong>5)</strong> Clean catchment tray (photo required)</p><p><strong>6)</strong> Clean drain tank (photo required)</p><p><strong>7) </strong>Clean surfaces of Refill Station (photo required)</p><p><strong>8)</strong> Verify Refill Station is functioning properly</p><p><strong>9) </strong>Obtain name and signature of POC/manager on Sign Off Sheet (photo required)</p><p><strong>10)</strong> Dispose of old parts, boxes, and debris off site.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools required:</strong></p><p><strong>1) </strong>Disposable gloves</p><p><strong>2)</strong> Bucket (1 to 5 gallons)</p><p><strong>3)</strong> Screwdrivers (Phillips and flathead)</p><p><strong>4)</strong> Pliers (needle nose, adjustable, etc.)</p><p><strong>5)</strong> Towels</p><p><strong>6)</strong> Spray bottle (for cleaning outside surfaces)</p><p><br></p><p>This isn't a plumbing job and you'll primarily be dealing with 1/4\" polyethylene tubing and quick connect fittings. Pipe wrenches not required.</p><p><br></p><p>5 Business Day Warranty on labor - anything missed or done improperly that requires a return trip for rework</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-15T08:00","end":"2026-09-15T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":60.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974873-1820 at Centennial-EPIK Survey Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco C9300 switches"},{"start":"2026-09-14T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Device offline**See required tools**"},{"start":"2026-09-14T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Service Ticket #218916 - Audio | 3rd Party AMP | Amplifier & Speaker Upgrade"},{"start":"2026-09-04T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-05T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"DSS 9223 - Install (1) QNAP + UPS