{"job":{"id":19950925,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"URGENT - VIP SITE!! NEED DONE ASAP!! Kiosk Service - Break/Fix - Retrieve Customer Key from Camera Box","description":{"html":"<p>**KIOSK #: NS8257**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Overview:</p>\n<p>A customer key needs to be removed from the camera box.</p>\n<p>Contact Support before opening the camera box to verify status.</p>\n<p>If opened, take before/after photos, remove the key, and recalibrate both bitting and milling before running a test transaction.</p>\n<p>If the key is removed without opening the camera box, run a test transaction to confirm scanning and contact Support for confirmation.</p>\n<p>If calibrations fail, review images and escalate to TS if unresolved.</p>\n<p>Always leave the removed key with the store manager, record their name, and communicate it to Support before leaving site.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check out with SSN.</p>\n<p>SUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables**</p>\n<p>**Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app**</p>\n<p><strong>**Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site**</strong></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*KIOSK #: NS8257\\*\\*\n\nOverview:\n\nA customer key needs to be removed from the camera box.\n\nContact Support before opening the camera box to verify status.\n\nIf opened, take before/after photos, remove the key, and recalibrate both bitting and milling before running a test transaction.\n\nIf the key is removed without opening the camera box, run a test transaction to confirm scanning and contact Support for confirmation.\n\nIf calibrations fail, review images and escalate to TS if unresolved.\n\nAlways leave the removed key with the store manager, record their name, and communicate it to Support before leaving site.\n\nCheck out with SSN.\n\nSUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!\n\n\\*\\*All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app\\*\\*\n\n**\\*\\*Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-15T10:00","end":"2026-09-15T11:00","latestStart":"2026-09-15T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":105},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":65},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":36},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $105 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T18:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start