{"job":{"id":19951732,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"R3 Services","title":"Toast POS Printer and POS Line Test/Repair/Install","description":{"html":"<p>Arrive on site and identify yourself to the manager on duty as a field tech from R3 Services here to check the cellular backup internet device in the office, then call us to check in at 203-714-8021.</p><p><strong>C</strong>heck the Ethernet cable going to this device and physically inspect the line for possible issues. May need to reterminate the ends if there is an issue.</p><p>They need to be installed with immaculate cable management; absolutely nothing should be hanging out or visible/in the way. Attention to detail is a must for this job.&nbsp;Please provide the pictures before leaving the premises and confirm with the remote technician that they have been received.</p><p>Please bring:</p><ul><li>Laptop with an Ethernet adapter</li><li>Network cable tester</li><li>Tone generator and probe</li><li>RJ45 crimper and termination tools</li><li>RJ45 connectors</li><li>Spare Cat5e or Cat6 patch cables</li><li>Basic hand tools</li><li>Screwdrivers</li><li>Labeling materials</li></ul>","markdown":"Arrive on site and identify yourself to the manager on duty as a field tech from R3 Services here to check the cellular backup internet device in the office, then call us to check in at 203-714-8021.\n\n**C**heck the Ethernet cable going to this device and physically inspect the line for possible issues. May need to reterminate the ends if there is an issue.\n\nThey need to be installed with immaculate cable management; absolutely nothing should be hanging out or visible/in the way. Attention to detail is a must for this job. Please provide the pictures before leaving the premises and confirm with the remote technician that they have been received.\n\nPlease bring:\n\n- Laptop with an Ethernet adapter\n- Network cable tester\n- Tone generator and probe\n- RJ45 crimper and termination tools\n- RJ45 connectors\n- Spare Cat