{"job":{"id":19868504,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Axper","title":"Talbots 4407 - Traffic counter swap","description":{"html":"<p><strong>The job requirements and the complete scope of work and details are located in the attached document titled \"<em>Removal and Installation Guide - Talbots - STC and counter</em>\"</strong>. It is <strong>MANDATORY</strong> to read it before applying for this work order and before the start date scheduled in the work order. If the scope of work reveals itself to be different than the actual situation, while performing the work order, if you encounter any unplanned issue or if you have any question, please make sure to call <strong>Axper Support at 866-658-2360 ext. 470</strong> and an agent will answer your questions and advise you on the steps to follow.</p>\n<p><u>Do you have to run the cable:</u>&nbsp;No</p>\n<p><u>Highest ceiling height:</u>&nbsp;11ft</p>\n<p><u>Mounting height: 11ft</u></p>\n<p><u>Number of entrances:</u>&nbsp;2</p>\n<p><u>Type of ceiling:</u>&nbsp;Tiles</p>\n<p><strong><u>Make sure to bring a ladder (at least 10ft in A-frame)</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>The following summarized service description does not replace the attached scope of work document in any way.</strong></p>\n<p><u>Summary:</u> We will need a technician to swap the old 3D camera for the new Axper 3D camera (traffic counting system). It has to be mounted on the ceiling, 3-4 feet from the door, centered with the door.&nbsp;<strong>The technician will need to call Axper Support to check in and check out.</strong></p>","markdown":"**The job requirements and the complete scope of work and details are located in the attached document titled \"*Removal and Installation Guide - Talbots - STC and counter*\"**. It is **MANDATORY** to read it before applying for this work order and before the start date scheduled in the work order. If the scope of work reveals itself to be different than the actual situation, while performing the work order, if you encounter any unplanned issue or if you have any question, please make sure to call **Axper Support at 866-658-2360 ext. 470** and an agent will answer your questions and advise you on the steps to follow.\n\nDo you have to run the cable: No\n\nHighest ceiling height: 11ft\n\nMounting height: 11ft\n\nNumber of entrances: 2\n\nType of ceiling: Tiles\n\n**Make sure to bring a ladder (at least 10ft in A-frame)**\n\n**The following summarized service description does not replace the attached scope of work document in any way.**\n\nSummary: We will need a technician to swap the old 3D camera for the new Axper 3D camera (traffic counting system). It has to be mounted on the ceiling, 3-4 feet from the door, centered with the door. **The technician will need to call Axper Support to check in and check out.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-17T07:00","end":"2026-09-17T08:00"},"payRange":{"min":125,"max":275},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":125},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":75}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"blended","counterRate":125,"baseAmount":375,"estHours":1,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":125},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":125}},"counterDate":{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T18:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-1