{"job":{"id":19952859,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"WSI Project - Replace POS01 + 2 PC","description":{"html":"SCOPE SUMMARY:<br/>Follow the PROCEDURE for Check In, Replacement, Packing, Verification and Check out.<br/><br/>All Stores will be replacing POS01 (RP9) with a new Base (HP Engage Pro)<br/>Select stores will be replacing PC's with or without monitors.<br/>Select stores will be replacing 8 Port Switches<br/><br/>See Ticket Title and Confidential Information for Specific Store Scope<br/><br/>Prior to release, pictures MUST be completed for cable management.<br/><br/>REQUIRED TOOLS<br/>- Basic Tools / Smartphone<br/>- Cable tester<br/>- Toner and wand<br/>- Snips<br/>- Cordless Drill w/ Charged Battery<br/><br/>MATERIALS<br/>- (2) 3’ CAT5e Patch Cables<br/>- (2) 7’ CAT5e Patch Cables<br/><br/>**MUST SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION / SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS SECTION FOR WORK INSTRUCTIONS**","markdown":"SCOPE SUMMARY:  \nFollow the PROCEDURE for Check In, Replacement, Packing, Verification and Check out.  \n  \nAll Stores will be replacing POS01 (RP9) with a new Base (HP Engage Pro)  \nSelect stores will be replacing PC's with or without monitors.  \nSelect stores will be replacing 8 Port Switches  \n  \nSee Ticket Title and Confidential Information for Specific Store Scope  \n  \nPrior to release, pictures MUST be completed for cable management.  \n  \nREQUIRED TOOLS  \n\\- Basic Tools / Smartphone  \n\\- Cable tester  \n\\- Toner and wand  \n\\- Snips  \n\\- Cordless Drill w/ Charged Battery  \n  \nMATERIALS  \n\\- (2) 3’ CAT5e Patch Cables  \n\\- (2) 7’ CAT5e Patch Cables  \n  \n\\*\\*MUST SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION / SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS SECTION FOR WORK INSTRUCTIONS\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-22T09:00","end":"2026-09-22T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":210},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":60},"additional":{"units":3,"amount":50}},"hou