{"job":{"id":19954640,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Diagnose and Repair - Dressing Room Call Buttons & Systems","description":{"html":"<p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU **MUST** HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES. </u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>﻿</u></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><u>Require Skillset:</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">&nbsp;Low Voltage Technician</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Required On-site time/window:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Important:</strong> Techs MUST contact the Store MOD to schedule/arrange ETA - Tech MUST schedule to arrive in the AM BEFORE THE STORE OPENS (Mon-Fri - No Weekends) Technicians cannot provide service during store hours due to working in the dressing rooms at VS locations or on a Weekend due to support availability. Most sites are scheduled between Mon-Fri 9am and 10am. If customer is insisting service on Sat/Sun then you need to contact the TRG PMO Team to advise.</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Equipment:</u></strong><span style=\"color: black;\"> Dressing Room call buttons, sensor, and system at Victoria's Secret Locations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Make/Model: OTH</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Serial Number: {SRM_FN.SERIAL}</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Problem Description: </u></strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Please have Tech call James Hall 440-471-8062 to check in and for troubleshooting.  store issues button still works but needs reattached to the wall please have Tech being double sided type.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em><u>Contacts:</u></em></strong></p><p><em><u>Onsite POC/MOD Contact Information:</u> </em><strong><em>[ Source Please Fill Out ]</em></strong><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><u>TRG PMO Team:</u></p><ul><li><del>******************** **** ******************* * **********************</del></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Important Requirements</u>:</strong></p><ul><li>Tech&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;represent&nbsp;<strong>TRG</strong>&nbsp;at all times</li><li>Tech&nbsp;<strong>MUST </strong>print, in color and review/take with them to the site <span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">any provided documentation/install guides.</span></li><li>Techs <strong>MUST</strong> contact the Store MOD to schedule/arrange ETA - Tech MUST schedule to arrive in the AM BEFORE THE STORE OPENS (Mon-Fri - No Weekends) Technicians cannot provide service during store hours due to working in the dressing rooms at VS locations or on a Weekend due to support availability. Most sites are scheduled between Mon-Fri 9am and 10am. If customer is requesting service on Sat/Sun please reach out to TRG PMO Team to advised</li><li>Tech&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;check-in and check-out with TRG PMO Team</li><li>Tech&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;take BEFORE and AFTER Photos of the fixed/troubleshooting of equipment&nbsp;</li><li>Tech <strong>MUST</strong> complete Essintial Online Deliverable PRIOR to leaving site to obtain customer sign-off&nbsp;</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>Important Site Information</u>:</strong></p><ul><li>If mall security or personnel request a COI from the technician - Technician MUST contact Essintial @ <strong style=\"color: black;\">800-326-6999 </strong>to obtain/request the COI. In some cases, we may be advised upfront if a COI is needed and in this case this should be uploaded into your WO - If problem description mentions COI required and it is not posted in your WO please contact Essintial to obtain COI.</li><li>Technician MUST take with them to site a valid government issue Id</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business. Dress code is business casual; no jeans or holes. Collared or button down shirt, slacks, and nice shoes required.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">You must represent yourselves as a </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">TRG Technician</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\"> while on site/when speaking with the customer</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">Due to working in the dressing rooms at VS you are not allowed to provide service during store hours - contact site to scheduled ETA Mon-Fri in the am before store opens - most sites get scheduled between 9am and 10am but be sure to give yourself enough time onsite to provide service before store opens. Do not scheduled for Sat/Sun due to support availability. </span>If customer is insisting service on Sat/Sun then you need to contact the TRG PMO Team to advise.</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">Tech may need to work with Indyme to troubleshoot system issues. Tech is to work with James Hall prior to calling them. James will provide tech with a PO# to provide to the Indyme team.&nbsp;Tech will also need to provide Indyme team SSID#. Please see document&nbsp;</span><strong>INDYME SUPPORT SSID.pdf</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">for further details.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Onsite Troubleshooting Tips:</strong></p><ul><li>Refer to Button Troubleshooting and Lbrands Legacy Paging Troubleshooting documents and work with TRG PMO Team</li><li>For Communications Issues - First step will be to reboot the system, after a reboot if the issue is still there, then the issue is with the system board and the store may will require a new install. Technician to work with TRG PMO Team to validate this end result</li><li>For Button Lighting Issues - technician will troubleshoot and see if it's a loose wire or if the button is just broken. Technician will work with TRG PMO team to determine from there how to proceed.&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong><u>Access Requirements</u>:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Government Issued ID (Always Needed)</strong></li><li><strong>COI - certificate of insurance (On Rare Occasions - Mall Security May Request) -&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;If a technician has issues and security is asking for a COI - technician MUST contact Essintial @ <strong style=\"color: black;\">800-326-6999 </strong>to obtain</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Important Scope/Customer Information:</u></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Any changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial </span><strong style=\"color: black;\">via phone.</strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\">Parts and Support are provided by TRG PMO Team </strong></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.&nbsp;</span></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\">If additional parts are needed there will be another trip&nbsp;REQUIRED.&nbsp;You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\">If additional visits are needed - you are REQUIRED to call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</strong></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span><strong>Required Tools:</strong></p><ul><li>Basic Hand Tools</li><li>Laptop - must have an RJ45 network connection or adapter</li><li>Hot Spot</li><li>CAT5 Patch Cable&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>6ft Ladder - most stores will have one in the back&nbsp;- tech can confirm when calling to schedule eta</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Cabling Tools</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Wire Cutters</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Screwdrivers&nbsp;</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Solder Iron (if applicable)</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Electrical Tape</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Crimping Tools</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Two Sided Tape (for button install)</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Multi-Meter&nbsp;</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Rubbing Alcohol</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>GooOff - adhesive cleaner to clean off buttons</u></strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Q-Tips / Microfiber Cloth or other cleaning cloth</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Reporting Requirements:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Online Deliverable (Due back to Essintial&nbsp;PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE</strong>):</p><p><strong>Deliverable Link</strong>: https://essintial.jotform.com/251475241489968</p><ul><li>You will be asked to confirm/provide site details</li><li>You will be asked provide Store #</li><li>You will be asked to provide Essintial Subcase Number&nbsp;</li><li>You will be asked to call out how many TOTAL dressing rooms are at the store</li><li>You will be asked to upload a photo of the device BEFORE troubleshooting/fix</li><li>You will be asked to upload a photo of the device AFTER troubleshooting/fix&nbsp;</li><li>You will be asked to obtain Onsite Manager Signature</li><li>You will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverables</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Upon Arrival at site:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER&nbsp;</strong>–&nbsp;if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: black;\">800-326-6999</strong>&nbsp;to check in.&nbsp;</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Refer to provided guides/troubleshooting documents</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check-In with Store MOD - Introduce yourself as a TRG technician</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check-In with TRG PMO team upon arrival / prior to starting/doing any work</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Work with TRG PMO Team while onsite</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements (prior to leaving site):</u></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Confirm functionality with Store MOD</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Check-Out with TRG PMO Team</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Complete Essintial Online Deliverable and obtain Sign-Off from Store MOD</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out</span></li><li>Parts Return - Tech must pack decommissioned equipment in boxes from new equipment and leave onsite for Fedex/UPS Pickup&nbsp;- If you are unsure please work with TRG PMO Team</li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">If another visit is needed please make sure to contact Essintial to open another ticket/WO.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;<strong>Attachments - All guides/plans MUST be available either printed or on a laptop/tablet, something other than your mobile device as you will be on the phone a lot and will need to refer to your document at the same time</strong></p><ul><li>CLS1410 Troubleshooting Guide</li><li>CLS Radio Programming</li><li>CRS USB Update Instructions</li><li>VS Installer Checklist</li><li>VS Indyme Store FAQ Guide</li><li>Button Troubleshoot.docx (may be outdated)</li><li>Lbrands_Legacy_Paging_Troubleshooting.pdf (may be outdated)</li><li><strong>INDYME SUPPORT SSID.pdf</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong>﻿CREATE A NETWORK PROXY ON YOUR LAPTOP Rev-3.pdf</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></li></ul>","markdown":"**IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time & only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.**\n\n**YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU \\*\\*MUST\\*\\* HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES.**\n\n**﻿****Require Skillset:** Low Voltage Technician\n\n**Required On-site time/window:**\n\n**Important:** Techs MUST contact the Store MOD to schedule/arrange ETA - Tech MUST schedule to arrive in the AM BEFORE THE STORE OPENS (Mon-Fri - No Weekends) Technicians cannot provide service during store hours due to working in the dressing rooms at VS locations or on a Weekend due to support availability. Most sites are scheduled between Mon-Fri 9am and 10am. If customer is insisting service on Sat/Sun then you need to contact the TRG PMO Team to advise.\n\n**Equipment:** Dressing Room call buttons, sensor, and system at Victoria's Secret Locations\n\nMake/Model: OTH\n\nSerial Number: {SRM\\_FN.SERIAL}\n\n**Problem Description:** Please have Tech call James Hall 440-471-8062 to check in and for troubleshooting. store issues button still works but needs reattached to the wall please have Tech being double sided type.\n\n***Contacts:***\n\n*Onsite POC/MOD Contact Information:* ***\\[ Source Please Fill Out \\]***\n\nTRG PMO Team:\n\n- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Important Requirements:**\n\n- Tech **MUST** represent **TRG** at all times\n- Tech **MUST** print, in color and review/take with them to the site any provided documentation/install guides.\n- Techs **MUST** contact the Store MOD to schedule/arrange ETA - Tech MUST schedule to arrive in the AM BEFORE THE STORE OPENS (Mon-Fri - No Weekends) Technicians cannot provide service during store hours due to working in the dressing rooms at VS locations or on a Weekend due to support availability. Most sites are scheduled between Mon-Fri 9am and 10am. If customer is requesting service on Sat/Sun please reach out to TRG PMO Team to advised\n- Tech **MUST** check-in and check-out with TRG PMO Team\n- Tech **MUST** take BEFORE and AFTER Photos of the fixed/troubleshooting of equipment\n- Tech **MUST** complete Essintial Online Deliverable PRIOR to leaving site to obtain customer sign-off\n\n**Important Site Information:**\n\n- If mall security or personnel request a COI from the technician - Technician MUST contact Essintial @ **800-326-6999** to obtain/request the COI. In some cases, we may be advised upfront if a COI is needed and in this case this should be uploaded into your WO - If problem description mentions COI required and it is not posted in your WO please contact Essintial to obtain COI.\n- Technician MUST take with them to site a valid government issue Id\n- These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business. Dress code is business casual; no jeans or holes. Collared or button down shirt, slacks, and nice shoes required.\n- You must represent yourselves as a **TRG Technician** while on site/when speaking with the customer\n- Due to working in the dressing rooms at VS you are not allowed to provide service during store hours - contact site to scheduled ETA Mon-Fri in the am before store opens - most sites get scheduled between 9am and 10am but be sure to give yourself enough time onsite to provide service before store opens. Do not scheduled for Sat/Sun due to support availability. If customer is insisting service on Sat/Sun then you need to contact the TRG PMO Team to advise.\n- Tech may need to work with Indyme to troubleshoot system issues. Tech is to work with James Hall prior to calling them. James will provide tech with a PO# to provide to the Indyme team. Tech will also need to provide Indyme team SSID#. Please see document **INDYME SUPPORT SSID.pdf** for further details.\n\n**Onsite Troubleshooting Tips:**\n\n- Refer to Button Troubleshooting and Lbrands Legacy Paging Troubleshooting documents and work with TRG PMO Team\n- For Communications Issues - First step will be to reboot the system, after a reboot if the issue is still there, then the issue is with the system board and the store may will require a new install. Technician to work with TRG PMO Team to validate this end result\n- For Button Lighting Issues - technician will troubleshoot and see if it's a loose wire or if the button is just broken. Technician will work with TRG PMO team to determine from there how to proceed.\n\n **Access Requirements:**\n\n- **Government Issued ID (Always Needed)**\n- **COI - certificate of insurance (On Rare Occasions - Mall Security May Request) -**  If a technician has issues and security is asking for a COI - technician MUST contact Essintial @ **800-326-6999** to obtain\n\n**Important Scope/Customer Information:**\n\n- Any changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial **via phone.**\n- **Parts and Support are provided by TRG PMO Team**\n- If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.\n- **If additional parts are needed there will be another trip REQUIRED. You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.**\n- **If additional visits are needed - you are REQUIRED to call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.**\n- All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.\n- If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies & Procedures #6.\n\n **Required Tools:**\n\n- Basic Hand Tools\n- Laptop - must have an RJ45 network connection or adapter\n- Hot Spot\n- CAT5 Patch Cable\n- **6ft Ladder - most stores will have one in the back - tech can confirm when calling to schedule eta**\n- **Cabling Tools**\n- **Wire Cutters**\n- **Screwdrivers**\n- **Solder Iron (if applicable)**\n- **Electrical Tape**\n- **Crimping Tools**\n- **Two Sided Tape (for button install)**\n- **Multi-Meter**\n- **Rubbing Alcohol**\n- **GooOff - adhesive cleaner to clean off buttons**\n- **Q-Tips / Microfiber Cloth or other cleaning cloth**\n\n**Reporting Requirements:**\n\n**Online Deliverable (Due back to Essintial PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE**):\n\n**Deliverable Link**: <https://essintial.jotform.com/251475241489968>\n\n- You will be asked to confirm/provide site details\n- You will be asked provide Store #\n- You will be asked to provide Essintial Subcase Number\n- You will be asked to call out how many TOTAL dressing rooms are at the store\n- You will be asked to upload a photo of the device BEFORE troubleshooting/fix\n- You will be asked to upload a photo of the device AFTER troubleshooting/fix\n- You will be asked to obtain Onsite Manager Signature\n- You will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverables\n\n**Upon Arrival at site:**\n\n- **CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER** – if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @ **800-326-6999** to check in.\n- Refer to provided guides/troubleshooting documents\n- Check-In with Store MOD - Introduce yourself as a TRG technician\n- Check-In with TRG PMO team upon arrival / prior to starting/doing any work\n- Work with TRG PMO Team while onsite\n\n**Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements (prior to leaving site):**\n\n- Confirm functionality with Store MOD\n- Check-Out with TRG PMO Team\n- Complete Essintial Online Deliverable and obtain Sign-Off from Store MOD\n- Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out\n- Parts Return - Tech must pack decommissioned equipment in boxes from new equipment and leave onsite for Fedex/UPS Pickup - If you are unsure please work with TRG PMO Team\n- If another visit is needed please make sure to contact Essintial to open another ticket/WO.\n\n **Attachments - All guides/plans MUST be available either printed or on a laptop/tablet, something other than your mobile device as you will be on the phone a lot and will need to refer to your document at the same time**\n\n- CLS1410 Troubleshooting Guide\n- CLS Radio Programming\n- CRS USB Update Instructions\n- VS Installer Checklist\n- VS Indyme Store FAQ Guide\n- Button Troubleshoot.docx (may be outdated)\n- Lbrands\\_Legacy\\_Paging\\_Troubleshooting.pdf (may be outdated)\n- **INDYME SUPPORT SSID.pdf**\n- **﻿CREATE A NETWORK PROXY ON YOUR LAPTOP Rev-3.pdf**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T09:00","end":"2026-09-16T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":120},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":85},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":35}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":62},"re