{"job":{"id":"6618295377","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"06022815-RB7 100 Gaston Road-EPIK Survey","description":"DESCRIPTION: \"\"\"SOW - EPIK Single Visit Install<br>*************************************************************************************<br>Before Arrival<br>1.Call the LCON 30 minutes before arrival.<br>2.Review the EPIK install video if you are unfamiliar with EPIK:<br>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo<br>3.Arrive with all required tools and materials listed below.<br>On Arrival<br>1.Check in on WorkMarket.<br>2.Locate the customer contact and confirm the install location.<br>3.Review the Special Instructions before starting work.<br>EPIK Install Requirements<br>1.Mount the Epik device in the approve install location and EPIK 66 block or connect harmonica to RJ 21X on Epik.<br>2.If EPIK device mounting location is not in a cool, clean, secure area reach out to Activation for an updated location. <br>3.Power on the EPIK device before starting the Wizard.<br>Do not log into the Wizard until the device is powered on.<br>4.If applicable connect the EPIK device to the customer network using the information provided in the Special Instructions.<br>5.Log into the EPIK Install Wizard:<br>https://wizard.epik.io<br>6.Follow the Wizard steps and complete the installation with the assigned Activations Representative. A member of the Activations team will reach out by text once assigned.<br>DO NOT CALL INTO THE QUEUE FOR WIZARD RELATED ISSUES<br>7.If not already stated in the TNs to be wired section of your ticket, confirm with site contact if there are fire alarm, security alarm, elevator or e911 lines on site. If so, notify activations of any port configuration changes that need to be made and complete testing with the fire, security or elevator monitoring companies.<br>8.For any lines that cannot be found, complete test calls on the number and notify activations of what end device, person or monitoring service answers the call. If it is ring no answer, run a new line to a biscuit jack and label it with the new Epik number.<br>9.If any of the TNs are voice or fax lines, confirm with the site contact if they need to keep the same numbers. If so, run a line to a biscuit jack and confirm dial tone at the jack. We will complete a revisit to complete the cross connection once the port order is ready.<br>Checkout Requirement<br>1. Provide a cut sheet to activations noting the old telephone number with the new number provided by Epik for each line.<br>2.Confirm Activations has released you.<br>3.Submit all WorkMarket deliverables.<br>4.Enter the checkout code in WorkMarket.<br>5.Check out on WorkMarket.<br><br>The install is not considered valid unless the checkout code is entered in WorkMarket.<br><br>Required Deliverables<br>Submit all required deliverables in WorkMarket before checkout:<br>1.Photo of completed EPIK install.<br>2.Photo of labeled 66 block / harmonica block.<br>3.List of existing TNs and the new number that replaced each TN, if applicable.<br>4.Customer signed sign-out sheet.<br>5.Any additional deliverables listed in Special Instructions.<br><br><br>Required Tools<br>•Laptop<br>•Smartphone with hotspot<br>•Tone generator and wand<br>•66/110 punch tool<br>•Butt set<br>•       Infrared Temperature Gun <br>•Electrician scissors<br>•Step ladder<br>•Flashlight/headlamp<br>•RJ11/RJ45 crimper<br>•Ethernet cable tester<br>•Impact drill / cordless drill<br>•Masonry bits<br>•Screwdrivers / driver bits<br>•Needle-nose pliers<br>•Label maker and label tape<br>•Cat3 or better cable<br>•Cat6 Ethernet cable<br>•Cross-connect wire<br>•Gel-crimp connectors<br>•Cable ties and mounting hardware<br>•RJ11/RJ45 plugs and keystone jacks<br>•Console cables: USB to DB9 PL2303 and USB to USB-mini<br>*************************************************************************************<br><br>Special Instructions<br>Install Location<br>Enter where the EPIK device should be installed, including MDF/IDF/telco room location, wall/rack/shelf mounting instructions, and access notes.<br>________________________________________<br>Cable Runs<br>Enter any required cable runs, cable type, distance, start/end points, and whether ladder, lift, ceiling access, or special tools are needed.<br>________________________________________<br>Netwo\"","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T09:00","end":"2026-09-24T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":72.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":105,"payStructure":null},"reason":"TRAVEL_REQUIRED","rejectDetails":"Travel required (72.8mi reported + 10mi padding = 82.8mi > 20mi)"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T18:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start