{"job":{"id":19951986,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"The Looma Project","title":"The Looma Project: Offline Maintenance for Loop™ Display - Harris Teeter - 257","description":{"html":"<p><strong>WORK ORDER — LOOMA FIELD SUPPORT (HARRIS TEETER)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>⚠ PAYMENT POLICY — READ BEFORE ACCEPTING</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The payment listed on this Work Order is final upon acceptance. No additional compensation will be issued after a Work Order has been accepted.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>ALL counteroffers MUST be submitted BEFORE accepting this Work Order. Counteroffers submitted after acceptance will not be honored.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mileage/trip charge requests MUST include exact mileage driven. You are required to provide a photo from your GPS showing the exact mileage. Requests submitted without this documentation will not be processed.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Revisit rate:</strong> $60 per visit (for approved part replacement revisits only)</li>\n<li><strong>Trip charges:</strong> Reimbursed at the current IRS rate of $0.70/mile, with required GPS documentation as noted above</li>\n<li><strong>No payment will be issued if the technician does not have the required tools to complete this Work Order. Do not accept this WO if you are not properly equipped.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>⚠ CLOSEOUT REQUIREMENTS — READ BEFORE ACCEPTING</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Checkout includes a photo review of all work completed on-site. Payment will not be processed until photos have been reviewed and approved by your Work Order Manager.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Proper closeout notes are required for every Work Order. Vague or incomplete notes will delay payment.</strong></li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Your closeout notes must include:</strong>A clear description of the issue found on-site</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Each specific step taken to troubleshoot and/or resolve the issue</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">The outcome of each step</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Final resolution status (resolved, unresolved, revisit required, etc.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>❌ <strong>Not acceptable:</strong><em>\"Device was offline. Rebooted and it came back up.\"</em> ✅<strong>Acceptable:</strong><em>\"Arrived on-site and found tablet unresponsive with no display output. Checked power connection — cord was loose at the POE injector. Reseated the connection. Tablet powered on and began loading content. Confirmed content was playing on screen. Notified WO Manager and received clearance to close out.\"</em></p>\n<p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK &amp; TIME COMPENSATION</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>This Work Order covers <strong>one (1) hour of on-site work</strong>.</li>\n<li>If the work requires more than one hour, additional time will be compensated at <strong>$60 per additional hour.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Any time beyond the initial one-hour window must be pre-approved by your Work Order Manager before continuing work. Unauthorized overtime will not be compensated.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>This Work Order includes servicing all Looma devices on-site.</strong> Acceptance of this Work Order constitutes agreement to service any and all Looma devices present at this location, provided the work falls within the original one-hour window.</li>\n<li><strong>No additional charges will be approved for servicing multiple devices if the total time on-site remains within the one-hour agreed-upon window.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>WORK ORDER MANAGER AVAILABILITY</strong></p>\n<p>Monday–Friday: 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM EST Saturday–Sunday: 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM EST</p>\n<p>Contact: <strong>(866) 440-5667</strong> Email: support@theloomaproject.com</p>\n<p><strong>TOOLS REQUIRED</strong></p>\n<p>You must have all of the following before accepting this Work Order:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Cell phone with camera capabilities</li>\n<li>10' ladder</li>\n<li>Phillips head screwdriver</li>\n<li>Personal hotspot (to connect devices to Wi-Fi if needed)</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></p>\n<p>Looma operates an in-store media platform via Loop™ tablets. One or more tablets at this retail location are currently offline and cannot be remotely accessed — they must be troubleshot in person. You will receive the store address and detailed instructions to locate the offline tablet(s) and complete a predefined troubleshooting sequence. You must confirm results with a Looma representative before leaving the site.</p>\n<p><em>This Work Order may require a follow-up revisit for a simple part replacement (e.g., POE injector or power cord). Revisits are compensated at $60 per visit.</em></p>\n<p><strong>HT WORK ORDER #:</strong> INC12862831</p>\n<p><strong>PRE-ARRIVAL TASKS</strong></p>\n<p>Complete the following before arriving on-site:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Set your start time in the Field Nation platform</li>\n<li>Download and review the <strong>Offline Tablet Reference Guide</strong> (attached) and<strong>HT_Chromebox_Troubleshooting_Guide</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>STORE ENTRY PROCEDURE</strong></p>\n<p>Upon entering the store, proceed to the <strong>Customer Service Desk</strong>. Present your printable badge, disclose your affiliation with Looma, and provide the <strong>HT Work Order number</strong>. If store staff have questions or concerns, refer them to:</p>\n<p><strong>Looma Field Support Team</strong></p>","markdown":"**WORK ORDER — LOOMA FIELD SUPPORT (HARRIS TEETER)**\n\n**⚠ PAYMENT POLICY — READ BEFORE ACCEPTING**\n\n- **The payment listed on this Work Order is final upon acceptance. No additional compensation will be issued after a Work Order has been accepted.**\n- **ALL counteroffers MUST be submitted BEFORE accepting this Work Order. Counteroffers submitted after acceptance will not be honored.**\n- **Mileage/trip charge requests MUST include exact mileage driven. You are required to provide a photo from your GPS showing the exact mileage. Requests submitted without this documentation will not be processed.**\n- **Revisit rate:** $60 per visit (for approved part replacement revisits only)\n- **Trip charges:** Reimbursed at the current IRS rate of $0.70/mile, with required GPS documentation as noted above\n- **No payment will be issued if the technician does not have the required tools to complete this Work Order. Do not accept this WO if you are not properly equipped.**\n\n**⚠ CLOSEOUT REQUIREMENTS — READ BEFORE ACCEPTING**\n\n- **Checkout includes a photo review of all work completed on-site. Payment will not be processed until photos have been reviewed and approved by your Work Order Manager.**\n- **Proper closeout notes are required for every Work Order. Vague or incomplete notes will delay payment.**\n- **Your closeout notes must include:**A clear description of the issue found on-site\n- Each specific step taken to troubleshoot and/or resolve the issue\n- The outcome of each step\n- Final resolution status (resolved, unresolved, revisit required, etc.)\n\n❌ **Not acceptable:***\"Device was offline. Rebooted and it came back up.\"* ✅**Acceptable:***\"Arrived on-site and found tablet unresponsive with no display output. Checked power connection — cord was loose at the POE injector. Reseated the connection. Tablet powered on and began loading content. Confirmed content was playing on screen. Notified WO Manager and received clearance to close out.\"*\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK & TIME COMPENSATION**\n\n- This Work Order covers **one (1) hour of on-site work**.\n- If the work requires more than one hour, additional time will be compensated at **$60 per additional hour.**\n- **Any time beyond the initial one-hour window must be pre-approved by your Work Order Manager before continuing work. Unauthorized overtime will not be compensated.**\n- **This Work Order includes servicing all Looma devices on-site.** Acceptance of this Work Order constitutes agreement to service any and all Looma devices present at this location, provided the work falls within the original one-hour window.\n- **No additional charges will be approved for servicing multiple devices if the total time on-site remains within the one-hour agreed-upon window.**\n\n**WORK ORDER MANAGER AVAILABILITY**\n\nMonday–Friday: 9:00 AM – 9:00 PM EST Saturday–Sunday: 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM EST\n\nContact: **(866) 440-5667** Email: support@theloomaproject.com\n\n**TOOLS REQUIRED**\n\nYou must have all of the following before accepting this Work Order:\n\n1. Cell phone with camera capabilities\n2. 10' ladder\n3. Phillips head screwdriver\n4. Personal hotspot (to connect devices to Wi-Fi if needed)\n\n**OVERVIEW**\n\nLooma operates an in-store media platform via Loop™ tablets. One or more tablets at this retail location are currently offline and cannot be remotely accessed — they must be troubleshot in person. You will receive the store address and detailed instructions to locate the offline tablet(s) and complete a predefined troubleshooting sequence. You must confirm results with a Looma representative before leaving the site.\n\n*This Work Order may require a follow-up revisit for a simple part replacement (e.g., POE injector or power cord). Revisits are compensated at $60 per visit.*\n\n**HT WORK ORDER #:** INC12862831\n\n**PRE-ARRIVAL TASKS**\n\nComplete the following before arriving on-site:\n\n1. Set your start time in the Field Nation platform\n2. Download and review the **Offline Tablet Reference Guide** (attached) and**HT\\_Chromebox\\_Troubleshooting\\_Guide**\n\n**STORE ENTRY PROCEDURE**\n\nUpon entering the store, proceed to the **Customer Service Desk**. Present your printable badge, disclose your affiliation with Looma, and provide the **HT Work Order number**. If store staff have questions or concerns, refer them to:\n\n**Looma Field Support Team**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-15T09:00","end":"2026-09-15T10:00","latestStart":"2026-09-15T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":60},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate