{"job":{"id":"6500753149","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"IT ServicePoint, LLC","title":"Lift Check","description":"Tech is needed to:<br><br><br>    Verify lift is on site<br>    Fill out Lift Validation Form with information from the rest of the check<br>    Confirm that the lift is working properly (moves up &amp; down, can drive forward, backwards, &amp; turn)<br>    (If Electric) Drive lift closer to the store and plug it in so that it can maintain a full charge<br>    Take 1-3 pictures to make sure lift is easy to identify &amp; locate<br>    (If Electric) Take photos of battery charge level<br>    Troubleshoot any issues with the lift if it is not operable<br>    Return lift key to MOD at Customer Service Desk<br><br>Failure to obtain the required photos, troubleshoot issues, or check in/out with SP WILL result in a reduction in pay.  Flat rate assumes no more than 1 hour onsite; additional time will be added at $50/hr.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T21:00","end":"2026-09-16T25:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $50 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Danik Furniture"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.