{"job":{"id":"5041211039","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"IT ServicePoint, LLC","title":"Lift Check (26' Scissor) -Raleigh NC","description":"<p>Tech is needed to:</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p> Verify lift is on site</p><p> Fill out Lift Validation Form with information from the rest of the check</p><p> Confirm that the lift is working properly (moves up &amp; down, can drive forward, backwards, &amp; turn)</p><p> (If Electric) Drive lift closer to the store and plug it in so that it can maintain a full charge</p><p> Take 1-3 pictures to make sure lift is easy to identify &amp; locate</p><p> (If Electric) Take photos of battery charge level</p><p> Troubleshoot any issues with the lift if it is not operable</p><p> Return lift key to MOD at Customer Service Desk</p><p><br></p><p>Failure to obtain the required photos, troubleshoot issues, or check in/out with SP WILL result in a reduction in pay. Flat rate assumes no more than 1 hour onsite; additional time will be added at $50/hr.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T02:00","end":"2026-09-16T06:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $50 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Danik Furniture"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start