{"job":{"id":19956252,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TailWind Voice & Data, Inc.","title":"Inspect/Repair/Replace IP Cameras at Pumps","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Objective Statement: </strong></p><p>Inspect/clean approx. 4 pump cameras and repair/replace approx. 3 IP cameras</p><p>Will need to use a scissor lift to access exterior cameras.</p><p>• Inspect/clean the Pump Camera Domes:</p><p>-&nbsp;Pump 19</p><p>- Pump 20</p><p>- Pump 22</p><p>- Pump 23</p><p><br></p><p>• Repair/replace 3 IP camera:</p><p>- Exterior Front</p><p>- Pump 21</p><p>- Exterior Right Back</p><p><br></p><p>• Correct alignment on Exterior Front Left camera</p><p>• Repair/replace cable/connections as needed.</p><p>• Investigate/repair additional camera issue, as needed.</p><p>Check out with DVR Team </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><p>• Cat 6 bulk cabling (500')</p><p>• Cat 6 patch cables&nbsp;</p><p>• RJ45 connectors&nbsp;</p><p>• Fish Tape (min 100’)&nbsp;</p><p>• Cable Tester</p><p>• Punch tool&nbsp;</p><p>• CAT6 Crimp Connector&nbsp;</p><p>• Toner&nbsp;</p><p>• Biscuit Jack&nbsp;</p><p>• 12’ Ladder</p><p>• Standard technician tools &amp; materials based on the SOW&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required Deliverable Format: Technician will be asked to complete a specific JotForm to collect the appropriate deliverables. This is a required task.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>TailWind Requirements: </strong></p><ul><li>Tailwind will only approve the work authorized in the SOW uploaded by Tailwind in the attachments of the Field Nation order.</li><li>Technician must verify that all materials/lifts in the SOW are on-site upon arrival and report any issues to Tailwind immediately via Field Nation messages.</li><li>Any delays on-site need to be reported to Tailwind via Field Nation messages OR by calling in and speaking with someone at TailWind within 1 hour of the delay. (Document who you spoke to and gave you approval)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tailwind will not approve additional time beyond 1 hour for delays that are not reported and responded to by a Tailwind via Field Nation Messages OR phone call.</li><li>Any additional Out of Scope work needs to be requested in the Field Nation messages OR the technician calls into TailWind and gets approval to proceed.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Any verbal agreements will be be followed up with a written confirmation of next steps and approval via Field Nation messages.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Only Tailwind can approve Out of Scope work.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Objective Statement:**\n\nInspect/clean approx. 4 pump cameras and repair/replace approx. 3 IP cameras\n\nWill need to use a scissor lift to access exterior cameras.\n\n• Inspect/clean the Pump Camera Domes:\n\n\\- Pump 19\n\n\\- Pump 20\n\n\\- Pump 22\n\n\\- Pump 23\n\n• Repair/replace 3 IP camera:\n\n\\- Exterior Front\n\n\\- Pump 21\n\n\\- Exterior Right Back\n\n• Correct alignment on Exterior Front Left camera\n\n• Repair/replace cable/connections as needed.\n\n• Investigate/repair additional camera issue, as needed.\n\nCheck out with DVR Team\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n• Cat 6 bulk cabling (500')\n\n• Cat 6 patch cables\n\n• RJ45 connectors\n\n• Fish Tape (min 100’)\n\n• Cable Tester\n\n• Punch tool\n\n• CAT6 Crimp Connector\n\n• Toner\n\n• Biscuit Jack\n\n• 12’ Ladder\n\n• Standard technician tools & materials based on the SOW\n\n**Required Deliverable Format: Technician will be asked to complete a specific JotForm to collect the appropriate deliverables. This is a required task.**\n\n**TailWind Requirements:**\n\n- Tailwind will only approve the work authorized in the SOW uploaded by Tailwind in the attachments of the Field Nation order.\n- Technician must verify that all materials/lifts in the SOW are on-site upon arrival and report any issues to Tailwind immediately via Field Nation messages.\n- Any delays on-site need to be reported to Tailwind via Field Nation messages OR by calling in and speaking with someone at TailWind within 1 hour of the delay. (Document who you spoke to and gave you approval)\n- Tailwind will not approve additional time beyond 1 hour for delays that are not reported and responded to by a Tailwind via Field Nation Messages OR phone call.\n- Any additional Out of Scope work needs to be requested in the Field Nation messages OR the technician calls into TailWind and gets approval to proceed.\n- Any verbal agreements will be be followed up with a written confirmation of next steps and approval via Field Nation messages.\n- Only Tailwind can approve Out of Scope work.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T10:00","end":"2026-09-16T12:00","latestStart":"2026-09-16T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":58},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Danik Furniture"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T18:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.