{"job":{"id":"3808614581","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey","description":"DESCRIPTION: \"9194052273 fire, 9194052477 fire<br>*****************************************************************************<br>Michelle Nolan<br>*****************************************************************************<br><br>Survey SOW: SOS must match dates and times that are in WorkMarket and MUST BE SIGNED BY THE CUSTOMER (LCON)<br>1. TECH MUST CALL LCON, 30 MINUTES BEFORE ARRIVAL.<br>2. Check in and out through Work Market. For any questions during the survey, please call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at: 833-479-4768<br>3. Upon arrival, departure, and for questions about your scope of work or if you are unclear on instructions before starting the installation, check in with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479-4768, otherwise Login to EPIK Wizard at https://wizard.epik.io to begin the Survey process. When you enter the Granite ticket number it will be recognized as a survey, and you will be taken to the Survey Wizard.  (Note: If you have completed a Wizard survey or install before, please be sure to refresh your browser window to ensure the current version is being used.)<br>4. Follow all instructions presented by the Survey Wizard.  If you run into any issues or have questions you may call the TC Team.  All sections of the survey are required and will require final sign off by Granite Technical Coordinator before you will be cleared to leave the site.  The Survey Wizard will guide you through this process.<br>5. Before departure call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479- 4768 to review deliverables and receive approval on survey results.<br>6. Once your survey results have been approved by the TC Team, a TC Team representative will give you a checkout code to enter into WorkMarket which you will use to check out upon completion of the survey. Failure to chec