<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Closed-toe shoes</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ability to safely operate a pallet jack</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Completion Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To receive payment, technicians must:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete all assigned work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submit all required photographs.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the digital work order on platform **Relocation reporting application will be sent upon acceptance**</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Important Information</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Work must be completed during the scheduled service window.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Displays must be relocated only in the location approved by store management.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The work area must be left clean and free of all installation materials.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professional appearance and communication are expected at all times.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>*** Relocation Guide will be sent upon acceptance showing step-by-step instructions ***</u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT </u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>***LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE***</u></strong></p><p>https://form.fillout.com/t/rFD1NDZJkSus</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></p><br><strong><u>POLICIES AND PROCEDURES</u></strong><p><br></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. Work Order Terms &a