omer property, merchandise, fixtures, equipment, or facilities falls under Producers \"Assumption Of Risk\" (3) and must be reported to Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. Compliance with Customer Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to comply with all customer site rules, store policies, check-in procedures, and instructions provided by authorized customer representatives.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. Photographs &amp; Documentation</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to accurately complete all required documentation, photographs, signatures, and reporting before submitting this work order. Submission of false, incomplete, misleading, or altered information may result in non-payment and removal from future assignments.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Payment</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Payment is contingent upon:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Successful completion of the assigned scope of work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submission of all required documentation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Compliance with these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. Changes to Scope</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer shall not perform additional work outside the authorized scope of work from posting without prior approval from Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10. Confidentiality</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees not to disclose customer information, pricing, internal procedures, photographs, or proprietary information obtained during the course of the assignment.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">11. Insurance</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer represents that they mai