{"job":{"id":19957033,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"OHO Connect","title":"Experienced AV/Network Tech Needed","description":{"html":"<p>Need tech onsite to troubleshoot internet/tv in guestroom. Verify power, troubleshoot device, etc. </p><p><strong>Do NOT take FN work order to site, use attached PDF work order. Assigned tech should be the tech onsite unless you have prior approval; substituting a tech may result in $0 paid.</strong></p><p>Need a technician experienced with Network, Telecom and Voice/Data Cabling troubleshooting to go onsite and determine cause of customer complaint. Diagnose and repair to restore service on same trip, if possible. If parts are required, work with tech support to complete the order.</p><p><strong>Required Tools/Materials:</strong></p><p>-Basic hand tools</p><p>-Bulk CAT5 cable on hand in case a cable run is required (reimbursed per-ft.)&nbsp;</p><p>-Fully charged cell phone with camera</p><p>-Charged Laptop with signal testing software</p><p>-RJ45 crimp tool</p><p>-RJ45 CAT5e male and female ends</p><p>-Cable Qualifier/Certifier</p><p>-Toner</p><p><strong>** Please review \"Important Instructions\" section prior to going onsite **</strong></p><p><strong>**IMPORTANT INSTRUCTIONS**</strong></p><p>•Signed work order with release code is a required deliverable</p><p>•Site Survey Form is a required deliverable (if attached)</p><p>•If parts are required or you are unable to repair the unit on this visit, Service must be notified at the above contact numbers BEFORE YOU LEAVE SITE.</p><p>•Work order close-out notes, part numbers for any parts required, and all deliverables are due within 24 hours of service visit</p><p>•If out of scope work is encountered, Service must be notified immediately - No spend limit increases will be approved without prior consent.</p><p>•If you fail to follow these instructions, your work order may be cancelled and $0 paid</p><p>•If you arrive onsite unprepared for the scope of work either without the required experience/skill set or the required tools, your work order may be cancelled and $0 paid</p><p>•If any person other than the assigned technician goes onsite, your work order may be cancelled and $0 paid. We are NOT required to accept a technician swap. If a swap is not accepted, the assigned tech MUST be onsite.</p><p>•By accepting this work order you are agreeing to a 30 day workmanship guarantee for any services performed</p>","markdown":"Need tech onsite to troubleshoot internet/tv in guestroom. Verify power, troubleshoot device, etc.\n\n**Do NOT take FN work order to site, use attached PDF work order. Assigned tech should be the tech onsite unless you have prior approval; substituting a tech may result in $0 paid.**\n\nNeed a technician experienced with Network, Telecom and Voice/Data Cabling troubleshooting to go onsite and determine cause of customer complaint. Diagnose and repair to restore service on same trip, if possible. If parts are required, work with tech support to complete the order.\n\n**Required Tools/Materials:**\n\n-Basic hand tools\n\n-Bulk CAT5 cable on hand in case a cable run is required (reimbursed per-ft.)\n\n-Fully charged cell phone with camera\n\n-Charged Laptop with signal testing software\n\n-RJ45 crimp tool\n\n-RJ45 CAT5e male and female ends\n\n-Cable Qualifier/Certifier\n\n-Toner\n\n**\\*\\* Please review \"Important Instructions\" section prior to going onsite \\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*IMPORTANT INSTRUCTIONS\\*\\***\n\n•Signed work order with release code is a required deliverable\n\n•Site Survey Form is a required deliverable (if attached)\n\n•If parts are required or you are unable to repair the unit on this visit, Service must be notified at the above contact numbers BEFORE YOU LEAVE SITE.\n\n•Work order close-out notes, part numbers for any parts required, and all deliverables are due within 24 hours of service visit\n\n•If out of scope work is encountered, Service must be notified immediately - No spend limit increases will be approved without prior consent.\n\n•If you fail to follow these instructions, your work order may be cancelled and $0 paid\n\n•If you arrive onsite unprepared for the scope of work either without the required experience/skill set or the required tools, your work order may be cancelled and $0 paid\n\n•If any person other than the assigned technician goes onsite, your work order may be cancelled and $0 paid. We are NOT required to accept a technician swap. If a swap is not accepted, the assigned tech MUST be onsite.\n\n•By accepting this work order you are agreeing to a 30 day workmanship guarantee for any services performed","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-15T12:30","end":"2026-09-15T14:00","latestStart":"2026-09-15T16:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":98},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $98 (countered: $98) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T16:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-15T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-15T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-15T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Rest"},{"start":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Possible cutover"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","su