d check out time. If I am unavailable leave me a voicemail with your check in and check out time and any other pertinent information related to your work order. I will return your voicemail at my earliest convenience. If the work order is completed over the weekend you will be contacted on the next business day.*** *Please be sure to take all parts with you the customer is not responsible for returning the parts it is part of your work order completion to receive payment approval NO EXCEPTIONS.*\n\n***﻿***\n\nB**rand:WHIRLPOOL**\n\n**Product:**Refrigerator\n\n**Model No.:**WRX735SDH04\n\n**PROBLEM DESCRIPTION:**ICEMAKER NOT MAKING ICE\n\n**PARTS SENT:**Part Number: WPW10300024 Part Description: ICE MAKER ASSEMBLY Quantity: 1 If used during repair, requires return: No Tracking Number: 383473857859 Shipping Provider: FedEx 1 If used during repair, requires return:. Only replace parts needed for the repair. 2. Diagnose issue & if parts sent don''t resolve the issue, please put the original parts back in the unit and back in original condition. 3. Take all parts sent to the customer with you upon leaving. Do not leave ANYTHING with the customer.\n\n **IF THE PARTS ARE NOT ON SITE PLEASE RUN THE CALL AS A TROUBLE SHOOTING AND DIAGNOSTICS. TAKE PICS OF THE MODEL AND SERIAL AND WRITE A SUMMARY OF THE PROBLEM DESCRIPTION AND THE POSSIBLE PARTS NEEDED TO REPAIR THE UNIT.**\n\n**PICTURES**: **TAKE PICTURES OF THE HOUSE, AND THE UNIT IN THIS INSTANCE FOR VERIFICATION OF YOUR ARRIVAL AND DEPARTURE.**\n\nEffective today July 20, 2021 new policy mandatory for all Vehtechnology technicians. Technicians must call the customer one hour before arriving on site, this is and has always been our policy. If you arrive at a customer's home and did not provide a courtesy call before arriving and the customer is not home you WILL NOT BE PAID FOR TRAVEL for this ticket. If you have an instance where you have contacted the customer and no response immediately contact myself or Vincent via text message or phone call, no exceptions.\n\n- **TAKE PICTURES OF THE UNIT BEFORE THE REPAIRS AND AFTER TO COVER YOURSELF AND THE COMPANY FROM ANY LIABILITY!**\n- **PLEASE PRESENT YOURSELF AS A VEHTECH,INC REP. & PLEASE PRESENT YOURSELF IN A PROFESSIONAL MANNER.**\n- **CALL 770-788-2032 - UPON SITE Arrival for check in.** IF unavailable leave check in time and check out time on voicemail.\n- **Failure to comply with these procedures will inhibit or void payment.**\n- TAKE PARTS WITH YOU MUST BE RETURNED TO VEHTECH.\n- **cores/ parts must be returned to VEHTECH, INC before assignments are paid.**\n- **VEHTECH, INC. requires detailed work descriptions for the scope of work performed during repairs.**\n- **Please include the following : Before and After pictures of the unit showing findings as related to problem description.**\n- **Pictures of the Serial #, Model #, as well as any parts that need replacing include the part numbers as well.**\n- **Upload these findings at once after completing the assignment.**\n\n**REQUIRED TOOLS/ITEMS:**\n\n- **TAKE PICTURES OF THE UNIT BEFORE THE REPAIRS AND AFTER TO COVER YOURSELF AND THE COMPANY FROM ANY LIABILITY!**\n- **PLEASE PRESENT YOURSELF AS A VEHTECH,INC REP. & PLEASE PRESENT YOURSELF IN A PROFESSIONAL MANNER.**\n- **CALL 770-788-2032 - UPON SITE Arrival for check in.** IF unavailable leave check in time and check out time on voicemail.\n- **Failure to comply with these procedures will inhibit or void payment.**\n- TAKE PARTS WITH YOU MUST BE RETURNED TO VEHTECH.\n- **cores/ parts must be returned to VEHTECH, INC before assignments are paid.**\n- **VEHTECH, INC. requires detailed work descriptions for the scope of work performed during repairs.**\n- **Please include the following : Before and After pictures of the unit showing findings as related to problem description.**\n- **Pictures of the Serial #, Model #, as well as any parts that need replacing include the part numbers as well.**\n- **Upload these findings at once afte