{"job":{"id":19938248,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"The InSite Group","title":"Q16427 Retail Fixture Replacement Best Buy","description":{"html":"<p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">We are requesting 2 people (1 lead and a helper) from the hours of 6:00pm to 10pm for Thursday September 17th install</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">SOW:</strong></p><ul><li>Arrive on site and check in with Project Manager</li><li>Locate the pallet containing the display fixture and small box containing electronics \"staged in the stockroom\"</li><li>Locate and Unmerchandise and Remove one end cap (completely remove from sales floor) and empty 4' of the T-Gondola attached to new display will install</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">(End Cap only) parts must be discarded off site when removed</li><li>Disassemble the crate and begin installing the new fixture</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Detailed assembly instructions will be provided</li><li>Under the 4' of T-Gondola that has been emptied \"locate power and route the power cable\"</li><li>Once assembled you will plug in all equipment \"clearly labeled\" and test power</li><li>There will be security devices to attach to a lift shelf and electronics to install to the security devices</li><li>Install a monitor \"all materials provided\"</li><li>Power on all displays and setup Wi-Fi connection using QR code instruction prompts from your personal phone</li><li>After display/ electronic installation is complete, you will place shelf talkers and labels on the display</li><li>Clean up all fingerprints/ dispose of all packing materials</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Timeline:</strong><span style=\"color: black;\"> Thursday September 17th 6:00PM - 10PM (ONLY)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\"> 2 people Required</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;Work in the back until last client leaves.&nbsp;Set up and be out of store by 10 PM</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Tools required/ not supplied:</strong></p><ul><li>Utility knife</li><li>Rubber hammer/ mallet</li><li>Cleaning supplies \" non-ammonia window cleaner and microfiber cloths \"</li><li>Basic tool kit</li><li>Drill/Drill Bits</li></ul><p><strong>Deliverables</strong>:</p><p>Before Install Photos</p><p>Photos of all sides of endcap</p><p>Straight on Photo of Endcap</p><p>Straight on Photo of Endcap From a Distance</p><p><br></p><p><em>Deliverables will be submitted via Weblink and Field Nation Portal</em></p><p><em>Weblink to be provided before install</em></p>","markdown":"We are requesting 2 people (1 lead and a helper) from the hours of 6:00pm to 10pm for Thursday September 17th install\n\n**SOW:**\n\n- Arrive on site and check in with Project Manager\n- Locate the pallet containing the display fixture and small box containing electronics \"staged in the stockroom\"\n- Locate and Unmerchandise and Remove one end cap (completely remove from sales floor) and empty 4' of the T-Gondola attached to new display will install\n- (End Cap only) parts must be discarded off site when removed\n- Disassemble the crate and begin installing the new fixture\n- Detailed assembly instructions will be provided\n- Under the 4' of T-Gondola that has been emptied \"locate power and route the power cable\"\n- Once assembled you will plug in all equipment \"clearly labeled\" and test power\n- There will be security devices to attach to a lift shelf and electronics to install to the security devices\n- Install a monitor \"all materials provided\"\n- Power on all displays and setup Wi-Fi connection using QR code instruction prompts from your personal phone\n- After display/ electronic installation is complete, you will place shelf talkers and labels on the display\n- Clean up all fingerprints/ dispose of all packing materials\n\n**Timeline:** Thursday September 17th 6:00PM - 10PM (ONLY)\n\n 2 people Required\n\n Work in the back until last client leaves. Set up and be out of store by 10 PM\n\n**Tools required/ not supplied:**\n\n- Utility knife\n- Rubber hammer/ mallet\n- Cleaning supplies \" non-ammonia window cleaner and microfiber cloths \"\n- Basic tool kit\n- Drill/Drill Bits\n\n**Deliverables**:\n\nBefore Install Photos\n\nPhotos of all sides of endcap\n\nStraight on Photo of Endcap\n\nStraight on Photo of Endcap From a Distance\n\n*Deliverables will be submitted via Weblink and Field Nation Portal*\n\n*Weblink to be provided before install*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00","end":"2026-09-17T22:00"},"payRange":{"min":600,"max":600},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Thu, Sep 17, 6:00 PM\nChecked: Thu, Sep 17, Fri, Sep 18, Mon, Sep 21 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Possible cutover"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Danik Furniture"},{"start":"2026-09-21T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧