{"job":{"id":19959073,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pursuant Health","title":"Replace the BP Mandrel with Cuff / Hose, Replace the BP Pump and Install Calibration Decal and PM Kiosk","description":{"html":"<ul><li>A Release Code must be obtained upon completion of the work order, prior to leaving the site. <strong>Failure to obtain Release Code</strong> will result in deduction and/or cancellation of the work order.</li><li><span>CAUTION: Do not plug any power tools or cleaning devices into the kiosk’s internal power strips. Doing so may result in blown fuses and system failure. Use only approved connections as directed.</span></li><li>CONNECT to WIFI - Poor connection may result in difficulties accessing work instructions and contacting support. If you are having connectivity issues please connect to the site&#39;s WIFI connection.</li><li><strong>Replace the BP Mandrel</strong><br /><ul><li>Please refer to the step-by-step guide in the link below:</li><li>https://bit.ly/MAVBP</li></ul></li><li><strong>Replace the Blood Pressure Pump and Calibration Decal</strong><br /><ul><li>Remove old BP Calibration decal.</li><li>Remove any old sticker residue and clean the area before placing new decal.</li><li>Please refer to the step-by-step guides in the links below:</li><li>Blood Pressure Pump: https://bit.ly/MAVBP-Pump</li><li>Decal Placement: https://bit.ly/MAVBP-Pump-Decal</li><li>After installing the pump and decal, take a photo of the Calibration Decal and upload to your Work Order.</li></ul></li></ul><p>-----------------------------------</p><p>Technical Support Contact/info:  https://bit.ly/m/Pursuant</p><p>Standard Maintenance Videos:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li>Mirror Box:  https://bit.ly/KioskMirrorBox</li><li>BP Mandrel:  https://bit.ly/KioskBPMandrel</li><li>Seat Check:  http://bit.ly/KioskSeatCheck</li><li>USB Disconnect: https://bit.ly/KioskUSB</li><li>PM Video Example: https://bit.ly/MAVFAQ-PM</li></ul>","markdown":"- A Release Code must be obtained upon completion of the work order, prior to leaving the site. **Failure to obtain Release Code** will result in deduction and/or cancellation of the work order.\n- CAUTION: Do not plug any power tools or cleaning devices into the kiosk’s internal power strips. Doing so may result in blown fuses and system failure. Use only approved connections as directed.\n- CONNECT to WIFI - Poor connection may result in difficulties accessing work instructions and contacting support. If you are having connectivity issues please connect to the site's WIFI connection.\n- **Replace the BP Mandrel**  \n  \n  - Please refer to the step-by-step guide in the link below:\n  - <https://bit.ly/MAVBP>\n- **Replace the Blood Pressure Pump and Calibration Decal**  \n  \n  - Remove old BP Calibration decal.\n  - Remove any old sticker residue and clean the area before placing new decal.\n  - Please refer to the step-by-step guides in the links below:\n  - Blood Pressure Pump: <https://bit.ly/MAVBP-Pump>\n  - Decal Placement: <https://bit.ly/MAVBP-Pump-Decal>\n  - After installing the pump and decal, take a photo of the Calibration Decal and upload to your Work Order.\n\n\\-----------------------------------\n\nTechnical Support Contact/info: <https://bit.ly/m/Pursuant>\n\nStandard Maintenance Videos:\n\n- Mirror Box: <https://bit.ly/KioskMirrorBox>\n- BP Mandrel: <https://bit.ly/KioskBPMandrel>\n- Seat Check: <http://bit.ly/KioskSeatCheck>\n- USB Disconnect: <https://bit.ly/KioskUSB>\n- PM Video Example: <https://bit.ly/MAVFAQ-PM>","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-21T09:45","end":"2026-09-21T11:45","latestStart":"2026-09-21T10:30"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":90},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $90 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","