{"job":{"id":"6667199122","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Reality Interactive","title":"Spectrum: 5354 - Holly Springs NC - Tech Visit to Replace RC Tuner and Fix the Gaps in RC TVs","description":"<p><strong><u>SOW</u></strong>:</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Approximate Visit Length</u></strong>: 2 hour(s)</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools:</u></strong></p><ul><li>A laptop with an Ethernet port</li><li>Working Ethernet Cable</li><li>Smartphone with Camera</li><li>Screwdriver (multi-bit)</li><li>USB Keyboard and Mouse</li><li>Basic Hand Tools</li><li>5-8ft ladder</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Recommended but not required:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Power drill with drill bits</li><li>Cable snake</li><li>Spare 3/4\" spacers</li><li>Level</li><li>RJ45 Crimper</li><li>Zip Ties</li><li>Electronics Duster</li><li>Duct Tape</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Instructions</u></strong></p><ol><li>Introduce yourself to the site contact and obtain any necessary hardware</li><li>Call into Reality @860-852-5035 to check in and review SOW</li><li>Obtain Samsung and Tuner Remotes from store staff&nbsp;</li><li>Acquire new&nbsp;ZeeVe&nbsp;tuner from store personnel. Do not discard packaging material&nbsp;</li><li>Make your way to the RC Wall</li><li>Remove the First Tv from the Wall</li><li>Remover the mount </li><li>Move the mount over so there is no gap between the TVs</li><li>Reinstall the mount </li><li>Reinstall the TV making sure that all cable management is done </li><li>Make  your wat to the TV 2 (black screen)</li><li>&nbsp;Remove offline TV from wall to access old tuner. Remove broken tuner and power cord from wall&nbsp;</li><li>Connect new tuner to TV and coax hookup using existing cables.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Mount IR sensor to bottom right-hand side of the TV similar to other TV's&nbsp;</li><li>Re-mount TV&nbsp;</li><li>Run channel scan, verify tuner is getting all required channels (61,62,81,82,83,84)&nbsp;</li><li>Set tuner to the correct channel&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Verify TV is working correctly&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Pack Old Tuner, Power Cord and Remote into the box&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>NOTE:&nbsp; Power Cord and Remote&nbsp; MUST be returned with tuner&nbsp;</li><li>Affix Return Label to box&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Take photos of all associated experiences with content on their screens and any associated hardware.&nbsp;</li><li>Additional testing or photos may be requested by RI Support&nbsp;</li><li>Upload all required photos and required documentation before you leave the site&nbsp;</li><li>Call Reality Interactive at&nbsp;860-840-7100 for approval prior to checking out.&nbsp;</li><li>Drop device at nearest Fed Ex Location get photo of receipt&nbsp;</li><li>Any FedEx drop-offs require photo proof (i.e., receipt picture)</li></ol><p><br></p><p><em>Please understand additional troubleshooting steps may be asked by the Reality Interactive Support Team during the visit to ensure all needs are met.</em></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-17T12:00","end":"2026-09-17T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":125},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":15.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Possible cutover"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Danik Furniture"},{"start":"2026-09-21T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.00