{"job":{"id":19959998,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"SDS Logistics","title":"Asset Scanning/reconcile - 31471-87932","description":{"html":"<p>Contractor will need to download the Orca Scan app onto their phone and set it up the day before going on site (takes like 3 min maybe and I can do this with you on the phone). Once on site the app on your phone will be used to scan the barcode listed on each item listed below. after you scan the barcode just enter the make and model of the device into the app and move onto the next one.</p><p><strong>Only one barcode should be scanned per device. </strong></p><p>We also need to get an accurate item count of each item type, (laptop desktop, etc). The movers will have paperwork to put the item counts you get onto.</p><p>Asset Expected counts:</p><p>2 Desktop PCs</p><p>1 Laptop</p><p>10 Switches</p><p>9 printers </p><p>3 UPS </p><p>Any questions please let me know, thanks!</p>","markdown":"Contractor will need to download the Orca Scan app onto their phone and set it up the day before going on site (takes like 3 min maybe and I can do this with you on the phone). Once on site the app on your phone will be used to scan the barcode listed on each item listed below. after you scan the barcode just enter the make and model of the device into the app and move onto the next one.\n\n**Only one barcode should be scanned per device.**\n\nWe also need to get an accurate item count of each item type, (laptop desktop, etc). The movers will have paperwork to put the item counts you get onto.\n\nAsset Expected counts:\n\n2 Desktop PCs\n\n1 Laptop\n\n10 Switches\n\n9 printers\n\n3 UPS\n\nAny questions please let me know, thanks!","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T08:30","end":"2026-09-16T09:30"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":16},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Possible cutover"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Danik Furniture"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T18:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 n