{"job":{"id":19958742,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Axiom Service Management LLC","title":"Cisco Switch Deployment & Handheld Scanner Replacement - TECHNICIAN 1 - LIFT CERTIFICATION REQUIRED","description":{"html":"<p><strong><em><u>﻿Note: This work order requires working with another technician while on-site. Both technicians are to remain professional at all times while on-site. You are expected to communicate clearly, work together, and share the workload equally throughout the assignment. Any concerns about on-site behavior, communication, or work performance involving either technician will be addressed immediately while the job is in progress.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>Please note that you will be REQUIRED to stay onsite for 14 hours, we CANNOT leave the site once checked in. The scope is not expected to take the full 14 hours, please bring all tools, chargers, drinks/snacks and anything that you may need. Once the scope is fully completed with cable management and clean up, you may use your time freely WITHOUT DISTURBING THE STORE.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>Date: | SCHEDULE: 8pm-8am</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><ul><li>o Replace up to six (6) existing Cisco Catalyst C2960 switches with up to six Cisco Catalyst&nbsp;C9200 switches.</li><li> Customer will direct where to leave the existing Legacy Cisco Catalyst C2960&nbsp;switches</li><li>o Replace up to eight (8) handheld scanners.</li></ul><p> Customer will direct where to leave the existing Legacy handheld scanners.</p><ul><li>o If required, pending store requirements, replace one music player.</li></ul><p> Customer will direct where to leave the existing legacy music player</p><ul><li>• Power up all installed equipment.</li><li>• Verify physical installation, power status, and network connectivity.</li><li>• Coordinate with Customer IT personnel to confirm device connectivity and operational status</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Deliverables:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Before/After Photos (to be sent in the WhatsApp channel with the client)</li><li>Completion Document</li><li>Sign Off Sheet</li><li>Notate as best as possible the location of MDF and IDF (create general floor plan if not provided)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Scissor Lift Certification</li><li>Lift Harness</li><li>PPE - hard hat, steel toed boots, glasses, vest</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Tool list:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Laptop (Windows 10/11)</li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">3 and 5 position terminal blocks</span></li><li>Laptop charger</li><li>Ethernet cable (minimum 6 ft.)</li><li>Console cable&nbsp;</li><li>Label maker&nbsp;</li><li>Precision screwdriver set</li><li>Nut driver set</li><li>Needle nose pliers</li><li>USB-to-Ethernet adapter</li><li>Spare Cat5e/Cat6 patch cables (3 ft., 7 ft., and 10 ft.)</li><li>Cable tester</li><li>Punch-down tool&nbsp;</li><li>Velcro cable ties</li><li>Zip ties (various sizes)</li><li>Console adapter assortment</li></ul>","markdown":"***﻿Note: This work order requires working with another technician while on-site. Both technicians are to remain professional at all times while on-site. You are expected to communicate clearly, work together, and share the workload equally throughout the assignment. Any concerns about on-site behavior, communication, or work performance involving either technician will be addressed immediately while the job is in progress.***\n\n***Please note that you will be REQUIRED to stay onsite for 14 hours, we CANNOT leave the site once checked in. The scope is not expected to take the full 14 hours, please bring all tools, chargers, drinks/snacks and anything that you may need. Once the scope is fully completed with cable management and clean up, you may use your time freely WITHOUT DISTURBING THE STORE.***\n\n***Date: | SCHEDULE: 8pm-8am***\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n- o Replace up to six (6) existing Cisco Catalyst C2960 switches with up to six Cisco Catalyst C9200 switches.\n-  Customer will direct where to leave the existing Legacy Cisco Catalyst C2960 switches\n- o Replace up to eight (8) handheld scanners.\n\n Customer will direct where to leave the existing Legacy handheld scanners.\n\n- o If required, pending store requirements, replace one music player.\n\n Customer will direct where to leave the existing legacy music player\n\n- • Power up all installed equipment.\n- • Verify physical installation, power status, and network connectivity.\n- • Coordinate with Customer IT personnel to confirm device connectivity and operational status\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n- Before/After Photos (to be sent in the WhatsApp channel with the client)\n- Completion Document\n- Sign Off Sheet\n- Notate as best as possible the location of MDF and IDF (create general floor plan if not provided)\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n- Scissor Lift Certification\n- Lift Harness\n- PPE - hard hat, steel toed boots, glasses, vest\n\n**Tool list:**\n\n- Laptop (Windows 10/11)\n- 3 and 5 position terminal blocks\n- Laptop charger\n- Ethernet cable (minimum 6 ft.)\n- Console cable\n- Label maker\n- Precision screwdriver set\n- Nut driver set\n- Needle nose pliers\n- USB-to-Ethernet adapter\n- Spare Cat5e/Cat6 patch cables (3 ft., 7 ft., and 10 ft.)\n- Cable tester\n- Punch-down tool\n- Velcro cable ties\n- Zip ties (various sizes)\n- Console adapter assortment","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-28T20:00","end":"2026-09-28T32:00"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":480},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":12,"distance":9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Mon, Sep 28, 8:00 PM\nChecked: Mon, Sep 28, Tue, Sep 29, Wed, Sep 30, Thu, Oct 1, Fri, Oct 2 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2