{"job":{"id":19960394,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Protos Security","title":"IP Camera server and/or Networking Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p>Tech needed to troubleshoot the camera server will need a monitor, keyboard and mouse to work with our helpdesk to troubleshoot the server.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Knowledge of IP/analog cameras, general cable troubleshooting and general network troubleshooting required.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Must check in with Help Desk and Project Manager.</strong></p><p><strong>Must be released by Help Desk and Project Manager. Help Desk number and Project Manager is in Confidential Information Section.</strong></p>","markdown":"Tech needed to troubleshoot the camera server will need a monitor, keyboard and mouse to work with our helpdesk to troubleshoot the server.\n\nKnowledge of IP/analog cameras, general cable troubleshooting and general network troubleshooting required.\n\n**Must check in with Help Desk and Project Manager.**\n\n**Must be released by Help Desk and Project Manager. Help Desk number and Project Manager is in Confidential Information Section.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T15:00","end":"2026-09-16T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":62},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $140) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2