{"job":{"id":19960558,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Cut Over/Activation/ Test/ MB2700158","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><br/><p><br></p><br/><ol><li>Contact Dona - number in confidential section</li><li>Cut over to new circuit</li></ol><p><strong>****There is No bridge call scheduled, Dona is the remote engineer***</strong></p><br/><p><br></p><br/><p><em>Review the “Confidential Section” listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch including bridge line details, lcon info, and equipment information</em></p><br/><p><br></p><br/><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">Please bring a </span><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 5, 5);\">NEWER working Windows laptop (Win10 or higher) with a 1gb Ethernet port (or 1gb Ethernet dongle), a hotspot and team viewer already installed with the ability to log into a network device using a Console connection AND Ethernet connection. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">This is required for all techs at the minimum. Preferably have ALL of the tools listed below in the Tool Requirements</span></p><br/><p><strong><u>Tool Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><ul><li>WIN10 or higher Laptop (No Mac laptops) – with1gb Ethernet connection, charger &amp; TeamViewer Installed</li><li>Hot Spot or Internet Dongle</li><li>Standard Tool Kit</li><li>Cell Phone - with Charger</li><li>Console Cable <span style=\"color: rgb(234, 5, 5);\">(Please see attached images for reference)</span></li><li>Spare Patch Cables &amp; Cabling Equipment (Rj45, Biscuits, Etc..)</li></ul><p><em>*Additional Tools Requested*</em></p><br/><p><br></p><br/><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><ul><li>Photo ID required</li><li>Names of all technicians going to the site must be provided in advance</li><li>Check-in with site contacts representing <del>******* ******** ****** ************** *******</del></li><li>Workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment</li><li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li><li>If PPE required: professional environment expecting professional conduct, clean work attire with appropriate PPE</li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n  \n  \n1. Contact Dona - number in confidential section\n2. Cut over to new circuit\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*There is No bridge call scheduled, Dona is the remote engineer\\*\\*\\***\n\n  \n  \n*Review the “Confidential Section” listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch including bridge line details, lcon info, and equipment information*\n\n  \n  \nPlease bring a NEWER working Windows laptop (Win10 or higher) with a 1gb Ethernet port (or 1gb Ethernet dongle), a hotspot and team viewer already installed with the ability to log into a network device using a Console connection AND Ethernet connection. This is required for all techs at the minimum. Preferably have ALL of the tools listed below in the Tool Requirements\n\n  \n**Tool Requirements:**\n\n  \n- WIN10 or higher Laptop (No Mac laptops) – with1gb Ethernet connection, charger & TeamViewer Installed\n- Hot Spot or Internet Dongle\n- Standard Tool Kit\n- Cell Phone - with Charger\n- Console Cable (Please see attached images for reference)\n- Spare Patch Cables & Cabling Equipment (Rj45, Biscuits, Etc..)\n\n*\\*Additional Tools Requested\\**\n\n  \n  \n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n  \n- Photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians going to the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean busi