{"job":{"id":19959309,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"XTIUM","title":"Review Network equipment","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Brief Summary of Work to Be Performed and Time Onsite Expectations</strong></p><p>The estimated time on site for this service event is 2 hours however it varies from site to site. XTIUM expects the tech to remain on site until the work is complete and tech is released by customer or XTIUM NOC.</p><p>Timely arrival to site is mandatory. If a problem prevents you from arriving on time you must call prior to the scheduled time &amp; advise of your status.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">READ AND FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS IN THIS TICKET AS FAILURE TO DO SO MAY RESULT IN NON-PAYMENT FOR THE VISIT</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">Must be able to frequently climb stairs/ladders.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Skills Required and Highlighted Tools Required</strong></p><ol><li>Laptop w/ Windows 11 or better</li><li>Tera Term Pro, Putty or HyperTerminal</li><li>Webex working on laptop. Test at www.webex.com/test-meeting.html</li><li>4G aircard or hot spot capable smartphone&nbsp;</li><li>Cable toner/wand</li><li>T1 loopback</li><li>Cable tester</li><li>Punch down tool</li><li>Spare cat6 patch cables</li><li>Cisco Console cable with usb to serial adapter</li><li>200’ Cat 6 and terminating tools</li><li>Fully charged cell phone with hotspot capability</li><li>Terminal Software with capable drivers</li><li>Butt set</li><li>Standard 6’ ladder</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>High Level Work Flow</strong></p><ol><li>Tech will check in on the platform</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">You <strong><u>DO NOT</u></strong> need to call us if you checked in on the platform.</li><li>Tech will check in with the site contact on duty</li><li>Show site contact the work order and a valid photo ID</li><li>Tech will call the XTIUM NOC at 800-765-3943 for check in and further instructions</li><li>NOC and Tech will complete scope of work (including any as-built documentation) with customer, as detailed below in work order</li><li>Upon completion of work, Tech will be released by the XTIUM NOC</li><li>PRIOR to leaving site, Tech will update the Custom Fields on the platform with required information to complete the call</li><li>Tech will return any equipment within 24 hours.</li><li>While on site if you have any issues, please contact XTIUM and ask for the XTIUM NOC</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Attachment List</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">Standard Tool List</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Process Requirements</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">Follow High Level work flow as mentioned above as well as any process instructions given below.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Documentation Requirements</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">None unless otherwise mentioned in the work order below</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Parts Requirements</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">If any parts were shipped to site:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">FED EX RETURN: Instructions for preparing a return shipment from ATSG:</span></p><ul><li>Do not mar or remove any labels.</li><li>The FE is instructed to clearly write the XTIUM CASE ID in the Reference field of the FedEx return AWB</li><li>The FE is instructed to write the 8-digit XTIUM CASE ID # next to the FedEx AWB the numbers should be easily identifiable but no larger than necessary.</li></ul><p>FE will be responsible for returning these shipments via Fed Ex within 24 hours of completed service. The tech will keep the shipping receipt for 30 days for verification on the returned part.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Detailed Instructions can be found in the Confidential Information Section once assigned. </strong></p>","markdown":"**Brief Summary of Work to Be Performed and Time Onsite Expectations**\n\nThe estimated time on site for this service event is 2 hours however it varies from site to site. XTIUM expects the tech to remain on site until the work is complete and tech is released by customer or XTIUM NOC.\n\nTimely arrival to site is mandatory. If a problem prevents you from arriving on time you must call prior to the scheduled time & advise of your status.\n\nREAD AND FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS IN THIS TICKET AS FAILURE TO DO SO MAY RESULT IN NON-PAYMENT FOR THE VISIT\n\nMust be able to frequently climb stairs/ladders.\n\n**Skills Required and Highlighted Tools Required**\n\n1. Laptop w/ Windows 11 or better\n2. Tera Term Pro, Putty or HyperTerminal\n3. Webex working on laptop. Test at www.webex.com/test-meeting.html\n4. 4G aircard or hot spot capable smartphone\n5. Cable toner/wand\n6. T1 loopback\n7. Cable tester\n8. Punch down tool\n9. Spare cat6 patch cables\n10. Cisco Console cable with usb to serial adapter\n11. 200’ Cat 6 and terminating tools\n12. Fully charged cell phone with hotspot capability\n13. Terminal Software with capable drivers\n14. Butt set\n15. Standard 6’ ladder\n\n**High Level Work Flow**\n\n1. Tech will check in on the platform\n2. You **DO NOT** need to call us if you checked in on the platform.\n3. Tech will check in with the site contact on duty\n4. Show site contact the work order and a valid photo ID\n5. Tech will call the XTIUM NOC at 800-765-3943 for check in and further instructions\n6. NOC and Tech will complete scope of work (including any as-built documentation) with customer, as detailed below in work order\n7. Upon completion of work, Tech will be released by the XTIUM NOC\n8. PRIOR to leaving site, Tech will update the Custom Fields on the platform with required information to complete the call\n9. Tech will return any equipment within 24 hours.\n10. While on site if you have any issues, please contact XTIUM and ask for the XTIUM NOC\n\n**Attachment List**\n\nStandard Tool List\n\n**Process Requirements**\n\nFollow High Level work flow as mentioned above as well as any process instructions given below.\n\n**Documentation Requirements**\n\nNone unless otherwise mentioned in the work order below\n\n**Parts Requirements**\n\nIf any parts were shipped to site:\n\nFED EX RETURN: Instructions for preparing a return shipment from ATSG:\n\n- Do not mar or remove any labels.\n- The FE is instructed to clearly write the XTIUM CASE ID in the Reference field of the FedEx return AWB\n- The FE is instructed to write the 8-digit XTIUM CASE ID # next to the FedEx AWB the numbers should be easily identifiable but no larger than necessary.\n\nFE will be responsible for returning these shipments via Fed Ex within 24 hours of completed service. The tech will keep the shipping receipt for 30 days for verification on the returned part.\n\n**Detailed Instructions can be found in the Confidential Information Section once assigned.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-16T11:45","end":"2026-09-16T13:45"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":80},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":10},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $80 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-16T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Possible cutover"},{"start":"2026-09-17T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Danik Furniture"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 0247