{"job":{"id":19961052,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Insane Impact","title":"Football Scoreboard - PSU swap","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Issue:</strong></p><ul><li>Bad power supply - See attached photo for location of PSU outage (Blue L shaped pattern)</li><li>2 bad modules - See attached photo for location of mod swaps (Small blue squares)</li></ul><p><strong>Likely fix:</strong></p><ul><li>Power Supply swap</li><li>2 module swaps</li></ul><p><strong>Details:</strong></p><ul><li>Lift on site</li><li>Spare parts on site</li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Clothes without holes</li><li>No offensive logos/branding</li><li>Clean footwear</li></ul><p><strong>Suggested Equipment:</strong></p><ul><li>Smartphone w/ camera</li><li>Multimeter</li><li>Basic hand tools</li><li>Allen wrench, 2.5 mm</li></ul><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Pre-Site Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Review uploaded documentation and the below video</li><li>Watch video on Power Supply Replacement</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Od5N1iX3PLE</li></ul><p><strong>Required On-Site Deliverables</strong></p><ul><li>Upload pictures of screen before and after service</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approve Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Travel Expenses must be applied as a counter-offer when requesting the work</li><li>Additional hours must be requested, and require approval by WO Manager</li><li>Additional expenses for purchase or rental of materials will need to be pre-approved by our team</li></ul>","markdown":"**Issue:**\n\n- Bad power supply - See attached photo for location of PSU outage (Blue L shaped pattern)\n- 2 bad modules - See attached photo for location of mod swaps (Small blue squares)\n\n**Likely fix:**\n\n- Power Supply swap\n- 2 module swaps\n\n**Details:**\n\n- Lift on site\n- Spare parts on site\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Clothes without holes\n- No offensive logos/branding\n- Clean footwear\n\n