{"job":{"id":19966099,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"VCI","title":"Telephone Technician - PBX","description":{"html":"<p>Need telephone technician to install the phone system and  cross-connect Mitel phone system to 66 blocks.. Must know Legacy PBX like Avaya, Mitel, NEC Nortel etc Tech must have butt set, rj 11 connectors and also a laptop with serial and ethernet connection.</p><p>Note: Any job more then 6 hours, 30 mins of lunch time be deducted.</p><p>Please get the work order attached from our company in document section and get it signed by customer with time in/out and details filled in for work done to get paid.</p>","markdown":"Need telephone technician to install the phone system and cross-connect Mitel phone system to 66 blocks.. Must know Legacy PBX like Avaya, Mitel, NEC Nortel etc Tech must have butt set, rj 11 connectors and also a laptop with serial and ethernet connection.\n\nNote: Any job more then 6 hours, 30 mins of lunch time be deducted.\n\nPlease get the work order attached from our company in document section and get it signed by customer with time in/out and details filled in for work done to get paid.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-17T09:00","end":"2026-09-17T13:00","latestStart":"2026-09-17T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $240) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.