{"job":{"id":"3410720199","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"JAMTEK ELECTRICAL LLC","title":"QualDerm Partners, LLC - Burlington, NC - Cross Connect","description":"<p>Description of work</p><p><br></p><p><u>Please do not accept if you cannot commit to being on time. The client is strict with punctuality.</u></p><p><u>Make sure that when you are assigned, you do not send another tech on your behalf without approval from the assignment manager. A request to swap has to be made 24 hours prior.</u></p><p><u>We require a tech who can promptly and efficiently handle this task.</u></p><p><br></p><p><u>We have a client who needs an assessment of their current setup.</u></p><p><br></p><p><u>Provider will:</u></p><ul><li>Contact the Facility Technical Manager to locate the network closet.</li><li>Identify existing firewall connection (document)</li><li>Identify circuit locations (document)</li><li>Test the circuits (using provided static IPs) (Take pictures)</li><li>Once tested, Call William Merrick - 608-571-0554 to update him about the clinic's status, issues, etc or you may join this Teams Meeting link: <a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/22384380856872?p=dv9Nut1nlrBWNPsVBE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/22384380856872?p=dv9Nut1nlrBWNPsVBE</a></li><li>He will also provided instruction where to plug the new circuits into the firewall</li><li>Take BEFORE and AFTER photos of the rack.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>NOTE: There's a possibility that we might need to do a cable extension if the circuit is not inside the clinic's network room. Please let us know so we can discuss it.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Please Bring:</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Bring Laptop</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Cable Tester</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Cat 6 Cable</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><u>Provider understands this is a hard-start time and will not be rescheduled.</u></p><p><br></p><p><u>﻿Provider understands that they will arrive&nbsp;</u>on time&nbsp;and&nbsp;stay&nbsp;until the job is complete. Do not accept this work order if you cannot see the job to completion.</p><p>Provider must have all required tools and materials including but not limited to: reliable transportation, laptop with ethernet and wifi capability, CAT6 cable, RJ45 connectors, keystones, low voltage wall boxes, wall plates, push rods, fish tapes, crimp tool, punch down tool, toner/probe, cable tester/certifier, drill, screwdrivers, ladders, etc.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-21T09:00","end":"2026-09-21T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":98.61932939},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":47.1},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $98.61932939 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z