{"job":{"id":19963435,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Liquid Networx","title":"Replace/install network devices, cutover, test - Raleigh, NC","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>TRAVEL REIMBURSEMENT MUST BE DONE WHEN APPLYING FOR THE WORK ORDER.</u> <u>REQUESTS AFTER BEING ASSIGNED THE WORK ORDER WILL BE SUBJECT TO BEING DENIED.</u></strong></p><p><strong>**  MUST ARRIVE AND BEGIN WORK ON TIME **</strong></p><p><strong><u>On-Site Instructions:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Text <del>******* * ************</del><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</span> when arriving onsite and when checking out.</li><li>Call technical contact for questions - do not provide pricing or mention Field Nation</li><li>Worker will need laptop with Putty installed, console cable, and hot spot in case remote troubleshooting is needed.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Worker will need to:</u></strong></p><p>Join Teams Bridge (client provided) and work with BrightSpring Network team </p><ul><li>Connect new ISP (if needed)</li><li>Rack: 1 x FW, 1 x SW</li><li> install 1 x AP</li><li>Install: Ring Central / Yealink phones</li><li>Work with Network team to: remove existing devices and install new Fortinet. Hang AP, Install &amp; bring up RC/Yealink phones, smart hands for device config and cutover. Assist site with test / verification.</li></ul><p>Label cabling and use best practices for cable management for a clean / professional appearance.</p><p>Provide patch cabling - if needed - for network rack</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Cleanup workstation</li><li>Take photo of all work completed</li><li>Upload Sign Off Sheet</li><li>Send text message to <del>******* * ************</del> when leaving the site with photos of work completed.</li><li>Upload all deliverables and mark work order complete within 48 hrs.</li><li>Failure to complete the above tasks will result in non-payment</li></ul><p><strong><u>Requirements</u></strong><u>:</u></p><ul><li>Send text message to <del>******* * ************</del> when arriving onsite.</li><li>Send text message to <del>******* * ************</del> when leaving the site.</li><li>Upload all deliverables and mark work order complete within 48 hrs.</li><li>Failure to complete the above tasks will result in Non-Payment.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Dress Code/PPE:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Present and maintain neat and&nbsp;appropriate professional appearance, including both attire and personal grooming for customer’s business environment. (Business or open collar business, non-denim attire. closed-toe, non-athletic footwear)</li></ul><p><strong>&nbsp;<u>Necessary Equipment:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Carry or have immediate access to all necessary and standard service tools/equipment for assigned service task.</li><li>Tech must have a high-quality digital camera to take photos of all work completed.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Pre-Site Instructions:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Download/print off attached sign off sheet</li></ul><p><strong><u>Escalations:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Any work the customer is requesting outside of the work listed in the SOW needs approval. Text <del>******* * ************</del></li><li>Work performed outside of the SOW without approval will not be paid</li><li>Difficulties checking into or checking out of the work order on the Field Nation platform should be directed to Field Nation by using the \"Report a Problem\" tab in the platform. Please select the \"How to/Technical Assistance\" option.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Reimbursement/Additional Information:</u></strong></p><ul><li>All Spend Limit Increases need to be approved prior to work completion. Failure to do so could result in SLIs not getting approved!</li><li>All materials used onsite will be reimbursed at the cost of materials. Request an expense reimbursement for materials used and all reimbursement requests should have the material description and cost. Must upload receipt for approval.</li><li>You are representing <del>****** *******</del> while on site. Do not mention Field Nation during any interaction with onsite contact!</li></ul><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><em>By accepting this work order, you agree to warranty all work performed on this work order to the Buyer on this work order for a minimum period of 30 business days. Warranty period will begin from the date that the Buyer on the work order has approved the work order electronically on the Field Nation platform. You will be required to repair all failed work, at no additional cost to the Buyer on this work order, within 3 business days of being notified of the warranty issue. If failed work is not completed in a timely manner, the work order will be subjected to cancellation with no payment or partial payment made.</em></p>","markdown":"**TRAVEL REIMBURSEMENT MUST BE DONE WHEN APPLYING FOR THE WORK ORDER. REQUESTS AFTER BEING ASSIGNED THE WORK ORDER WILL BE SUBJECT TO BEING DENIED.**\n\n**\\*\\* MUST ARRIVE AND BEGIN WORK ON TIME \\*\\***\n\n**On-Site Instructions:**\n\n- Text \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  when arriving onsite and when checking out.\n- Call technical contact for questions - do not provide pricing or mention Field Nation\n- Worker will need laptop with Putty installed, console cable, and hot spot in case remote troubleshooting is needed.\n\n**Worker will need to:**\n\nJoin Teams Bridge (client provided) and work with BrightSpring Network team\n\n- Connect new ISP (if needed)\n- Rack: 1 x FW, 1 x SW\n- install 1 x AP\n- Install: Ring Central / Yealink phones\n- Work with Network team to: remove existing devices and install new Fortinet. Hang AP, Install & bring up RC/Yealink phones, smart hands for device config and cutover. Assist site with test / verification.\n\nLabel cabling and use best practices for cable management for a clean / professional appearance.\n\nProvide patch cabling - if needed - for network rack\n\n- Cleanup workstation\n- Take photo of all work completed\n- Upload Sign Off Sheet\n- Send text message to \\*\\