used and all reimbursement requests should have the material description and cost. Must upload receipt for approval.\n- You are representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* while on site. Do not mention Field Nation during any interaction with onsite contact!\n\n*By accepting this work order, you agree to warranty all work performed on this work order to the Buyer on this work order for a minimum period of 30 business days. Warranty period will begin from the date that the Buyer on the work order has approved the work order electronically on the Field Nation platform. You will be required to repair all failed work, at no additional cost to the Buyer on this work order, within 3 business days of being notified of the warranty issue. If failed work is not completed in a timely manner, the work order will be subjected to cancellation with no payment or partial payment made.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T09:00","end":"2026-10-20T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":300},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":150},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":75}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $300 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Fre