{"job":{"id":19963248,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nova Remote IT LLC","title":"Network Installation","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(47, 50, 60);\">Install Broadband service, gather package from local site contact.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(47, 50, 60);\">Bring working label maker with ink and labels.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(47, 50, 60);\">Install Spectrum Service (Sercomm sax1v1r) with remote engineer on bridge; complete testing.</span></p><ul><li><strong>You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge</strong></li><li><strong>Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens</strong></li><li><strong>Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer. Any additional travel expense not preapproved through a counter will not be approved.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables (including a Cisco specific console cable), Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.</strong></p><p><strong>Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.</strong></p><p><strong>Clean Cable management - all extra cable should be tidy and secure. </strong></p><p>Please review confidential section for site specific details</p><ol><li>Arrive on site and contact LCON. Retrieve shipped equipment and specific instructions below. Bridge will open at top of the hour - <strong>join the Teams bridge ontime regardless. Customer PM and Turn-up engineer will be on the bridge.</strong></li><li>Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.</li><li>Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code from Turn up engineer.</li><li>Clean up work area, leave it cleaner than you arrived and close out.</li></ol>","markdown":"Install Broadband service, gather package from local site contact.\n\nBring working label maker with ink and labels.\n\nInstall Spectrum Service (Sercomm sax1v1r) with remote engineer on bridge; complete testing.\n\n- **You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge**\n- **Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens**\n- **Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer. Any additional travel expense not preapproved through a counter will not be approved.**\n\n**Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables (including a Cisco specific console cable), Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.**\n\n**Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.**\n\n**Clean Cable management - all extra cable should be tidy and secure.**\n\nPlease review confidential section for site specific details\n\n1. Arrive on site and contact LCON. Retrieve shipped equipment and specific instructions below. Bridge will open at top of the hour - **join the Teams bridge ontime regardless. Customer PM and Turn-up engineer will be on the bridge.**\n2. Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.\n3. Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code from Turn up engineer.\n4. Clean up work area, leave it cleaner than you arrived and close out.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-22T11:30","end":"2026-09-22T13:30"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"