{"job":{"id":19968414,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Core Technology Solutions","title":"Replace Cabling  (HARD START TIME)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>METTEL TICKET #:&nbsp;</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\">11893943</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">FE to replace cabling between Velo and ATT circuit on ge3 with a CAT6 cable - make sure the cabling connections are snug and secure</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">REQUIRED MATERIALS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">=================</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Fully Charged Laptop with Ethernet port</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Multimeter wire tester</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Adjustable wrench and/or open end wrenches</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Standard mounting hardware and tools (screws, anchors, screw drivers, drill, level, hammer)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Biscuit jacks</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Crimpers &amp; Wirecutters</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- 4-6 ft’ ladder</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Butt Set</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- RJ11 and RJ45 cable connectors</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- 100’ extension cord</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Digital Camera</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- 100 of Cat 5e/6 cable for possible relocation of device</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Cell phone w/Hotspot device</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 35, 33);\">- Punch down tool</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Flat rate covers up to 2 hours onsite.&nbsp;Any additional time will be paid out at $35 per hour.</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Technicians are responsible for requesting a budget increase or expense reimbursement as well as closing out their own assignment for payment.&nbsp;All budget increases or expense reimbursements must be requested within 48 hours after check out,otherwise they will not be approved.</em></strong></p><p>&nbsp;<strong><em>Aborted sites with hourly payment terms will be paid per the terms for actual time onsite with a one hour minimum.&nbsp;If a site is aborted and there is a flat rate for the payment terms, the ticket will be closed out for 50% of the contracted rate,subsequent days scheduled will be considered “Cancelled”, not “Aborted”.&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>All site aborts MUST be approved by ServicePoint.</em></strong></p>","markdown":"**METTEL TICKET #:** 11893943\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nFE to replace cabling between Velo and ATT circuit on ge3 with a CAT6 cable - make sure the cabling connections are snug and secure\n\n**REQUIRED MATERIALS**\n\n=================\n\n\\- Fully Charged Laptop with Ethernet port\n\n\\- Multimeter wire tester\n\n\\- Adjustable wrench and/or open end wrenches\n\n\\- Standard mounting hardware and tools (screws, anchors, screw drivers, drill, level, hammer)\n\n\\- Biscuit jacks\n\n\\- Crimpers & Wirecutters\n\n\\- 4-6 ft’ ladder\n\n\\- Butt Set\n\n\\- RJ11 and RJ45 cable connectors\n\n\\- 100’ extension cord\n\n\\- Digital Camera\n\n\\- 100 of Cat 5e/6 cable for possible relocation of device\n\n\\- Cell phone w/Hotspot device\n\n\\- Punch down tool\n\n***Flat rate covers up to 2 hours onsite. Any additional time will be paid out at $35 per hour.***\n\n***Technicians are responsible for requesting a budget increase or expense reimbursement as well as closing out their own assignment for payment. All budget increases or expense reimbursements must be requested within 48 hours after check out,otherwise they will not be approved.***\n\n ***Aborted sites with hourly payment terms will be paid per the terms for actual time onsite with a one hour minimum. If a site is aborted and there is a flat rate for the payment terms, the ticket will be closed out for 50% of the contracted rate,subsequent days scheduled will be considered “Cancelled”, not “Aborted”.***\n\n***All site aborts MUST be approved by ServicePoint.***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-17T12:00","end":"2026-09-17T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":120},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":44},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"