{"job":{"id":19968911,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NCR Voyix - Retail","title":"Assist Tech to perform Remodel Install - Revisit","description":{"html":"<p><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong></p><p><strong>Tech to perform installation according to install documents and instructions from Support.</strong></p><p><strong>Tech needs to have or install MS Teams application to attend the meeting with Support.</strong></p><p><strong>Tech needs to enter chat with Support. Link in tasks.</strong></p><p><strong>Tech to populate Checklists. Link in tasks.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Need to trouble shoot why the ASM TV does not have connectivity</strong></li><li><strong>Troubleshoot why the speakers are only working on the domestic / men's &amp; kids' side of the store.</strong></li><li><strong>Tether Register 8 VeriFone</strong></li><li><strong>Secure Register 7 VeriFone to bracket.</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>&nbsp;Join Microsoft Teams meeting:</strong></p><p> https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/240520458040903?p=8ZZ5qDaPMjHBpj3tyy</p><p><strong>REQUIREMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Dress code</strong>-- Casual business attire, including <strong>COLLARED SHIRT (WITHOUT LOGOS)</strong>, jeans, and comfortable shoes during the entire installation process.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD: hats, baggy jeans, open-toed shoes, fatigues, or sweat suits be worn.</u></strong> Clothes must be worn in a professional manner, neatly pressed and tidy.</li><li><strong>NCR Voyix identification badge</strong> must be worn and visible at all times.&nbsp;</li><li>Work Order MUST BE fully completed while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (<strong>Smartphone</strong>)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS</strong></p><ul><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cordless Electric Drill – Very important&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Box cutter with new blades – Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-function screwdriver with multiple tips is preferred. - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;11/32 nut driver – Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;¾\" socket with extension – Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8mm socket - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Needle nose and regular pliers – Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Diagonal cutters - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10\" crescent wrench – Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;¾\" open-ended combination wrench – Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cable ties – Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Complete socket set – Needed</strong></li><li><strong> Packing Tape</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>ESCALATION PATH</strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>D2T.VendorManagement@ncrvoyix.com</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>CANCELLATION POLICY&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Cancellation when tech arrives on site in the first hour: 50% to the tech</li><li>Cancellation when tech arrives on site after the first hour: 100% to the tech</li></ul>","markdown":"**IMPORTANT:**\n\n**Tech to perform installation according to install documents and instructions from Support.**\n\n**Tech needs to have or install MS Teams application to attend the meeting with Support.**\n\n**Tech needs to enter chat with Support. Link in tasks.**\n\n**Tech to populate Checklists. Link in tasks.**\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\n- **Need to trouble shoot why the ASM TV does not have connectivity**\n- **Troubleshoot why the speakers are only working on the domestic / men's & kids' side of the store.**\n- **Tether Register 8 VeriFone**\n- **Secure Register 7 VeriFone to bracket.**\n\n **Join Microsoft Teams meeting:**\n\n <https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/240520458040903?p=8ZZ5qDaPMjHBpj3tyy>\n\n**REQUIREMENTS**\n\n- **Dress code**-- Casual business attire, including **COLLARED SHIRT (WITHOUT LOGOS)**, jeans, and comfortable shoes during the entire installation process. **UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD: hats, baggy jeans, open-toed shoes, fatigues, or sweat suits be worn.** Clothes must be worn in a professional manner, neatly pressed and tidy.\n- **NCR Voyix identification badge** must be worn and visible at all times.\n- Work Order MUST BE fully completed while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (**Smartphone**)\n\n**YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS**\n\n- **• Cordless Electric Drill – Very important**\n- **• Box cutter with new blades – Important**\n- **• Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-function screwdriver with multiple tips is preferred. - Important**\n- **• 11/32 nut driver – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" socket with extension – Important**\n- **• 8mm socket - Important**\n- **• Needle nose and regular pliers – Important**\n- **• Diagonal cutters - Important**\n- **• 10\" crescent wrench – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" open-ended combination wrench – Important**\n- **• Cable ties – Important**\n- **• Complete socket set – Needed**\n- **Packing Tape**\n\n**ESCALATION PATH**\n\n- **D2T.VendorManagement@ncrvoyix.com**\n\n**CANCELLATION POLICY**\n\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site in the first hour: 50% to the tech\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site after the first hour: 100% to the tech","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-21T07:00","end":"2026-09-21T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":58},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $180 (countered: $240) is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00