{"job":{"id":19968908,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"F3 Technologies","title":"SpotOn POS Site Readiness Inspection XL","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Additional hours or expenses (<em>cabling, etc.) </em>need to be pre-approved by the project manager prior to incurring on the work order. All parking and tolls will be the sole responsibility of the technician/provider. </strong></p><p><strong><u>**Please Note: If the merchant/client on-site wishes to request services with you directly, please advise them to reach out to their installation coordinator and let the Work Order manager know, immediately.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>You represent <del>** ********* ** ****** ** ****** ***</del> while onsite</p><p><strong>﻿While onsite, should any functionality questions around hardware arise from the merchant, POC, or other site contact, please raise to their SpotOn POS Implementation Specialist or ask the customer to speak to their SpotOn POS Representative. If they are unsure, please text (312) 450-0623 <del> *** *** ** ********* *****</del></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Form to be completed prior to departure:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Confirm with a text message to</span>&nbsp;(312) 450-0623&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">at least 1 hour before appointment start time</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Confirm with a text message to&nbsp;</span>(312) 450-0623<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"> upon arrival</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Onsite Checklist: </strong></p><ol><li>Introduce yourself to the manager</li><li>Walk with the manager to see where all equipment will be going</li><li><strong>Draw a diagram of where all POS equipment is going</strong>&nbsp;(Terminals, cash drawers, receipt printers, kitchen printers, credit card payment terminals)</li><li>Tone and test cabling for the future terminals, printers, and <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">kitchen screens.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">WRITE DOWN ANY LOCATIONS THAT ARE MISSING ETHERNET CABLING. </strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">LABEL ALL POS RELATED CABLES &amp; PORTS</strong></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">Connect your phone to the POS Wi-Fi and run a Speed test. Also write down the IP address assigned in the form link above. </span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">Print a test slip from a current POS printer and write down IP address in the form link above.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">Verify that the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">POS Wi-Fi</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">&nbsp;and the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">Ethernet cables</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">&nbsp;for printers are on the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">same network</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">&nbsp;(VERY IMPORTANT)</span></li><li>Confirm with a text message to (312) 450-0623 that checklist/closeout form has been received <strong>prior to departing.</strong></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>Equipment to be mapped out for future installation:</strong></p><ul><li>Listed in the custom field<strong> \"Full Hardware List*\"</strong></li></ul><p><strong><em><u>﻿</u></em></strong></p><p><strong>Requirements</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with the following experience</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">POS Installation Experience</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Basic Networking Knowledge</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Strong English Comprehension and Communication </span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tools Required:</strong><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </em></p><ul><li><em>﻿</em><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Cable tester</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Laptop or tablet</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Working phone camera for photos</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Spare CAT5e or CAT6 cables</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Required On-Site Deliverables </em></strong></p><ul><li>COMPLETED SITE SURVEY FORM</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(35, 70, 82);\">WRITE DOWN ANY PRINTERS / POS STATIONS THAT ARE MISSING ETHERNET CABLING</strong></li><li>Photos of the stations where all future equipment will live</li><li>Network Speed Tests (Screenshot or photo)</li><li>Onsite POC Signatures</li><li>Closeout Notes</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Communication Directory: </strong></p><ul><li>Please contact remote Support Line (312) 450-0623 for any questions or emergencies.</li><li>Confirm with a text message to (312) 450-0623 that checklist/closeout form has been received <strong>prior to departing.</strong></li></ul>","markdown":"**Additional hours or expenses (*cabling, etc.)* need to be pre-approved by the project manager prior to incurring on the work order. All parking and tolls will be the sole responsibility of the technician/provider.**\n\n**\\*\\*Please Note: If the merchant/client on-site wishes to request services with you directly, please advise them to reach out to their installation coordinator and let the Work Order manager know, immediately.**\n\nYou represent \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* while onsite\n\n**﻿While onsite, should any functionality questions around hardware arise from the merchant, POC, or other site contact, please raise to their SpotOn POS Implementation Specialist or ask the customer to speak to their SpotOn POS Representative. If they are unsure, please text (312) 450-0623  \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Form to be completed prior to departure:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n- Confirm with a text message to (312) 450-0623 at least 1 hour before appointment start time\n- Confirm with a text message to (312) 450-0623 upon arrival\n\n**Onsite Checklist:**\n\n1. Introduce yourself to the manager\n2. Walk with the manager to see where all equipment will be going\n3. **Draw a diagram of where all POS equipment is going** (Terminals, cash drawers, receipt printers, kitchen printers, credit card payment terminals)\n4. Tone and test cabling for the future terminals, printers, and kitchen screens. **WRITE DOWN ANY LOCATIONS THAT ARE MISSING ETHERNET CABLING.**\n5. **LABEL ALL POS RELATED CABLES & PORTS**\n6. Connect your phone to the POS Wi-Fi and run a Speed test. Also write down the IP address assigned in the form link above.\n7. Print a test slip from a current POS printer and write down IP address in the form link above.\n8. Verify that the **POS Wi-Fi** and the **Ethernet cables** for printers are on the **same network** (VERY IMPORTANT)\n9. Confirm with a text message to (312) 450-0623 that checklist/closeout form has been received **prior to departing.**\n\n**Equipment to be mapped out for future installation:**\n\n- Listed in the custom field **\"Full Hardware List\\*\"**\n\n***﻿***\n\n**Requirements****:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with the following experience\n- POS Installation Experience\n- Basic Networking Knowledge\n- Strong English Comprehension and Communication\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- *﻿*Cable tester\n- Laptop or tablet\n- Working phone camera for photos\n- Spare CAT5e or CAT6 cables\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n- COMPLETED SITE SURVEY FORM\n- **WRITE DOWN ANY PRINTERS / POS STATIONS THAT ARE MISSING ETHERNET CABLING**\n- Photos of the stations where all future equipment will live\n- Network Speed Tests (Screenshot or photo)\n- Onsite POC Signatures\n- Closeout Notes\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- Please contact remote Support Line (312) 450-0623 for any questions or emergencies.\n- Confirm with a text message to (312) 450-0623 that checklist/closeout form has been received **prior to departing.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-22T08:45","end":"2026-09-22T11:45"},"payRange":{"min":220,"max":220},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":59},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $220 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","e