{"job":{"id":19970125,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"EPC","title":"Printer Paper Jam","description":{"html":"<p>Dispenser's printer has a jam the store cannot clear.&nbsp;Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff.&nbsp;To clear the jam, remove the printer from the dispenser, and then remove the 4 phillips head screws from behind the brown cutter blade.&nbsp;<strong>Do not loosen the 2 screws near the yellow sticker.</strong>&nbsp;A full, step-by-step guide to removing the printer and removing the paper jam is included in the WO once it is accepted.&nbsp;Once the printer is put back together, confirm that it prints properly from card scans.</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.</span> </p><p>Call EPC to confirm and to close out the ticket.</p>","markdown":"Dispenser's printer has a jam the store cannot clear. Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff. To clear the jam, remove the printer from the dispenser, and then remove the 4 phillips head screws from behind the brown cutter blade. **Do not loosen the 2 screws near the yellow sticker.** A full, step-by-step guide to removing the printer and removing the paper jam is included in the WO once it is accepted. Once the printer is put back together, confirm that it prints properly from card scans.\n\nTake a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.\n\nCall EPC to confirm and to close out the ticket.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-17T09:00","end":"2026-09-17T10:00","latestStart":"2026-09-17T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $85 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-17T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-17T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco C9300 s