{"job":{"id":"5913568887","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05932216 - Town Hall C EPIK Install Revisit","description":"SOW: <br>1)TECH MUST CALL LCON, 30 MINUTES BEFORE ARRIVAL. <br>2)Upon arrival, departure, and for questions during the installation, check in with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at:<br>a)Bridge: +1 929-229-2436<br>b)Access Code: 595816994#<br>3)Review the SOW with Technical Coordination Team and proceed with the install.<br>4)Locate the following Granite-provided Equipment:   EPIK Router(s) (4 or 8 Port) and any additional accessories - Update to site specific models and quantities<br>a)Install EPIK router and accessories per site survey results and Installation Guide<br>b)Connect to customers switch on site (if approved) per site survey results<br>c)Power on Epik Edge <br>d)Use butt-set to confirm dial tone on 66 block (first 4 or 8 pairs on 66 Block)<br>e)Prewire lines to cross connect points as described on work order (TNs to be wired)<br>f)If pre-existing wiring is in use, DO NOT disconnect existing equipment without first checking in with the Epik Activations Team (do not perform cross connections before calling into the Epik Activations Team)<br>5)After installation is complete, Call into EPIK Activations Team Queue at:   833-719-8378 option 5<br>a)Have Activation Team confirm EPIK Edge is online in MyEpik and to take RSSI reading. Provide the 12-digit Epik Serial Number to the representative when calling in. (Ex: 000076410000)<br>b)Work with Epik Activations Team to cross connect and test each line<br>c)Work with customer’s alarm monitoring company &amp; customer LCONs as applicable during testing process<br>d)Test each line (port), Inbound, Outbound, E911 and confirm sync with laptop at each location. Troubleshoot if required. <br>6)Submit required deliverables to the following link: https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/40bc4abe49174bb7bb7a4e53895f21ff <br>7)Before departure check out with the E