{"job":{"id":19971154,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pro-Vigil","title":"Sanford Imports F2249TC PSD","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>For all inquiries and help, please call the Dispatch queue line from 9:00 AM CST to 6:00 PM CST.(726-666-5515)</u></strong></p><p><strong>Inquiries: Reschedule the workorders.Tracking numbers check for spare parts, Lifts Schedule check, POC not reachable, Please reach out to the dispatch queue line number</strong></p><p><strong>For all Technical information and help Please reach out to Field Tech Support--210-858-1108</strong></p><p><strong><u>**By accepting this work order, the service provider agrees that billable time is determined solely by Pro-Vigil’s documented Call In and Call Out timestamps. The service provider is required to Call In immediately upon arrival and Call Out prior to leaving the site, per the work order tasks**</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Technician must review the Standard Instructions &amp; Required Equipment under Client Documents PRIOR to accepting the work order.&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Pro-Vigil pays out revisits at the hourly rate. Any expenses other than hours logged should be discussed and approved by the Project Manager BEFORE closing this work order for payment.</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Please note that a 20tf ladder is required for ALL fixed site visits and a 10ft - 15ft. Step Ladder is required for ALL mobile visits!!!</u></strong></p><p><strong><em>*Cat6 Cable may be required to complete the work. To reduce the need to leave site and pick up cable, it is recommended&nbsp;to bring with up to 250 feet of Cat6 cable.&nbsp;IF the cable is used, you will be reimbursed at .65 cents a foot.</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>*** REVIEW ALL DOCUMENTS/NOTES. MUST CALL LOCATION CONTACT PRIOR TO GOING TO SITE. ALL PROVIDERS MUST HAVE PROPER PPE (HARD HATS, STEEL BOOTS/CARBON TIP BOOTS, SAFETY GLASSES, GLOVES, SAFETY VEST, AND IF OPERATING LIFT YOU MUST HAVE A HARNESS). IF THEY DO NOT AND GO TO SITE $200 WILL BE DEDUCTED FROM FINAL PAYOUT ***</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>F2249TC&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong><em><u>***Technician must should be called Fabrice Mukendi - 971-888-2787***</u></em></strong></p><p><strong>technician need to assist to a cable run</strong></p><p><strong>Technician need to know how to operate boom lift</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tools and Equipment:</p><p>Laptop (Windows OS)</p><p>Good internet connection</p><p>Cable tester</p><p>Volt Multimeter</p><p>RJ45 connectors</p><p>Patch cable</p><p>Ladder</p><p>Basic tools.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For Tech: Make sure all the below details are fulfilled and noted in the ticket during the tech visit with the required pictures.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Technician Instructions:</p><p>-------------------------</p><p>-Technician is to arrive on site and check in with site contact.</p><p>-Technician is to inspect power outlets to ensure power is available.</p><p>-If power is available, the technician is to inspect the power cord attached to the unit.</p><p>-If the power cord is undamaged and distributing proper power, the technician is to work with Field Tech Support to troubleshoot further power or internet components.</p><p>-Technician is to follow all steps outlined by Field Tech Support.</p><p>-Technician is to bring a unit to full functionality before leaving the site.</p><p>-Technician is to check out with site contact.</p><p><br></p><p>Axis IP utility.</p><p>Ship any old/unused parts back to Pro-Vigil. Use the following link to create a return shipping label.<u>https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfSRf6E_xqUu5REKVQ4RNgaUCBLWI2I3zUiX8eQLxV-aGEH7g/viewform?vc=0&amp;c=0&amp;w=1</u></p>","markdown":"**For all inquiries and help, please call the Dispatch queue line from 9:00 AM CST to 6:00 PM CST.(726-666-5515)**\n\n**Inquiries: Reschedule the workorders.Tracking numbers check for spare parts, Lifts Schedule check, POC not reachable, Please reach out to the dispatch queue lin