{"job":{"id":19985585,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Whole Foods-Mood Media 55\" Kiosk Screen Replacement - Lead","description":{"html":"<p>SOW:</p>\n<p>install a replacement Kiosk TV</p>\n<p>Issue: Vertical screen in center foyer is cracked</p>\n<p>Supporting Details:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Hardware Information</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Location: Central Foyer</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Defective Display: NRL_Door_FOH-kiosk-1up</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>–Bran: Unknown</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>–Model: Unknown</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>–Size: Unknown</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>–Serial Number: Unknown</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>–Mounting Type: Kiosk</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>1. Technician check in Requirements</p>\n<p>• Introduce yourself to the store MOD</p>\n<p>• Check in at the store’s front desk (no exceptions)</p>\n<p>• Confirm location of swap with the MOD</p>\n<p>• Record the MOD’s name who confirms location</p>\n<p>• Check in with mobile app.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>2. Review Documentation</p>\n<p>• Upon arrival, technician must review the “Tech Scope of Work – Screen Replacements v4.7.25”</p>\n<p>• This attachment includes REQUIRED steps during and after the install</p>\n<p>• Review case-specific instructions from the Mood dispatcher before starting</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>3. Screen Replacement Process</p>\n<p>• Inspect the replacement screen for damage and mounting alignment BEFORE removing the defective screen</p>\n<p>• Swap out the screen</p>\n<p>• Test new screen to confirm proper functionality and visual output</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>4. Special Instructions</p>\n<p>• Take before and after photos of work area.</p>\n<p>• Send to: moodservice@spencertech.com and wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com</p>\n<p>• Use Spencer Request ID in the subject line</p>\n<p>• Confirm work completion with the MOD.</p>\n<p>• Call Whole Foods Global Help Desk:</p>\n<p>• - 877-923-4263</p>\n<p>• - Tech will state “Vendor Checkout”</p>\n<p>• - When prompted, 