unting alignment BEFORE removing the defective screen\n\n• Swap out the screen\n\n• Test new screen to confirm proper functionality and visual output\n\n4\\. Special Instructions\n\n• Take before and after photos of work area.\n\n• Send to: moodservice@spencertech.com and wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com\n\n• Use Spencer Request ID in the subject line\n\n• Confirm work completion with the MOD.\n\n• Call Whole Foods Global Help Desk:\n\n• - 877-923-4263\n\n• - Tech will state “Vendor Checkout”\n\n• - When prompted, tech will choose option “4” for “Mood Media”\n\n• - Provide TASK/SR Number (e.g., INCXXXXX)\n\n• - Write down the agent’s name and closeout code.\n\n• Call Spencer Service to check out: 508-635-2037\n\n5\\. Final Steps Before Departure\n\n• Affix Return BOL (inside crate) to outside sleeve of crate\n\n• Inform Store that defective unit will be picked up within 5 business days\n\n• Take photo of BOL on crate\n\n• Place kiosk key back in the crate\n\n6\\. Required Equipment\n\n• Basic Hand Tools\n\n• TV Mounting Screws (variety)\n\n• Smartphone (photo + email capable)\n\n• Laptop (WiFi, Ethernet, 2-hour battery)\n\n• Cable Tester/Toner\n\n• Tape Measure\n\n• Consumables (tie wraps, velcro, tape, pull string, labels)\n\n7\\. Over Duration?\n\n• If more time is needed, tech MUST call Spencer for approval\n\n• No exceptions — Spencer will NOT approve extra time retroactively","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-18T13:00","end":"2026-09-18T14:00","latestStart":"2026-09-18T21:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":60},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/18/2026, 1:00:00 PM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"20