{"job":{"id":19985372,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ReBiz","title":"CCTV System Installation","description":{"html":"<p>We need to install 9 indoor and 2 outdoor <strong>IP cameras</strong>, <strong>NVR</strong>, at our store. The job includes:</p><ul><li><strong>Conducting a short, quick survey</strong> to assess any challenges at the store. Please let us know if you can complete the job today, or if you’ll need additional time or materials due to site conditions.</li><li><strong>Cable running</strong> through the ceiling to ensure neatness and optimal camera coverage.</li><li><strong>Mounting the cameras</strong> at designated points for maximum security and visibility.</li><li><strong>Connecting the cameras</strong>, DVR/NVR, and power supply to ensure seamless operation.</li><li><strong>System activation</strong>: Once everything is in place, you’ll need to bring the DVR online, ensure all cameras are connected, and verify with our remote IT team. They will check that they can access and you adjust the cameras as needed based on their instructions.</li></ul><p><strong><em>Tools Required: </em></strong><em>Ladder 10-12ft, laptop with SADPtoolkit and AnyDesk installed, CCTV tool kit, electrical and low voltage wiring tools, crimpers/Crimping tools, Cable tester, spot monitor / digital camera tester, and voltmeter.</em></p><p><strong><em>IMPORTANT NOTE:</em></strong></p><p>Tech should have Windows laptop with LAN Port. And all these apps must installed before coming to the store <strong>SADP, IP Portal, IP Scanner &amp; AnyDesk</strong></p><ul><li><strong><em>Please bring RJ45 connectors and Cat 6 Cables with you for the cable run .</em></strong></li><li><em>You need to upload the picture of serial number of each camera.</em></li><li><em>PLEASE DO NOT UNPLUG OR UNMOUNT THE STORE's EXISTING SYSTEM UNLESS OTHERWISE ADVISED. YOU ONLY NEED TO INSTALL THE NEW SIDE-BY-SIDE AND ENSURE THAT THE VIEW IS NOT BLOCKED BY EITHER OF THE CAMERAS</em></li><li><em>Technicians will not be permitted to stay in the store beyond closing time. If the job cannot be completed within the given time frame, technicians will need to revisit the store the following day, except on Saturdays and Sundays.</em></li><li><em>Technicians are advised to pack up and clean the store 30 minutes before it closes.</em></li></ul><p><strong><em>Please find a sketch of the camera placement attached.</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Onsite Tasks:</em></strong></p><ol><li><strong><em>Upon Arrival Check in with the ReBiz IT Team at <del>************</del> and reference ticket </em></strong><del>****</del><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\"><del>*******</del></span><del>****</del></li><li><strong><em>Follow other On-site tasks mentioned below</em></strong></li></ol><p><strong><em>﻿</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(55, 65, 81);\"><em><u>*Disclaimer: Payment will not be released if the assigned work order is not completed on-site.</u></em></strong></p>","markdown":"We need to install 9 indoor and 2 outdoor **IP cameras**, **NVR**, at our store. The job includes:\n\n- **Conducting a short, quick survey** to assess any challenges at the store. Please let us know if you can complete the job today, or if you’ll need additional time or materials due to site conditions.\n- **Cable running** through the ceiling to ensure neatness and optimal camera coverage.\n- **Mounting the cameras** at designated points for maximum security and visibility.\n- **Connecting the cameras**, DVR/NVR, and power supply to ensure seamless operation.\n- **System activation**: Once everything is in place, you’ll need to bring the DVR online, ensure all cameras are connected, and verify with our remote IT team. They will check that they can access and you adjust the cameras as needed based on their instructions.\n\n***Tools Required:*** *Ladder 10-12ft, laptop with SADPtoolkit and AnyDesk installed, CCTV tool kit, electrical and low voltage wiring tools, crimpers/Crimping tools, Cable tester, spot monitor / digital camera tester, and voltmeter.*\n\n***IMPORTANT NOTE:***\n\nTech should have Windows laptop with LAN Port. And all these apps must installed before coming to the store **SADP, IP Portal, IP Scanner & AnyDesk**\n\n- ***Please bring RJ45 connectors and Cat 6 Cables with you for the cable run .***\n- *You need to upload the picture of serial number of each camera.*\n- *PLEASE DO NOT UNPLUG OR UNMOUNT THE STORE's EXISTING SYSTEM UNLESS OTHERWISE ADVISED. YOU ONLY NEED TO INSTALL THE NEW SIDE-BY-SIDE AND ENSURE THAT THE VIEW IS NOT BLOCKED BY EITHER OF THE CAMERAS*\n- *Technicians will not be permitted to stay in the store beyond closing time. If the job cannot be completed within the given time frame, technicians will need to revisit the store the following day, except on Saturdays and Sundays.*\n- *Technicians are advised to pack up and clean the store 30 minutes before it closes.*\n\n***Please find a sketch of the camera placement attached.***\n\n***Onsite Tasks:***\n\n1. ***Upon Arrival Check in with the ReBiz IT Team at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and reference ticket*** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n2. ***Follow other On-site tasks mentioned below***\n\n***﻿***\n\n***\\*Disclaimer: Payment will not be released if the assigned work order is not completed on-site.***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-23T10:00","end":"2026-09-23T18:00","latestStart":"2026-09-23T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":500,"max":500},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":25},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Sep 23, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Wed, Sep 23, Thu, Sep 24, Fri, Sep 25 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:0