by applicable law.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. Equipment</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer is responsible for providing and maintaining all required tools, equipment, personal protective equipment (PPE), and transportation unless specifically stated otherwise within the work order.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. Property Damage</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Producer is responsible for exercising reasonable care while performing services. Any accidental damage to customer property, merchandise, fixtures, equipment, or facilities falls under Producers \"Assumption Of Risk\" (3) and must be reported to Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. Compliance with Customer Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to comply with all customer site rules, store policies, check-in procedures, and instructions provided by authorized customer representatives.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. Photographs &amp; Documentation</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to accurately complete all required documentation, photographs, signatures, and reporting before submitting this work order. Submission of false, incomplete, misleading, or altered information may result in non-payment and removal from future assignments.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Payment</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Payment is contingent upon:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Successful completion of the assigned scope of work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submission of all required documentation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Compliance with these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. Changes to Scope</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer shall no