{"job":{"id":"3783027066","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1131859.1 HP E786Z - Installed drums properly however still getting error message- Needing tech to troubleshoot","description":"<p>Customer Reference: 09172026-1 --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- ABM FEDERAL</p><p><br></p><p>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---</p><p>Please provide ETA for service</p><p><br></p><p>* MUST SPEAK WITH THE USER TO SET AN APT. </p><p>Tech needs an appointment with the end user, no Voicemail.</p><p>Need to provide the name of the tech so the site can put him on the security list.</p><p><br></p><p>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.</p><p><br></p><p>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.</p><p>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)</p><p><br></p><p>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.</p><p><br></p><p>Initial notes: HP E786Z - Installed drums properly however still getting error message- Needing tech to troubleshoot</p><p><br></p><p>Clean and Troubleshoot</p><p><br></p><p>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.</p><p>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login </p><p>techlink user name and password are the call number 1131859</p><p><br></p><p>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**</p><p><br></p><p>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.</p><p><br></p><p>General Instructions for All Calls-</p><p>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.</p><p>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot before replacing any parts.</p><p>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.</p><p>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.</p><p>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.</p><p>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.</p><p>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-18T08:00","end":"2026-09-18T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":53.9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/18/2026, 8:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{