{"job":{"id":19976145,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Quikk-IT Services LLC","title":"Printer Swap","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Service Description:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician: Sr. Networking/Infra Tech</li><li>Tech is required to replace the printer and then onboarding it in the stores printer management tool</li></ul><p>Estimated duration will be up to 2 hour(s)<em>.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Time onsite is delayed, and hours may exceed 2 hours to contact Kiara immediately </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************</del></span></li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Business casual is required. <em>e.g., collared shirt, pants, and appropriate shoe wear.</em></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">No stains, rips, or logo branding.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">No shorts or athletic wear.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">No open toe or \"running\" shoes (plain sneakers are okay).</li></ul><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong> <em>must haves</em></p><ul><li><em>﻿</em>Laptop with console capabilities</li><li>Cellular device with hotspot</li><li>Basic networking tools</li><li>Basic telephony tools</li><li>Basic hand tools</li></ul><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong><del>*** *** ******* ***** ****** ** ****** ****** **** ******** **** ***** ********</del></strong></p><p><strong><del>*********** ******** ** ******** ** **** **** ***** ********** ******* ** ****** ** ******</del></strong></p><ul><li>Techs are responsible for replacing the printer, and then onboarding it in the stores printer management tool. </li><li>I have attached instructions on how to replace the printers in the tool. </li><li>If for some reason a printer is in a room we can't access, tech should note it on check out and install the printer with a patch cable somewhere in the MDF. </li><li>The printer management tool has an \"add printer\" button as well. We can ask the store to do the physical swap. After the swap is done, we ask techs to place the old printer in the box.</li><li>Will have a smart-sheet checkout and can provide the username/password for the printer management tool</li><li>Work with remote support to confirm placement, angle/aim, etc.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><del>******** ******** ****** ************</del></p><p><del>***** ******* ******** ******** ********** ************</del></p><p><del>*****</del></p><p><strong>Pre Requirements</strong></p><ol><li>Confirm ETA: Call assigned manager <u>one day</u> prior to scheduled service to confirm arrival time/scope</li></ol><p><strong>Job Tasks</strong></p><ol><li>Pre-call: Call assigned manager prior to beginning survey</li><li>Check-in: Enable GPS for check in <u>OR</u> submit photo of current location with time stamp</li><li>Perform scope: Complete scope of work</li><li>Enter closeout notes: Enter detailed description of work performed, <u>must include</u>:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Site contact full name (that was present during service)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Details of the work performed unless noted elsewhere; <em>can be referenced if runbook/form was submitted</em>.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Any reimbursable materials must be noted with approving managers name.</li><li>Upload deliverables/expenses: Upload deliverables/expenses.</li><li>Post-call: Call assigned manager at conclusion of service to confirm receipt.</li><li>Check-out: Enable GPS for check out <u>OR</u> submit photo of current location with time stamp</li></ol><p><strong><em>Required Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Photos - upload pictures of any/all completed work, including, but not limited to...</li></ol><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Pre-approval:</strong> <em>Provider must obtain approval from assigned PM by presenting reason and details for additional hours/expenses prior to incurring.</em></li></ul>","markdown":"**Service Description:**\n\n- Seeking a technician: Sr. Networking/Infra Tech\n- Tech is required to replace the printer and then onboarding it in the stores printer management tool\n\nEstimated duration will be up to 2 hour(s)*.*\n\n- **Time onsite is delayed, and hours may exceed 2 hours to contact Kiara immediately** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Business casual is required. *e.g., collared shirt, pants, and appropriate shoe wear.*\n- No stains, rips, or logo branding.\n- No shorts or athletic wear.\n- No open toe or \"running\" shoes (plain sneakers are okay).\n\n**Tools Required:** *must haves*\n\n- *﻿*Laptop with console capabilities\n- Cellular device with hotspot\n- Basic networking tools\n- Basic telephony tools\n- Basic hand tools\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n**\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n- Techs are responsible for replacing the printer, and then onboarding it in the stores printer management tool.\n- I have attached instructions on how to replace the printers in the tool.\n- If for some reason a printer is in a room we can't access, tech should note it on check out and install the printer with a patch cable somewhere in the MDF.\n- The printer management tool has an \"add printer\" button as well. We can ask the store to do the physical swap. After the swap is done, we ask techs to place the old printer in the box.\n- Will have a smart-sheet checkout and can provide the username/password for the printer management tool\n- Work with remote support to confirm placement, angle/aim, etc.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Pre Requirements**\n\n1. Confirm ETA: Call assigned manager one day prior to scheduled service to confirm arrival time/scope\n\n**Job Tasks**\n\n1. Pre-call: Call assigned manager prior to beginning survey\n2. Check-in: Enable GPS for check in OR submit photo of current location with time stamp\n3. Perform scope: Complete scope of work\n4. Enter closeout notes: Enter detailed description of work performed, must include:\n5. Site contact full name (that was present during service)\n6. Details of the work performed unless noted elsewhere; *can be referenced if runbook/form was submitted*.\n7. Any reimbursable materials must be noted with approving managers name.\n8. Upload deliverables/expenses: Upload deliverables/expenses.\n9. Post-call: Call assigned manager at conclusion of service to confirm receipt.\n10. Check-out: Enable GPS for check out OR submit photo of current location with time stamp\n\n***Required Deliverables***\n\n1. Photos - upload pictures of any/all completed work, including, but not limited to...\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- **Pre-approval:** *Provider must obtain approval from assigned PM by presenting reason and details for additional hours/expenses prior to incurring.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T09:00","end":"2026-09-24T11:00","latestStart":"2026-09-24T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":150},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":14},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"