{"job":{"id":19920656,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Maintech","title":"Experienced L3 network tech needed to work with Maintech FE to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches with (2) new Cisco C9300 switches","description":{"html":"<p>Our customer, Marsh McLennan, is requesting <strong>experienced L3 network techs</strong> to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches and install (2) Cisco C9300 switches; work with them to test connections. We will be sending our local Maintech FE as one of the switch techs and you will be working with him onsite.</p><p><strong><u>SCOPE OF WORK - Important! Please read all notes to make sure you have the skills and experience requested, as well as the necessary tools!</u></strong></p><p>Site location: <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">100 Ridge View Drive, Pinnacle Business Park, Cary, NC 27511</span></p><p><strong>Friday, September 18th, 9AM EDT Start.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: inherit;\"><u>Note:</u></strong><span style=\"color: inherit;\"> It is important to label cables &amp; ports. Please bring a label maker or some other way of labeling these!</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">- </span>Un-patch and un-rack (2) WS-C3850-48P switches</p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">- Install 2 x Cisco 9300 switches</span></p><p>- Label the switches (will need to bring label machine)</p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">- Re-patch all required network connections as needed</span></p><p>- Remove the network connections no longer needed</p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">- Test and troubleshoot wired connections as needed&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">- May be required to provide remote console access with laptop, hotspot. Please bring console cable!</span></p><p>MMC to provide remote configuration, guidance and support</p><p><strong>Note: all cabling must be neatly wrapped and secured. Please bring velcro or similar tie-wraps. Neatness is a must!&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Contact info will be provided.</p>","markdown":"Our customer, Marsh McLennan, is requesting **experienced L3 network techs** to swap out (2) Cisco 3850 switches and install (2) Cisco C9300 switches; work with them to test connections. We will be sending our local Maintech FE as one of the switch techs and you will be working with him onsite.\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK - Important! Please read all notes to make sure you have the skills and experience requested, as well as the necessary tools!**\n\nSite location: 100 Ridge View Drive, Pinnacle Business Park, Cary, NC 27511\n\n**Friday, September 18th, 9AM EDT Start.**\n\n**Note:** It is important to label cables & ports. Please bring a label maker or some other way of labeling these!\n\n\\- Un-patch and un-rack (2) WS-C3850-48P switches\n\n\\- Install 2 x Cisco 9300 switches\n\n\\- Label the switches (will need to bring label machine)\n\n\\- Re-patch all required network connections as needed\n\n\\- Remove the network connections no longer needed\n\n\\- Test and troubleshoot wired connections as needed\n\n\\- May be required to provide remote console access with laptop, hotspot. Please bring console cable!\n\nMMC to provide remote configuration, guidance and support\n\n**Note: all cabling must be neatly wrapped and secured. Please bring velcro or similar tie-wraps. Neatness is a must!**\n\nContact info will be provided.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-18T09:00","end":"2026-09-18T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":480},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/18/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"202