e. However, we need to be notified of those problems before you become late, not after.\n\nAll dispatch orders require that all the listed deliverables within the Scope of Work be provided in order to be paid out. Any work order that is marked as “Complete” without meeting all of the listed deliverables will be subject to a penalty of 20% docked off of its pay.\n\nIf you fail to abide by the terms and conditions within these instructions and/or by the terms and conditions of FieldNation. This ticket will be closed for zero (0) dollars. By accepting this work order, you acknowledge and agree to these terms.\n\nYou will be given a 48-hour period after the completion of your work to submit for any expense reimbursements and/or budget increase requests. If there are no requests submitted, after the 48-hour mark, the Work Order will be closed and paid based upon the hourly rate.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-21T13:00","end":"2026-09-21T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":92,"max":184},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":92,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":52},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $184 (countered: $184) is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary"