lutions don't match.*\n\n **6**\n\n**Wi-Fi (Staff, Student, & Guest)**\n\n Check availability and accessibility of all 3 wi-fi networks on campus.\n\n Use your cellphone or laptop to connect to Guest wi-fi to sure it is functional. Ask staff if Staff and\n\nStudent wi-fis are functional as well.\n\n **7**\n\n**Firestick & TV**\n\n Reboot firestick and tv - unplug the firestick from tv and power for 2 minutes and plug it back to reboot.\n\nTroubleshoot firesticks that have problems.\n\n Cable management for TVs is required.\n\n **8**\n\n**Desktop Printer**\n\n Make sure printer is functional. Check for physical blemishes and/or missing parts.\n\n **picture of Printer config page**\n\n **9**\n\n**Photocopier**\n\n Make sure copier is functional - able to print, scan, and scan-to-email. Check for physical blemishes and/or missing parts.\n\npicture of config page\n\n**10**\n\nCheck ALL staff workstations and make sure monitors are securely connected to docking stations and cabling adequately managed to avoid interference with staff work.\n\n- **After accepting the work order there is no further negotiation regarding travel. All travel expenses must be negotiated and approved before accepting work order. This does not include tolls or parking. Those will be reimbursed with an uploaded receipt.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00","end":"2026-09-23T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":240},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":64},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $240 (countered: $240) is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:0