{"job":{"id":19989828,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"DiverseNet","title":"Troubleshoot Network Outage","description":{"html":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT NOTES</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Technician must upload all deliverables before calling DiverseNet to check out or leaving site</li>\n<li>Technician must call to check in and out with DiverseNet to receive full payment</li>\n<li>Technician must arrive during the given time frame to receive full payment</li>\n<li>Any out of scope work, or time logged past the not to exceed amount, must be approved by DiverseNet to receive payment</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>SKILLS, TOOLS, MATERIALS AND DRESS CODE</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>Skills</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Low Voltage Cabling</li>\n<li>A/V</li>\n<li>Networking</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Tools/Materials</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>USB Keyboard and USB Mouse&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Laptop with a physical network port OR a USB network adapter (RJ45) and must have HDMI, VGA</li>\n<li>Smartphone with camera</li>\n<li>Cat5/6 Tester</li>\n<li>Cable Toner and Wand</li>\n<li>Multimeter</li>\n<li>Crimper (Cat-5/6)</li>\n<li>Flashlight</li>\n<li>Network Termination Tools</li>\n<li>Basic Hand Tools</li>\n<li>Spare VGA, DVI and Cat5/6 Patch Cables (for testing)</li>\n<li>Extension Cord</li>\n<li>Tape Measure</li>\n<li>Velcro</li>\n<li>8ft Ladder</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Dress Code</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Close toed shoes</li>\n<li>Long pants</li>\n<li>Collared shirt</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>CHECK IN INSTRUCTIONS AND ESCALATION</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We will be representing <del>********</del> while on site.</li>\n<li>Check in with DiverseNet at&nbsp;317-536-6000 opt 2 and reference case number&nbsp;00051398\n<ul>\n<li>Ask for&nbsp;check in code and document</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Check in with <del>******** **** ************</del> to verify location of equipment</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Use the following escalation path for all issues onsite:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><del>******** ******* ** ***** ******** *** ********* ****** ****** *********</del></li>\n<li>If first&nbsp;contact is non-responsive call&nbsp;DiverseNet at&nbsp;317-536-6000 opt 2</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>DESCRIPTION OF WORK</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>For any issues onsite call <del>********</del> support at<del>***** ********</del> and reference ticket number<del>*********</del></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Property Name: InTown Suites Extended Stay Raleigh NC(YRN)</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Address: 3215 Capital Blvd Raleigh, NC 27604-3337</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Site ID: C00743/YRN</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>POC: Jonathan Dill</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>POC's phone and Email: 919-645-4700 | Jonathan.Dill@intownsuites.com</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Case Number: CS0419385</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>The property is currently experiencing a network outage. A technician is required to trace and troubleshoot the network connections, verify the status of the equipment, and, if necessary, connect a laptop via console to the switches to restore connectivity.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Technician's Scope of Work:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>NOTE: Take pictures of before and after of your work per each rooms and upload it to WO and send it to support@worldvue.com.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>1. Reach out to support at 419-879-3156 and provide case #CS0419385</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>2. Coordinate with the property POC to gain access to the equipment room. Work alongside the Advanced Support agent to bring the network online.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>3. Once equipment are all up and running, collaborate with the site POC to test the WiFi throughout the whole property</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>4. Verify that WiFi service is functioning properly.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>5. Address and resolve any additional issues that may arise.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tools/Parts needed:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Networking tools kit</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Console cables</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- CAT6 cable white</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Cable tester</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- RJ45s</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Windows Laptop with WI-FI and LAN connectivity</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Ladder</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Signed Work Order with Date and Times</li>\n<li>All work completed</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>CHECK OUT INSTRUCTIONS</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out&nbsp;with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 x2 and reference case number&nbsp;00051398\n<ul>\n<li>Ask for&nbsp;check out&nbsp;code and document</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTES**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Technician must upload all deliverables before calling DiverseNet to check out or leaving site\n- Technician must call to check in and out with DiverseNet to receive full payment\n- Technician must arrive during the given time frame to receive full payment\n- Any out of scope work, or time logged past the not to exceed amount, must be approved by DiverseNet to receive payment\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**SKILLS, TOOLS, MATERIALS AND DRESS CODE**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**Skills**\n\n- Low Voltage Cabling\n- A/V\n- Networking\n\n**Tools/Materials**\n\n- USB Keyboard and USB Mouse\n- Laptop with a physical network port OR a USB network adapter (RJ45) and must have HDMI, VGA\n- Smartphone with camera\n- Cat5/6 Tester\n- Cable Toner and Wand\n- Multimeter\n- Crimper (Cat-5/6)\n- Flashlight\n- Network Termination Tools\n- Basic Hand Tools\n- Spare VGA, DVI and Cat5/6 Patch Cables (for testing)\n- Extension Cord\n- Tape Measure\n- Velcro\n- 8ft Ladder\n\n**Dress Code**\n\n- Close toed shoes\n- Long pants\n- Collared shirt\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**CHECK IN INSTRUCTIONS AND ESCALATION**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- We will be representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* while on site.\n- Check in with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 opt 2 and reference case number 00051398 \n  - Ask for check in code and document\n- Check in with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* to verify location of equipment\n\nUse the following escalation path for all issues onsite:\n\n1. \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n2. If first contact is non-responsive call DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 opt 2\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**DESCRIPTION OF WORK**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- For any issues onsite call \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* support at\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and reference ticket number\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nProperty Name: InTown Suites Extended Stay Raleigh NC(YRN)\n\nAddress: 3215 Capital Blvd Raleigh, NC 27604-3337\n\nSite ID: C00743/YRN\n\nPOC: Jonathan Dill\n\nPOC's phone and Email: 919-645-4700 | Jonathan.Dill@intownsuites.com\n\nCase Number: CS0419385\n\nThe property is currently experiencing a network outage. A technician is required to trace and troubleshoot the network connections, verify the status of the equipment, and, if necessary, connect a laptop via console to the switches to restore connectivity.\n\nTechnician's Scope of Work:\n\nNOTE: Take pictures of before and after of your work per each rooms and upload it to WO and send it to support@worldvue.com.\n\n1\\. Reach out to support at 419-879-3156 and provide case #CS0419385\n\n2\\. Coordinate with the property POC to gain access to the equipment room. Work alongside the Advanced Support agent to bring the network online.\n\n3\\. Once equipment are all up and running, collaborate with the site POC to test the WiFi throughout the whole property\n\n4\\. Verify that WiFi service is functioning properly.\n\n5\\. Address and resolve any additional issues that may arise.\n\nTools/Parts needed:\n\n\\- Networking tools kit\n\nConsole cables\n\n\\- CAT6 cable white\n\n\\- Cable tester\n\n\\- RJ45s\n\n\\- Windows Laptop with WI-FI and LAN connectivity\n\n\\- Ladder\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Signed Work Order with Date and Times\n- All work completed\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**CHECK OUT INSTRUCTIONS**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Check out with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 x2 and reference case number 00051398 \n  - Ask for check out code and document","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-18T18:30","end":"2026-09-18T22:30","latestStart":"2026-09-18T21:30"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":400},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":100,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/18/2026, 6:30:00 PM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T20:00:00.000Z","summary