{"job":{"id":19989953,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Integris","title":"11412660 - Connect firewall to newly installed internet circuit | Est. Time on Site : 2 hours| Console Cable, laptop, Smart-hands ","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in server room maintenance with an integris Network Engineer remotely assisting</li><li>Tech is required to go onsite, get access to the server room, call Integris for assistance, and allow Integris' network engineer to access the firewall remotely through the laptop. Follow the engineer's instructions on where to plug and unplug the server as needed.</li><li>Once you have arrived call the WO Manager then ask for our onsite-contact Jaime Walker to provide access to the premises</li><li>Estimated duration will be 2 hours</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tools Required:&nbsp;</strong><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">must haves</em></p><ul><li><em>﻿Console Cable</em></li><li><em>Laptop</em></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Escalation Process:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Contact WO Manager at </span>(612) 927-2627<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> Jeanine Ross if the following are true:</span></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Jeanine Ross</li><li>Backup WO manager is (404) 551-5492 Seth Matthews</li><li>Any technical issues or questions should be escalated to the Network engineer. Jeanine or Seth can provide this resource</li></ul><p><br></p><p>EXPENSES POLICY</p><p>We do <strong>not typically reimburse expenses</strong>. The compensation listed in the work order covers both labor and travel.</p><p>However, we may make <strong>exceptions for materials only</strong> (e.g., USB drives, cabling) <strong>on a case-by-case basis</strong> and <strong>only with prior approval</strong>.</p><p>The following are <strong>not reimbursable</strong> unless explicitly stated:</p><ul><li>Travel costs (gas, mileage, hotel, airfare, etc.)</li><li>Parking or tolls</li><li>Meals or breaks</li><li>Any other general expenses</li></ul><p><br></p><p>CHECK-IN AND PAYMENT</p><p><strong>Upon arrival onsite, you must call your assigned remote technician asap.</strong></p><p>This marks your official start time.</p><ul><li>You are only paid for the time working with the remote technician.</li><li>Time will be verified using remote tech logs.</li><li>Early arrival wait time is not compensated.</li><li>You may be asked to adjust your time entry if it does not match our records.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in server room maintenance with an integris Network Engineer remotely assisting\n- Tech is required to go onsite, get access to the server room, call Integris for assistance, and allow Integris' network engineer to access the firewall remotely through the laptop. Follow the engineer's instructions on where to plug and unplug the server as needed.\n- Once you have arrived call the WO Manager then ask for our onsite-contact Jaime Walker to provide access to the premises\n- Estimated duration will be 2 hours\n\n**Tools Required:** *must haves*\n\n- *﻿Console Cable*\n- *Laptop*\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\nContact WO Manager at (612) 927-2627 Jeanine Ross if the following are true:\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Jeanine Ross\n- Backup WO manager is (404) 551-5492 Seth Matthews\n- Any technical issues or questions should be escalated to the Network engineer. Jeanine or Seth can provide this resource\n\nEXPENSES POLICY\n\nWe do **not typically reimburse expenses**. The compensation listed in the work order covers both labor and travel.\n\nHowever, we may make **exceptions for materials only** (e.g., USB drives, cabling) **on a case-by-case basis** and **only with prior approval**.\n\nThe following are **not reimbursable** un