{"job":{"id":19989992,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Whole Foods-Mood Media 55\" Kiosk Screen Replacement - Lead","description":{"html":"<p>WFM TASK/INCIDENT number: TASK6308306</p>\n<p>Install a replacement Kiosk TV</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Issue: Vertical screen in center foyer is cracked</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Hardware Information</p>\n<p>Location: Central Foyer</p>\n<p>Defective Display: NRL_Door_FOH-kiosk-1up</p>\n<p>–Mounting Type: Kiosk</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Service Logistics</p>\n<p>Ladder Needed: N</p>\n<p>Lift Needed: N</p>\n<p>Specialty Tools Required: N</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>1. Technician check in Requirements</p>\n<p>• Introduce yourself to the store MOD</p>\n<p>• Check in at the store’s front desk (no exceptions)</p>\n<p>• Confirm location of swap with the MOD</p>\n<p>• Record the MOD’s name who confirms location</p>\n<p>• Check in with mobile app.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>2. Review Documentation</p>\n<p>• Upon arrival, technician must review the “Tech Scope of Work – Screen Replacements v4.7.25”</p>\n<p>• This attachment includes REQUIRED steps during and after the install</p>\n<p>• Review case-specific instructions from the Mood dispatcher before starting</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>3. Screen Replacement Process</p>\n<p>• Inspect the replacement screen for damage and mounting alignment BEFORE removing the defective screen</p>\n<p>• Swap out the screen</p>\n<p>• Test new screen to confirm proper functionality and visual output</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>4. Special Instructions</p>\n<p>• Take before and after photos of work area.</p>\n<p>• Send to: moodservice@spencertech.com and wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com</p>\n<p>• Use Spencer Request ID in the subject line</p>\n<p>• Confirm work completion with the MOD.</p>\n<p>• Call Whole Foods Global Help Desk:</p>\n<p>• - 877-923-4263</p>\n<p>• - Tech will state “Vendor Checkout”</p>\n<p>• - When prompted, tech will choose option “4” for “Mood Media”</p>\n<p>• - Provide TASK/SR Number (e.g., INCXXXXX)</p>\n<p>• - Write down the agent’s name and closeout code.</p>\n<p>• Call Spencer Service to check out: 508-635-2037</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>5. Final Steps Before Departure</p>\n<p>• Affix Return BOL (inside crate) to outside sleeve of crate</p>\n<p>• Inform Store that defective unit will be picked up within 5 business days</p>\n<p>• Take photo of BOL on crate</p>\n<p>• Place kiosk key back in the crate</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>6. Required Equipment</p>\n<p>• Basic Hand Tools</p>\n<p>• TV Mounting Screws (variety)</p>\n<p>• Smartphone (photo + email capable)</p>\n<p>• Laptop (WiFi, Ethernet, 2-hour battery)</p>\n<p>• Cable Tester/Toner</p>\n<p>• Tape Measure</p>\n<p>• Consumables (tie wraps, velcro, tape, pull string, labels)</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>7. Over Duration?</p>\n<p>• If more time is needed, tech MUST call Spencer for approval</p>\n<p>• No exceptions — Spencer will NOT approve extra time retroactively</p>","markdown":"WFM TASK/INCIDENT number: TASK6308306\n\nInstall a replacement Kiosk TV\n\nIssue: Vertical screen in center foyer is cracked\n\nHardware Information\n\nLocation: Central Foyer\n\nDefective Display: NRL\\_Door\\_FOH-kiosk-1up\n\n–Mounting Type: Kiosk\n\nService Logistics\n\nLadder Needed: N\n\nLift Needed: N\n\nSpecialty Tools Required: N\n\n1\\. Technician check in Requirements\n\n• Introduce yourself to the store MOD\n\n• Check in at the store’s front desk (no exceptions)\n\n• Confirm location of swap with the MOD\n\n• Record the MOD’s name who confirms location\n\n• Check in with mobile app.\n\n2\\. Review Documentation\n\n• Upon arrival, technician must review the “Tech Scope of Work – Screen Replacements v4.7.25”\n\n• This attachment includes REQUIRED steps during and after the install\n\n• Review case-specific instructions from the Mood dispatcher before starting\n\n3\\. Screen Replacement Process\n\n• Inspect the replacement screen for damage and mounting alignment BEFORE removing the defective screen\n\n• Swap out the screen\n\n• Test new screen to confirm proper functionality and visual output\n\n4\\. Special Instructions\n\n• Take before and after photos of work area.\n\n• Send to: moodservice@spencertech.com and wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com\n\n• Use Spencer Request ID in the subject line\n\n• Confirm work completion with the MOD.\n\n• Call Whole Foods Global Help Desk:\n\n• - 877-923-4263\n\n• - Tech will state “Vendor Checkout”\n\n• - When prompted, tech will choose option “4” for “Mood Media”\n\n• - Provide TASK/SR Number (e.g., INCXXXXX)\n\n• - Write down the agent’s name and closeout code.\n\n• Call Spencer Service to check out: 508-635-2037\n\n5\\. Final Steps Before Departure\n\n• Affix Return BOL (inside crate) to outside sleeve of crate\n\n• Inform Store that defective unit will be picked up within 5 business days\n\n• Take photo of BOL on crate\n\n• Place kiosk key back in the crate\n\n6\\. Required Equipment\n\n• Basic Hand Tools\n\n• TV Mounting Screws (variety)\n\n• Smartphone (photo + email capable)\n\n• Laptop (WiFi, Ethernet, 2-hour battery)\n\n• Cable Tester/Toner\n\n• Tape Measure\n\n• Consumables (tie wraps, velcro, tape, pull string, labels)\n\n7\\. Over Duration?\n\n• If more time is needed, tech MUST call Spencer for approval\n\n• No exceptions — Spencer will NOT approve extra time retroactively","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-21T13:00","end":"2026-09-21T14:00","latestStart":"2026-09-21T21:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":60},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $60 (countered: $60) is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"202