{"job":{"id":19990254,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Gigstreem","title":"Cortland Midtown East Vue 64 - Install #321085","description":{"html":"<p><strong>GiGstreem is a national Internet Service Provider delivering high-quality service to residential and commercial properties across the country.</strong></p><p><strong>Work Order Location:</strong></p><p><strong>Residential Property –</strong>&nbsp;<em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Raleigh NC 27604</em></p><p><em>Refer to confidential notes for exact address and customer contact information.</em></p><p><strong>Objective:</strong></p><p><strong>Install a new/existing Ethernet line to support a ceiling-mounted access point and activate one existing wall data port inside the unit.</strong></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><ul><li>Route the CAT6 Ethernet line along the exterior of the unit and route it into the unit at the designated entry point.</li><li>Make the necessary drywall access cuts to route the Ethernet cable through the ceiling to the proposed AP location.</li><li>Install and connect the new ceiling-mounted access point.</li><li>Extend the hardline AP connection back to the unit media panel.</li><li>Complete the required connections inside the media panel to activate one existing wall data port in the unit.</li><li>Connect and configure the AP with Gigstreem Support.</li><li>Test the AP, Ethernet line, and activated wall port to verify proper connectivity and operation.</li><li>Patch all drywall access openings created during the installation.</li><li>Match the existing wall and ceiling texture as closely as possible.</li><li>Prime and paint all repaired areas to match the existing finish.</li><li>Clean the work area and remove all installation debris.</li></ul><p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p><ul><li>Operational ceiling-mounted AP</li><li>One active wall Ethernet port</li><li>Tested CAT6 connection</li><li>Completed drywall patching and painting</li><li>Photos of the completed installation and test results</li><li><br></li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>If this is something that we are able to assist please proviode some date and times that you are available and quote so we can approved this install.</strong></li></ul>","markdown":"**GiGstreem is a national Internet Service Provider delivering high-quality service to residential and commercial properties across the country.**\n\n**Work Order Location:**\n\n**Residential Property –** *Raleigh NC 27604*\n\n*Refer to confidential notes for exact address and customer contact information.*\n\n**Objective:**\n\n**Install a new/existing Ethernet line to support a ceiling-mounted access point and activate one existing wall data port inside the unit.**\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n- Route the CAT6 Ethernet line along the exterior of the unit and route it into the unit at the designated entry point.\n- Make the necessary drywall access cuts to route the Ethernet cable through the ceiling to the proposed AP location.\n- Install and connect the new ceiling-mounted access point.\n- Extend the hardline AP connection back to the unit media panel.\n- Complete the required connections inside the media panel to activate one existing wall data port in the unit.\n- Connect and configure the AP with Gigstreem Support.\n- Test the AP, Ethernet line, and activated wall port to verify proper connectivity and operation.\n- Patch all drywall access openings created during the installation.\n- Match the existing wall and ceiling texture as closely as possible.\n- Prime and paint all repaired areas to match the existing finish.\n- Clean the work area and remove all installation debris.\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n- Operational ceiling-mounted AP\n- One active wall Ethernet port\n- Tested CAT6 connection\n- Completed drywall patching and painting\n- Photos of the completed installation and test results\n- \n\n- **If this is something that we are able to assist please proviode some date and times that you are available and quote so we can approved this install.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-18T08:00","end":"2026-09-18T09:00","latestStart":"2026-09-18T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":600},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":5,"amount":100}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/18/2026, 8:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-18T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"