{"job":{"id":"3742379540","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"P2 on-site investigation for persistent slow DIA speeds","description":"**Issue:**<br>Customer reports persistent slow DIA speeds, approximately 200 Mbps down and 7 Mbps up versus the 500 Mbps service, measured from a laptop connected by Ethernet. CONTERRA reviewed the circuit, found no outage, confirmed it online, and observed drops/packets on port 1. The customer selected P2 service; customer also reports prior email replies bounce because the mailbox is full.<br><br>CIRCUIT DETAILS<br>Service Type: DIA<br>Carrier: CONTERRA<br>CXR Circuit ID: CTS44797<br>NSO ID: N/A<br>WAN IP: N/A<br>LAN Gateway: 216.45.27.1<br>MAC Address: N/A<br><br>**Required Equipment at all times:**<br>Laptop with admin access, Console cable, Ethernet tester, 4G aircard or Hotspot, remote access capabilities (Teamviewer, Join.me or Fastsupport), Butt Set, Extra patch cables<br><br>**SOW:**<br>Tech must check in via WorkMarket and be ready to start the Scope of Work.<br>Tech must call in to DIA Repair at 844-492-2557 option 3 to work with a rep. If tech is unable to reach DIA Repair, tech must leave a voicemail requesting a call back.<br>Tech must locate the Granite-managed edgeboot/router, media converter, and carrier handoff/NID at the site.<br>Tech must inspect power, cabling, fiber/ethernet connections, link status, and interface error/drop counters through the customer-to-carrier path.<br>Tech must test throughput from the Granite-managed handoff using a wired test device and compare downstream and upstream results with the 500 Mbps service.<br>Tech must isolate whether the degradation is caused by on-site equipment, cabling, the customer LAN, or the carrier handoff, and correct any customer-side fault found.<br>Tech must document test results and any equipment, cabling, or interface repair or replacement performed.<br>Tech must run ping and speed tests and send the results to NetOpsAccess@granitenet.com with subject 'DIA/IW ticket #6966558'.<br>Tech must confirm connectivity with the Granite rep before release.<br>Tech must take pictures of the equipment and the work performed.<br>Tech must close out via WorkMarket.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-21T07:30","end":"2026-09-21T11:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":260},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":37.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":260,"estHours":4,"travelExpense":60,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.00