{"job":{"id":19991064,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Register #3 - Troubleshoot - Continuously beeping with loud sound","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Register #3 - Troubleshoot - Continuously beeping with loud sound</strong></p>\n<p>Dispatching tech to investigate loud beeping on Reg. 3, possible POST beep codes</p>\n<p>tech to call Shyft/AVT National Tech Support at<del>************* *** **</del></p>\n<p><del>******** *******************</del></p>\n<p>Clients present issue: Reg. 3 continuously beeping with loud sound</p>\n<p>Estimated time: 2 hours</p>\n<p>Part shipped to the site? No</p>\n<p>Required Tool List:</p>\n<p>https://sigtech.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/i0000000JqJY/a/5A000000YQTH/9gnaImll4VecAy1sI2UPOKqG7leVPWHltq_ila4IVaA</p>\n<p>Completion Requirements:</p>\n<p><strong>Closing Notes</strong> – <strong>Should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only.</strong> If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be a detailed and concise statement about the work performed. <strong>Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>2. <strong>Part Information</strong>:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Unused Parts</strong>: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.</p>\n<p><strong>Used Parts</strong>: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.</p>\n<p><strong>Missing Return Label</strong>: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.</p>\n<p><strong>General Rules</strong>: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.</p>","markdown":"1\\. **Scope of Work** **includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.**\n\n**Register #3 - Troubleshoot - Continuously beeping with loud sound**\n\nDispatching tech to investigate loud beeping on Reg. 3, possible POST beep codes\n\ntech to call Shyft/AVT National Tech Support at\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nClients present issue: Reg. 3 continuously beeping with loud sound\n\nEstimated time: 2 hours\n\nPart shipped to the site? No\n\nRequired Tool List:\n\nhttps://sigtech.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/i0000000JqJY/a/5A000000YQTH/9gnaImll4VecAy1sI2UPOKqG7leVPWHltq_ila4IVaA\n\nCompletion Requirements:\n\n**Closing Notes** – **Should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only.** If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be a detailed and concise statement about the work performed. **Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.**\n\n2\\. **Part Information**:\n\n**Unused Parts**: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Used Parts**: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Missing Return Label**: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.\n\n**General Rules**: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-19T07:00","end":"2026-09-19T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":80},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.75,"distance":57},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/19/2026, 7:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09