{"job":{"id":19991211,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"PROJECT CALL - NCR XR7 POS TERMINAL:  replace and reimage Register 09 at Store #791.","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Ticket Description from Customer: </u></strong>ITSD-291466 Store 791 Replace/Reimage Register 09 (All Parts onsite)</p><p>ITSD-291466 Store 791 Replace/Reimage Register 09 (All Parts onsite)</p><p>Please call the Help Desk with your ETA before arriving on site.</p><p><br></p><p>ITSD #: ITSD-291466</p><p><br></p><p>Please schedule a technician to replace and reimage Register 09 at Store #791.</p><p><br></p><p>Equipment required — please bring the following:</p><p>&nbsp;• Wired USB keyboard</p><p>&nbsp;• Wired XR7 reimage instructions</p><p>&nbsp;(Note: XR7 is already on site)</p><p><br></p><p>⚠ Important: Before starting, disconnect the SigCap from the XR7.</p><p>Keep the SigCap unplugged throughout the entire reimage process.</p><p><br></p><p>─────────────────────────────────────</p><p>REIMAGE INFORMATION&nbsp;(~1 hour to complete)</p><p>─────────────────────────────────────</p><p>POS Host Name:&nbsp;&nbsp;0791reg09&nbsp;&nbsp;← must be lowercase</p><p>IP Address:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;172.22.216.29</p><p>Default Route:&nbsp;&nbsp;172.22.216.1</p><p>Test System:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;C_PRODUCTION</p><p>Primary DNS:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10.242.145.19</p><p>Secondary DNS:&nbsp;&nbsp;10.246.145.19</p><p>Serial Number:&nbsp;&nbsp;20-55323215</p><p>─────────────────────────────────────</p><p><br></p><p>Post-reimage steps:</p><p>&nbsp;1. When prompted, reboot the lane.</p><p>&nbsp;2. If the lane reboots and shows a red X in the bottom right of the screen,</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;call the Help Desk immediately to reissue the data cache.</p><p>&nbsp;3. Call the Help Desk once the reimage is complete and confirmed working</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;with a store manager.</p><p><br></p><p>Please drive carefully and have a great day!</p><p><br></p><p>On Site Contact Name: Trader Jord Help Desk</p><p>On Site Contact Phone: 855-844-8679 (Press Option 2)</p><p>On Site Contact Email: helpdesk@traderjoes.com</p><p>Problem Type: HARD DISK FAILURE</p><p>Location Subtype: N/A</p><p>Lane Number (if applicable): 09</p><p>Client Ticket Number/External Reference ID: ITSD-291466</p><p><strong><u>Lane Number:09</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Contact Directory</u></strong></p><p><strong>Pomeroy Dispatch Center: 704-414-5131 Operating: 24/7/365</strong></p><ul><li>Check-in/Check-out, Scheduling/Delays getting to site, Additional time on site, Shipping, TRS Password, <strong>After-Hours Support 8PM-8AM EST</strong>, Expenses preauthorization, all expenses must be preauthorized.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Pomeroy TSS – Technical Support: 704-414-5111 Operating: 8AM-8PM EST/365</strong></p><ul><li>Technical support, Documentation walkthrough, will engage TDJ support if required. <strong>***Do not contact TDJ for support.</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Trader Joe’s Service Desk: 855-844-8679 (Option #2) Operating: 4:30AM-11:30PM PST</strong></p><ul><li>Provider must Check-in with TDJ prior to beginning work and Check-out after work is completed.</li><li>If you can't reach the Trader Joe's Helpdesk, please wait 5 min before trying again. Once you dial their number, please press option 2 to speak with a helpdesk coordinator.</li><li><strong><em>Do not contact TDJ for support or work instructions, you must reach out to Pomeroy for support, if you reach out to TDJ for support, a penalty will be applied to the work order. </em></strong></li></ul><p><strong><em>﻿</em></strong></p><p><strong><u>Dress Code</u></strong>: Business casual. Need to maintain a Professional appearance.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Items to bring:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Basic Tool Set</li></ul><p><strong>*Only accept this job if you have all the required tools and are able to make the required time frame.*</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Technical Documentation:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Technical Resource Site:</strong> https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703</p><p>https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-whole-unit-removalreplacement</p><p>https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-bios-settings</p><p><strong>Login ID:</strong> fieldnation@client.pomeroy.com</p><p><strong>Login PW:&nbsp;</strong>If not provided in Messages section, please call Pomeroy Dispatch Center</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Parts Shipment:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Parts (if required) will be couriered to the site; arrival is typically within 4 hours of ticket creation. Please verify with the Pomeroy Dispatch Center that any part(s) has been delivered to resolve issue.</li><li>You may be scheduled to arrive prior to part arrival, due to SLA, please troubleshoot in advance to determine if part is actually required.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Parts Handling Requirements:</u></strong></p><ol><li>Parts return is the responsibility of the assigned Provider. DO NOT LEAVE PARTS ONSITE, unless authorized by Pomeroy.</li><li>&nbsp;If parts are left onsite, work order will not be approved until parts are confirmed shipped.</li><li>&nbsp;Required part must be dropped off asap to UPS: If work order was serviced during business hours, required part must be dropped off the same day until 7PM local time or UPS closing time. If work order was serviced during non-business hours, required part must be dropped off the next day by 12:00PM (noon) local time.</li><li>&nbsp;You must use the return label that comes inside the box shipped by Pomeroy, for additional return labels, please advise Pomeroy Dispatch Center to arrange for label(s) to be sent to you.</li><li>Save shipment drop off receipts in case there are issues tracking or recovering the equipment after it is dropped off.</li><li>Provider may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.</li><li>Ship parts to Pomeroy using return label.&nbsp;Parts must be taken from the store and shipped, unless specified by Pomeroy.&nbsp;Do not leave parts onsite even if asked by TDJ Staff/Service Desk.</li></ol>","markdown":"**Ticket Description from Customer:** ITSD-291466 Store 791 Replace/Reimage Register 09 (All Parts onsite)\n\nITSD-291466 Store 791 Replace/Reimage Register 09 (All Parts onsite)\n\nPlease call the Help Desk with your ETA before arriving on site.\n\nITSD #: ITSD-291466\n\nPlease schedule a technician to replace and reimage Register 09 at Store #791.\n\nEquipment required — please bring the following:\n\n • Wired USB keyboard\n\n • Wired XR7 reimage instructions\n\n (Note: XR7 is already on site)\n\n⚠ Important: Before starting, disconnect the SigCap from the XR7.\n\nKeep the SigCap unplugged throughout the entire reimage process.\n\n─────────────────────────────────────\n\nREIMAGE INFORMATION (~1 hour to complete)\n\n─────────────────────────────────────\n\nPOS Host Name: 0791reg09 ← must be lowercase\n\nIP Address: 172.22.216.29\n\nDefault Route: 172.22.216.1\n\nTest System: C\\_PRODUCTION\n\nPrimary DNS: 10.242.145.19\n\nSecondary DNS: 10.246.145.19\n\nSerial Number: 20-55323215\n\n─────────────────────────────────────\n\nPost-reimage steps:\n\n 1. When prompted, reboot the lane.\n\n 2. If the lane reboots and shows a red X in the bottom right of the screen,\n\n call the Help Desk immediately to reissue the data cache.\n\n 3. Call the Help Desk once the reimage is complete and confirmed working\n\n with a store manager.\n\nPlease drive carefully and have a great day!\n\nOn Site Contact Name: Trader Jord Help Desk\n\nOn Site Contact Phone: 855-844-8679 (Press Option 2)\n\nOn Site Contact Email: helpdesk@traderjoes.com\n\nProblem Type: HARD DISK FAILURE\n\nLocation Subtype: N/A\n\nLane Number (if applicable): 09\n\nClient Ticket Number/External Reference ID: ITSD-291466\n\n**Lane Number:09**\n\n**Contact Directory**\n\n**Pomeroy Dispatch Center: 704-414-5131 Operating: 24/7/365**\n\n- Check-in/Check-out, Scheduling/Delays getting to site, Additional time on site, Shipping, TRS Password, **After-Hours Support 8PM-8AM EST**, Expenses preauthorization, all expenses must be preauthorized.\n\n**Pomeroy TSS – Technical Support: 704-414-5111 Operating: 8AM-8PM EST/365**\n\n- Technical support, Documentation walkthrough, will engage TDJ support if required. **\\*\\*\\*Do not contact TDJ for support.**\n\n**Trader Joe’s Service Desk: 855-844-8679 (Option #2) Operating: 4:30AM-11:30PM PST**\n\n- Provider must Check-in with TDJ prior to beginning work and Check-out after work is completed.\n- If you can't reach the Trader Joe's Helpdesk, please wait 5 min before trying again. Once you dial their number, please press option 2 to speak with a helpdesk coordinator.\n- ***Do not contact TDJ for support or work instructions, you must reach out to Pomeroy for support, if you reach out to TDJ for support, a penalty will be applied to the work order.***\n\n***﻿***\n\n**Dress Code**: Business casual. Need to maintain a Professional appearance.\n\n**Required Items to bring:**\n\n- Basic Tool Set\n\n**\\*Only accept this job if you have all the required tools and are able to make the required time frame.\\***\n\n**Technical Documentation:**\n\n**Technical Resource Site:** <https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703>\n\n<https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-whole-unit-removalreplacement>\n\n<https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-bios-settings>\n\n**Login ID:** fieldnation@client.pomeroy.com\n\n**Login PW:** If not provided in Messages section, please call Pomeroy Dispatch Center\n\n**Parts Shipment:**\n\n- Parts (if required) will be couriered to the site; arrival is typically within 4 hours of ticket creation. Please verify with the Pomeroy Dispatch Center that any part(s) has been delivered to resolve issue.\n- You may be scheduled to arrive prior to part arrival, due to SLA, please troubleshoot in advance to determine if part is actually required.\n\n**Parts Handling Requirements:**\n\n1. Parts return is the responsibility of the assigned Provider. DO NOT LEAVE PARTS ONSITE, unless authorized by Pomeroy.\n2. If parts are left onsite, work order will not be approved until parts are confirmed shipped.\n3. Required part must be dropped off asap to UPS: If work order was serviced during business hours, required part must be dropped off the same day until 7PM local time or UPS closing time. If work order was serviced during non-business hours, required part must be dropped off the next day by 12:00PM (noon) local time.\n4. You must use the return label that comes inside the box shipped by Pomeroy, for additional return labels, please advise Pomeroy Dispatch Center to arrange for label(s) to be sent to you.\n5. Save shipment drop off receipts in case there are issues tracking or recovering the equipment after it is dropped off.\n6. Provider may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.\n7. Ship parts to Pomeroy using return label. Parts must be taken from the store and shipped, unless specified by Pomeroy. Do not leave parts onsite even if asked by TDJ Staff/Service Desk.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-19T18:00","end":"2026-09-19T20:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":70},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $70 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00