{"job":{"id":19991250,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Router troubleshoot/ cable check","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><br/><p><br></p><br/><p><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Summary of Problem: Site unable to restore WAN1 connection as they cannot find Spectrum modem.</span></p><br/><p><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Site cannot find our router either to trace WAN1 cable.</span></p><br/><p><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Scope of Work: Please check on C1121X router port 0/0/0 and attempt to restore wan1 connection from Spectrum modem</span></p><br/><p> Please TEXT the NOC to check-In. NOC info in the confidential section</p><br/><p><br></p><br/><p><em>﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch. </em></p><br/><p><strong><u>Tool Requirement</u></strong></p><br/><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cell Phone – with Charger. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">WIN10 Laptop – with Charger - </span></li><li><strong style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 &amp; USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45</strong></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Standard Tool Kit</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cat 6 cables</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cable Tester</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Hotspot or Internet Dongle</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Black Ink Pens (for documentation)</span></li></ul><p><strong><u>Job Requirements:</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></p><br/><p> </p><br/><ul><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Communicate frequently via phone/email communications</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.  </span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">Only use </span><strong>Site Disposal<em> </em></strong><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">when removing any materials/trash</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">If returning equipment, request shipping label via instructions in custom field</span></li></ul><p><br></p><br/><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><ul><li>Government-issued photo ID required </li><li>Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance </li><li>Check-in with site contacts representing <del>*******</del></li><li>The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment </li><li>Professional environment expects professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li></ul><p> </p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n  \n  \nSummary of Problem: Site unable to restore WAN1 connection as they cannot find Spectrum modem.\n\n  \nSite cannot find our router either to trace WAN1 cable.\n\n  \nScope of Work: Please check on C1121X router port 0/0/0 and attempt to restore wan1 connection from Spectrum modem\n\n  \n Please TEXT the NOC to check-In. NOC info in the confidential section\n\n  \n  \n*﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch.*\n\n  \n**Tool Requirement**\n\n  \n- Cell Phone – with Charger.\n- WIN10 Laptop – with Charger -\n- **Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 & USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45**\n- Standard Tool Kit\n- Cat 6 cables\n- Cable Tester\n- Hotspot or Internet Dongle\n- Black Ink Pens (for documentation)\n\n**Job Requirements:**\n\n  \n  \n- Communicate frequently via phone/email communications\n- Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order\n- If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.\n- Only use **Site Disposal** when removing any materials/trash\n- If returning equipment, request shipping label via instructions in custom field\n\n  \n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n  \n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expects professional conduct and clean business casual attire","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-22T08:30","end":"2026-09-22T12:30"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":57},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $240) is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-22T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"gap"},{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​C