{"job":{"id":"2755047476","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"8349100050177816 VTM 9/23 10 am Hard start","description":"VTM 9/23 10 am<br><br>IW tech must work with Granite NOC and HCL to restore connection.<br><br>BBR ticket number:  6870251<br><br>Required Equipment:<br><br><br>Tech will need a laptop with Windows 10 or higher, ethernet ports gig capable of speeds over 100M, and charger with admin rights to prove connectivity, a patch cord, a splitter, and a minimum of 3 filters. Cell phone, Cell phone charger, but set and Minimum of 150’ of cable. Cat5e/or higher, and Coax. <br><br>Scope of Work:<br><br><br>Tech must check in via WorkMarket <br><br>Check in with LCON<br><br><br>Locate make/model modem for CID:  8349100050177816<br><br>Check all IW from DMARC to the modem and replace as needed<br><br><br>Tech must call Granite NOC 8444786621 to review SOWand get transferred to BBR rep. If tech is unable to reach a BBR rep, tech must select call back option. Broadband Repair at 844-492-2557. Option: <br><br>Provide BBR with the modem information (such as make/modem, MAC, SN and location) if missing from the ticket.<br><br><br>Confirm the modem is configured correctly <br><br>IP Type: STATIC<br>IP Address: 70.60.237.86<br>Subnet Mask: 255.255.255.252<br>Gateway: 70.60.237.85<br>DNS 1: 209.18.47.61<br><br><br><br>verify surf from modem directly wired in with customer equipment removed (either by assigning IP or via DHCP, depending on configuration)<br><br><br>Once tech confirms surf off the modem, tech must confirm their IP address by running ipconfig in cmd prompt <br><br>Tech must run 2-3 speed tests. Ping-500 “ping –n 500 8.8.8.8” <br><br>Email results: bbrepair@granitenet.com and Granite NOC tech<br><br><br>Subject: BBR/IW ticket # 6870251<br><br>After work is complete, tech must locate customer equipment and reconnect to the modem.<br><br><br>Tech must remain onsite while Granite NOC confirms services with customer contact. Granite NOC must get approval from customer before releasing technician.<br>HCL NOC - 4083287792 <br>Internal ticket INC8115606<br><br>Tech must clean up, complete close-outs, and check out via WorkMarket.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-23T10:00","end":"2026-09-23T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":18.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":260,"estHours":4,"travelExpense":40,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-21T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ​Concord Police Department - NC ( Phase 2 ) (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:0