{"job":{"id":19991523,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Lingo Telecom","title":"ARC-Broadband IW/Jacks","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Requesting a Data/Equipment-savvy technician to dispatch to the site to assist Lingo. The Primary link router and modem could not be moved because they were mounted, and the WattBox could not be reached. Kindly have the technician connect the Primary link modem to WattBox outlet 9 and the Primary link router to WattBox outlet 12 and verify that all devices are properly powered and connected. Once the connections of modem and router is done to the watt box kindly take the pictures and upload on field nation portal.<br><br>The technician will need to call Lingo Repair at 888-366-6993, option 2, for an open/close code and to work directly with a Lingo Data technician. Please provide ticket number 00521247. We will need to run three speed tests from the modem and at least 100 pings<br> to verify the circuit is functioning properly. Please take screenshots of all tests, note the MAC address of the modem from which the tests are performed, and upload the results to Field Nation. We will provide any additional information, such as the static<br> IP or equipment login, if needed for troubleshooting once the technician is onsite and actively engaged with Lingo Repair.<br><br>Note: If you are unable to complete the dispatch due to the extent of work required, please submit a quote with pictures so that we can review and reschedule.<br><br>Thanks,<br>Rajat</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em>Notice: For check in and check out codes, if it is outside Lingo business hours (M-F 8am-5pm Eastern) and you call in for the the open and/or close code, please leave a message with your name and Field Nation work order number and Lingo will fill in the codes by the next business day.</em></p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\nRequesting a Data/Equipment-savvy technician to dispatch to the site to assist Lingo. The Primary link router and modem could not be moved because they were mounted, and the WattBox could not be reached. Kindly have the technician connect the Primary link modem to WattBox outlet 9 and the Primary link router to WattBox outlet 12 and verify that all devices are properly powered and connected. Once the connections of modem and router is done to the watt box kindly take the pictures and upload on field nation portal.  \n  \nThe technician will need to call Lingo Repair at 888-366-6993, option 2, for an open/close code and to work directly with a Lingo Data technician. Please provide ticket number 00521247. We will need to run three speed tests from the modem and at least 100 pings  \n to verify the circuit is functioning properly. Please take screenshots of all tests, note the MAC address of the modem from which the tests are performed, and upload the results to Field Nation. We will provide any additional information, such as the static  \n IP or equipment login, if needed for troubleshooting once the technician is onsite and actively engaged with Lingo Repair.  \n  \nNote: If you are unable to complete the dispatch due to the extent of work required, please submit a quote with pictures so that we can review and reschedule.  \n  \nThanks,  \nRajat\n\n*Notice: For check in and check out codes, if it is outside Lingo business hours (M-F 8am-5pm Eastern) and you call in for the the open and/or close code, please leave a message with your name and Field Nation work order number and Lingo will fill in the codes by the next business day.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-22T12:00","end":"2026-09-22T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":11},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z",