{"job":{"id":20000533,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Swap 4 Label Printers","description":{"html":"<p>Workorder Instructions:</p>\n<p>• Swap 4 Label Printers according to the Install guide Starbucks Biloxon Printer Mobile Guide V1.9 or newer:<del>***********************************************</del></p>\n<p>• Hardware &amp; Testing: Replace cup labeling printers and verify operation with the Starbucks Helpdesk. Reminder: Do not touch POS printers; they are strictly out of scope.</p>\n<p>• Cable Management: Bring approximately twelve (4\") Velcro strips. Use these for cable management as needed. The use of zip ties is strictly prohibited.</p>\n<p>• Documentation &amp; Release: Immediately upload photos as instructed in the install guide. You must remain on-site until the Shyft Project Desk confirms the photos meet customer requirements. To ensure a prompt release, the Project Desk prioritizes these reviews as soon as photos are received.</p>\n<p>• iPhone Users: To ensure your photos upload correctly, change your camera format setting from High Efficiency (HEIC) to Most Compatible (JPG) before taking pictures.</p>\n<p>• Equipment Removal: Remove the old printers from the store and drop them off at a Fed Ex or Purolator location within 48 hours of job completion.</p>\n<p>• Site Security: . You must bring the key shipped to you prior going to the store. Before leaving, lock the front door and arm the security alarm in accordance with store procedures. Please retain the store key after completing the visit, as it may be required for future assignments at other store locations.</p>\n<p>***NOTE*** Please check the Confidential Information section for PM and Help Desk / Command Center numbers.</p>\n<p><strong>DO NOT</strong> leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Especially if you are requesting something...instead, give us a call.</p>\n<p><strong>Please do not request a schedule change. Schedule change requests cannot be accommodated. If you are not able to make it to the site as scheduled. Please Report a Problem within the work order and remove yourself.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Travel must be requested prior to assignment by counteroffer or by speaking with us., or it will be declined.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Please message any rate counter offers, but do not request bundle as-is unless you are in agreement with the rate and schedule</strong></p>","markdown":"Workorder Instructions:\n\n• Swap 4 Label Printers according to the Install guide Starbucks Biloxon Printer Mobile Guide V1.9 or newer:\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n• Hardware & Testing: Replace cup labeling printers and verify operation with the Starbucks Helpdesk. Reminder: Do not touch POS printers; they are strictly out of scope.\n\n• Cable Management: Bring approximately twelve (4\") Velcro strips. Use these for cable management as needed. The use of zip ties is strictly prohibited.\n\n• Documentation & Release: Immediately upload photos as instructed in the install guide. You must remain on-site until the Shyft Project Desk confirms the photos meet customer requirements. To ensure a prompt release, the Project Desk prioritizes these reviews as soon as photos are received.\n\n• iPhone Users: To ensure your photos upload correctly, change your camera format setting from High Efficiency (HEIC) to Most Compatible (JPG) before taking pictures.\n\n• Equipment Removal: Remove the old printers from the store and drop them off at a Fed Ex or Purolator location within 48 hours of job completion.\n\n• Site Security: . You must bring the key shipped to you prior going to the store. Before leaving, lock the front door and arm the security alarm in accordance with store procedures. Please retain the store key after completing the visit, as it may be required for future assignments at other store locations.\n\n\\*\\*\\*NOTE\\*\\*\\* Please check the Confidential Information section for PM and Help Desk / Command Center numbers.\n\n**DO NOT** leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Especially if you are requesting something...instead, give us a call.\n\n**Please do not request a schedule change. Schedule change requests cannot be accommodated. If you are not able to make it to the site as scheduled. Please Report a Problem within the work order and remove yourself.**\n\n**Travel must be requested prior to assignment by counteroffer or by speaking with us., or it will be declined.**\n\n**Please message any rate counter offers, but do not request bundle as-is unless you are in agreement with the rate and schedule**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-15T23:00","end":"2026-10-15T26:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":40},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free Pe