{"job":{"id":20003589,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Wachter - Nationwide Projects","title":"Target Bundle R2 - Helper Technician","description":{"html":"<p><strong>EARLY MORNING: ARRIVE TWO HOURS PRIOR TO STORE OPENING</strong></p><p>Check-in with Wachter help desk (856-222-0643, opt 1, opt 2, opt 2, 136357#)</p><p>Check-in with Wachter lead technician (information to be provided case-by-case)</p><p>Early Morning: Assist with removing 200lb server from MDF, as well as additional components specified (switches, sensors, cabling, etc). Work inside MDF must be completed prior to store opening so arrival time is strict. Once MDF work is complete and store is open, assist with other various end device upgrades/swaps as requested</p><p>Take photos of all work completed and upload to work order.</p><p>Ensure lead technician approves work is complete prior to leaving site</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>******We are a professional provider of low voltage services. Proper PPE is a Requirement*****</u></strong> If you are found to be non-compliant, you will be asked to leave the site, an issue opened with Field Nation, and the work order canceled without payment. Acceptance of an assignment indicates agreement with these terms.</p>","markdown":"**EARLY MORNING: ARRIVE TWO HOURS PRIOR TO STORE OPENING**\n\nCheck-in with Wachter help desk (856-222-0643, opt 1, opt 2, opt 2, 136357#)\n\nCheck-in with Wachter lead technician (information to be provided case-by-case)\n\nEarly Morning: Assist with removing 200lb server from MDF, as well as additional components specified (switches, sensors, cabling, etc). Work inside MDF must be completed prior to store opening so arrival time is strict. Once MDF work is complete and store is open, assist with other various end device upgrades/swaps as requested\n\nTake photos of all work completed and upload to work order.\n\nEnsure lead technician approves work is complete prior to leaving site\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*We are a professional provider of low voltage services. Proper PPE is a Requirement\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** If you are found to be non-compliant, you will be asked to leave the site, an issue opened with Field Nation, and the work order canceled without payment. Acceptance of an assignment indicates agreement with these terms.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-30T04:00","end":"2026-09-30T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":600},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":12},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":75,"baseAmount":600,"estHours":8,"travelExpense":30,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fast Food Restaurant #4945 — Refranchise Conversion — Oxford, NC"},{"start":"2026-09-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T15:00:00.000Z","summary":"Remote Hands - Connect AT&T broadband circuit"},{"start":"2026-09-14T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-14T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Device offline**See required tools**"}],"action":"COUNTER","ts":1790098417019}
{"job":{"id":20003432,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Valuable Group","title":"Site Survey at Best Western Plus Burlington","description":{"html":"<ul><li>This survey is for the Moviebeam system (www.moviebeam.com): </li></ul><p><br></p><p>1) Inspect and take pictures of the Main Distribution room. Create a basic distribution diagram.</p><p>2) Take close-up and wide-angle pictures of the COAX distribution in the Main Distribution room along with RF cabling equipment (make and model number to be visible).</p><p>3) Take close-up pictures of all WAN and LAN network switches capturing the make and model number. If the property is Wi-Fi, do make sure you have a Basic Wi-Fi Analyzer app on your phone as we will need to check signal strength in basic areas of the property. Do upload the Signal strength pictures</p><p>4) Ask the general manager or IT person to identify the network switch that is connected to the hotel property management system. Take a picture of the switch.</p><p>5) Label all pictures.</p><p>6) Visit at least 4-5 different guest rooms and take pictures of the front and the back of the TV. List down the TV make and model number for those rooms. Also, please request the general manager for a list of all TVs at the hotel if not already shared with Moviebeam. They can email it to shaunak.munim@moviebeam.com</p><p>7) Note down the make and model number of Wi-Fi access points on each floor of each building. Specify the total number of access points. Make sure you have a basic Wi-Fi analyser application installed on your phone.</p><p>8) Take a picture of the server rack space that would be made available for Moviebeam servers in the main distribution room.</p><p>9) Take pictures of the guest room TVs (2 or 3 guest rooms) to determine the placement of the cable set-top box. (whether furniture mount or wall mount)</p><p>10) Upload all information to the field nation</p><p>11) Room list and TV model details will be available at the hotel. Please ask for it &amp; share the same with us.</p><p>12) Equipment list (to be carried for site survey)</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">1. Laptop with LAN Port and TeamViewer client Application Installed</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">2. LAN Cable</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">3. LAN Tester</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">4. Android phone with Wi-Fi Analyser App and WhatsApp installed</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">5. Formatted USB pen drive</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">6. RF dB Meter</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">7. Network tools</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">8. Toolbox</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">9. Keyboard and Mouse</span></p>","markdown":"- This survey is for the Moviebeam system (www.moviebeam.com):\n\n1\\) Inspect and take pictures of the Main Distribution room. Create a basic distribution diagram.\n\n2\\) Take close-up and wide-angle pictures of the COAX distribution in the Main Distribution room along with RF cabling equipment (make and model number to be visible).\n\n3\\) Take close-up pictures of all WAN and LAN network switches capturing the make and model number. If the property is Wi-Fi, do make sure you have a Basic Wi-Fi Analyzer app on your phone as we will need to check signal strength in basic areas of the property. Do upload the Signal strength pictures\n\n4\\) Ask the general manager or IT person to identify the network switch that is connected to the hotel property management system. Take a picture of the switch.\n\n5\\) Label all pictures.\n\n6\\) Visit at least 4-5 different guest rooms and take pictures of the front and the back of the TV. List down the TV make and model number for those rooms. Also, please request the general manager for a list of all TVs at the hotel if not already shared with Moviebeam. They can email it to shaunak.munim@moviebeam.com\n\n7\\) Note down the make and model number of Wi-Fi access points on each floor of each building. Specify the total number of access points. Make sure you have a basic Wi-Fi analyser application installed on your phone.\n\n8\\) Take a picture of the server rack space that would be made available for Moviebeam servers in the main distribution room.\n\n9\\) Take pictures of the guest room TVs (2 or 3 guest rooms) to determine the placement of the cable set-top box. (whether furniture mount or wall mount)\n\n10\\) Upload all information to the field nation\n\n11\\) Room list and TV model details will be available at the hotel. Please ask for it & share the same with us.\n\n12\\) Equipment list (to be carried for site survey)\n\n1\\. Laptop with LAN Port and TeamViewer client Application Installed\n\n2\\. LAN Cable\n\n3\\. LAN Tester\n\n4\\. Android phone with Wi-Fi Analyser App and WhatsApp installed\n\n5\\. Formatted USB pen drive\n\n6\\. RF dB Meter\n\n7\\. Network tools\n\n8\\. Toolbox\n\n9\\. Keyboard and Mouse","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-29T10:00","end":"2026-09-29T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":43},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $200 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso Durham"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00: