{"job":{"id":20003530,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Wachter - Nationwide Projects","title":"Target Bundle R2 - Helper Technician","description":{"html":"<p><strong>EARLY MORNING: ARRIVE TWO HOURS PRIOR TO STORE OPENING</strong></p><p>Check-in with Wachter help desk (856-222-0643, opt 1, opt 2, opt 2, 136357#)</p><p>Check-in with Wachter lead technician (information to be provided case-by-case)</p><p>Early Morning: Assist with removing 200lb server from MDF, as well as additional components specified (switches, sensors, cabling, etc). Work inside MDF must be completed prior to store opening so arrival time is strict. Once MDF work is complete and store is open, assist with other various end device upgrades/swaps as requested</p><p>Take photos of all work completed and upload to work order.</p><p>Ensure lead technician approves work is complete prior to leaving site</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>******We are a professional provider of low voltage services. Proper PPE is a Requirement*****</u></strong> If you are found to be non-compliant, you will be asked to leave the site, an issue opened with Field Nation, and the work order canceled without payment. Acceptance of an assignment indicates agreement with these terms.</p>","markdown":"**EARLY MORNING: ARRIVE TWO HOURS PRIOR TO STORE OPENING**\n\nCheck-in with Wachter help desk (856-222-0643, opt 1, opt 2, opt 2, 136357#)\n\nCheck-in with Wachter lead technician (information to be provided case-by-case)\n\nEarly Morning: Assist with removing 200lb server from MDF, as well as additional components specified (switches, sensors, cabling, etc). Work inside MDF must be completed prior to store opening so arrival time is strict. Once MDF work is complete and store is open, assist with other various end device upgrades/swaps as requested\n\nTake photos of all work completed and upload to work order.\n\nEnsure lead technician approves work is complete prior to leaving site\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*We are a professional provi