{"job":{"id":19590541,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IW Technologies","title":"Topgolf - Game Panel Upgrade (MUST BE AVAILABLE ALL 3 NIGHTS) - [HEAVY LIFTING & PHYSICAL WORK REQUIRED]","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Summary of Work:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>IW Technologies requires technicians to assist Lead Techs to Replace a Game Panel at local Top Golf. Techs will be taking direction. There will be a lot of clean up and basic labor needed.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em><u>This is a 3-night project, tech MUST be available all 3 nights. A 20% penalty for the total of the work order will be deducted if you cancel before the duration of the project.</u></em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em><u>ALSO Client reports ALL activity to us everyday. Be sure to keep busy and OFF YOUR PHONES. Do not wander off, and be sure to communicate breaks with the lead.</u></em></strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>MUST BE ABLE TO LIFT 50+ LBS</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Techs MUST be able to take direction and follow lead instructions.</p>\n<p><strong>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Techs must be on time no exceptions – 10pm HARD START – Until finished</strong></p>\n<p>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;All Tools are required. DO NOT SHOW UP without any of the tools (list below)</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>If you are unable to do/have any of the below DO NOT APPLY</p>\n<p>The technician assigned MUST BE the technician on site<strong>NO EXCEPTIONS</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>You will check in with lead tech when you arrive onsite.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>TOOLS REQUIRED</strong></p>\n<p>5/16 Allen head driver- long</p>\n<p>5/16 Allen head driver- short</p>\n<p>9/16 deep well socket</p>\n<p>Head lamps (all techs) Energizer</p>\n<p>Flexible extension for drill/driver</p>\n<p>2-piece kit (18\" and 24\") 3/8\" drive socket extension</p>\n<p>Cabling Scissors</p>\n<p>Utility knife/razor-blade knife (for opening boxes)</p>\n<p>Cut-resistant gloves</p>\n<p>Right-Angle tool</p>\n<p>Basic Tool Set</p>\n<p>Socket Set for Bolts</p>\n<p>Head Lamp - Light to wear on your head hands-free</p>\n<p>Nut Driver Set</p>\n<p>Long Bit Screwdriver - Long Screwdriver Bits</p>\n<p>Spade Bits</p>\n<p>Cordless Power Drill</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Pre-Visit Instructions:</strong></p>\n<p>Be sure to read and understand all of the instructions</p>\n<p>Confirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.</p>\n<p><strong>Onsite Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check-in on the Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198</p>\n<p>Locate onsite contact and introduce yourself as a technician from IW Technologies</p>\n<p>Locate the Equipment that was shipped to the store</p>\n<p>Replace / Upgrade according to the scope of work</p>\n<p>Validate Connectivity and/or Functionality with Support</p>\n<p>Clean up Area</p>\n<p>Call IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving the site - 847-285-4198</p>\n<p><strong>Close-Out Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check out on the Field Nation App</p>\n<p>Ensure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables</p>\n<p>Submit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.</p>\n<p><strong>Special Instructions for Technician:</strong></p>\n<p><em>(Include any pertinent information from the case here)</em></p>","markdown":"**Summary of Work:**\n\n**IW Technologies requires technicians to assist Lead Techs to Replace a Game Panel at local Top Golf. Techs will be taking direction. There will be a lot of clean up and basic labor needed.**\n\n***This is a 3-night project, tech MUST be available all 3 nights. A 20% penalty for the total of the work order will be deducted if you cancel before the duration of the project.***\n\n***ALSO Client reports ALL activity to us everyday. Be sure to keep busy and OFF YOUR PHONES. Do not wander off, and be sure to communicate breaks with the lead.***\n\n**MUST BE ABLE TO LIFT 50+ LBS**\n\n1\\. Techs MUST be able to take direction and follow lead instructions.\n\n**2. Techs must be on time no exceptions – 10pm HARD START – Until finished**\n\n3\\. All Tools are required. DO NOT SHOW UP without any of the tools (list below)\n\nIf you are unable to do/have any of the below DO NOT APPLY\n\nThe technician assigned MUST BE the technician on site**NO EXCEPTIONS**\n\nYou will check in with lead tech when you arrive onsite.\n\n**TOOLS REQUIRED**\n\n5/16 Allen head driver- long\n\n5/16 Allen head driver- short\n\n9/16 deep well socket\n\nHead lamps (all techs) Energizer\n\nFlexible extension for drill/driver\n\n2-piece kit (18\" and 24\") 3/8\" drive socket extension\n\nCabling Scissors\n\nUtility knife/razor-blade knife (for opening boxes)\n\nCut-resistant gloves\n\nRight-Angle tool\n\nBasic Tool Set\n\nSocket Set for Bolts\n\nHead Lamp - Light to wear on your head hands-free\n\nNut Driver Set\n\nLong Bit Screwdriver - Long Screwdriver Bits\n\nSpade Bits\n\nCordless Power Drill\n\n**Pre-Visit Instructions:**\n\nBe sure to read and understand all of the instructions\n\nConfirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.\n\n**Onsite Tasks:**\n\nCheck-in on the Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198\n\nLocate onsite contact and introduce yourself as a technician from IW Technologies\n\nLocate the Equipment that was shipped to the store\n\nReplace / Upgrade according to the scope of work\n\nValidate Connectivity and/or Functionality with Support\n\nClean up Area\n\nCall IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving the site - 847-285-4198\n\n**Close-Out Tasks:**\n\nCheck out on the Field Nation App\n\nEnsure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables\n\nSubmit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.\n\n**Special Instructions for Technician:**\n\n*(Include any pertinent information from the case here)*","actions"