{"job":{"id":20000646,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"WiLine Networks","title":"DECOMM ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience with outdoor wireless antenna, cabling and networking.</li><li><strong>Please send us your SHIP TO address in the Field Nation Messages section once assigned.&nbsp;We will be shipping parts to you for the installation.</strong></li><li><strong>PURPOSE OF VISIT - Decomm site, remove antennas, wiring, CPE and ship parts back</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools required:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: inherit;\">6’ ladder required</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit;\">hand tools including wrenches and sockets and cable cutters</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit;\">drill motor with bits</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit;\">rope and bucket to lower equipment off the roof</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Special Instructions:</strong></p><ul><li>Tech must follow scope of work and not deviate.</li><li>Tech must arrive on time.</li><li>Tech is not to discuss which Carriers we use or Speed Test results we use with the customer!!!</li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">We are providing WILINE DIA Service</span></li><li>Tech is not to leave site until ALL pictures are available for Project Manager to view.</li><li>Requested photos must be uploaded during the visit. Photos uploaded after the visit will not be approved.</li><li>Photos must be labeled.</li><li>Failure to check-In and check-out may result in penalties.</li><li><strong>STRICLY REQUIRED: Business casual pants, no shorts (slack or kaki), collar shirt no pictures or writing on it, and no flip flops or sandals.</strong></li><li>Represent yourself as a WiLine Engineer.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Required On-Site Deliverables</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">TECHNICIAN IS REQUIRED TO TAKE SAFETY CLASS AND RETURN THE COMPLETED CERTIFICATION PR