{"job":{"id":"9676714361","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Flowater, Inc","title":"FloWater Refill Station Filter Change - 4597131","description":"<p>Task Details:&nbsp;*ASAP* - 1x FC due to filters bypassed-</p><p><br></p><p>Up to 1 hour on site</p><p><br></p><p><strong>You must call or text when you arrive to check in and before you leave to check out. Call or text Bob 303-720-6003 or Keenan 505-553-9850</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>We must schedule your visit with the site. You cannot go until we have confirmed a date and time with site.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>You must download and print FloWater Services Sign Off Sheet before arriving on site. POC name and signature required.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Filter Change checklist:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1)</strong> unplug unit and plug back in (this cycles the ozonator)</p><p><strong>2) </strong>change all filters (6 total)</p><p><strong>3) </strong>verify water is flowing into reserve tank (photo required)</p><p><strong>4)</strong> clean drain tank (photo required)</p><p><strong>5) </strong>clean catchment tray (photo required)</p><p><strong>6)</strong> clean inline filter located on back of unit (take before &amp; after photo)</p><p><strong>7) </strong>unplug unit and plug back in (listen again for ozonator to cycle)</p><p><strong>8)</strong> wipe down unit - we want to leave unit and work area cleaner than it was when you arrived (photo required)</p><p><strong>9) </strong>obtain name and signature of POC on site (photo required of Sign Off Sheet)</p><p><strong>10)</strong> dispose of used filters offsite</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required tools: </strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1) </strong>Gloves (disposable)</p><p><strong>2)</strong> Bucket or container (1 gallon minimum, 5 gallon is ideal)</p><p><strong>3)</strong> Clean towels</p><p><strong>4)</strong> Screwdrivers (Phillips and flathead)</p><p><strong>5)</strong> Spray bottle (for cleaning outside surfaces of Refill Station)</p><p><br></p><p>This isn't a plumbing job. You'll be dealing with 1/4\" polyethylene tubing and quick connect fittings.</p><p><br></p><p>5 Business Day Warranty on labor - anything missed or done improperly that requires a return trip for rework</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T08:00","end":"2026-09-24T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":60},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":60.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $60 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z