{"job":{"id":"1444638057","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"CDW","title":"Assistance with Survey Tone and Trace - Raleigh, NC","description":"<p>Looking for Technician to assist with tone &amp; trace. Technician will go onsite to our client location to perform a comprehensive site survey and readiness assessment Raleigh, NC location. This is a 2-part visit. Following successful completion of the site survey and confirmation that the site is ready for deployment, a technician will return onsite to perform the physical installation of customer-provided equipment.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Task <u>SITE SURVEY AND CONNECTIVITY ASSESSMENT</u></strong></p><ul><li>Check in with the local site contact and confirm access to all relevant work areas. </li><li>Survey the customer suite and designated installation locations. </li><li>Assess the current status and availability of network connectivity services within the customer suite. </li><li>Verify the presence and condition of ISP handoff facilities and telecommunications infrastructure.</li><li>Trace and validate the ISP riser pathway from the building demarcation point on the ground floor to the customer suite. </li><li>Utilize a toner, laptop, and other standard troubleshooting tools, as required, to identify and verify connectivity paths. </li><li>Document existing infrastructure, physical pathways, equipment locations, and any potential installation constraints. </li><li>Record findings and provide recommendations regarding site readiness for deployment.</li><li>Clean-up Work areas.</li><li>Obtain manager's Sign off on completed work <strong>(MANDATORY FOR PAYOUT)</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>9/25 8A.M. </strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Requirements </strong></p><ul><li>Standard hand tools to mount rack gear.</li><li>Tone-tracer</li><li>Cable Tester</li><li>Cable termination tools</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>8\" ladder</li><li>Ability to lift over 50 lbs.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>The payout minimum is 2 hours.</strong></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T08:00","end":"2026-09-25T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":260},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":4.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso Durham"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2