{"job":{"id":20005892,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"EPC","title":"UPS Replacement","description":{"html":"<p><br></p><p>Dispenser's UPS has a failing battery and needs to be replaced. EPC has shipped a UPS to the store, the tracking information is in the work order.&nbsp;<strong>Check the tracking and ensure the UPS has delivered, EPC will NOT pay for a wasted trip. </strong></p><p>Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff.&nbsp;After replacing the UPS, power on all the components and make sure the dispenser can print an offer sheet from a card scan.&nbsp;Call EPC to confirm, and so we can login to query the UPS for its status.&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.</span></p><p>Finally, recycle or dispose of the faulty UPS as you see fit.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>","markdown":"Dispenser's UPS has a failing battery and needs to be replaced. EPC has shipped a UPS to the store, the tracking information is in the work order. **Check the tracking and ensure the UPS has delivered, EPC will NOT pay for a wasted trip.**\n\nCall EPC when onsite and check in with store staff. After replacing the UPS, power on all the components and make sure the dispenser can print an offer sheet from a card scan. Call EPC to confirm, and so we can login to query the UPS for its status.\n\nTake a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.\n\nFinally, recycle or dispose of the faulty UPS as you see fit.",