{"job":{"id":"2890731508","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"LEGACY Retail Services","title":"Service Call for Menu Screens at Fast Food Restaurant","description":"<p>WORK DESCRIPTION: Please visit the site to troubleshoot screens at the Drive-thru along with their media players. During the last interaction with the store manager, power, network connections, link lights, device status, enclosure controls, and breakers were inspected. Multiple checks confirmed no link lights on the associated devices, and power-related concerns were identified within the enclosure. Basic power cycling and breaker verification were performed, but the issue remained unresolved.</p><p><br></p><p>Tools to bring:</p><p>*Crimping tools</p><p>*Cable tester</p><p>*100ft cat6 cable</p><p>*Voltmeter</p><p>*Bring spare HDMI cables - 7ft</p><p>*Commissioning tools (External Monitor, USB Keyboard, USB Drive formatted to FAT32) Refer to the commissioning guide attached to this email.</p><p><br></p><p>Troubleshooting steps:</p><p>*Check power, source, and Ethernet connections</p><p>*Inspect cables for physical damage; re-crimp or re-terminate if necessary</p><p>*Verify IP settings and Device ID for the screens</p><p>*Ensure all devices are online and displaying content correctly</p><p><br></p><p>Contact Coates for further assistance and release if needed</p><p><br></p><p>Note: Additional troubleshooting may be required.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://coatesgroup.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/CoatesExternalFileRepository/Shared%20Documents/Commissioning%20Images/sb-mp-image-3.0.0.zip?csf=1&amp;web=1&amp;e=4et1QS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://coatesgroup.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/CoatesExternalFileRepository/Shared%20Documents/Commissioning%20Images/sb-mp-image-3.0.0.zip?csf=1&amp;web=1&amp;e=4et1QS</a></p><p><br></p><p>Expected time on site (Additional troubleshooting steps and additional on site may be required): 2-4 hours</p><p><br></p><p>LOCATION: Outdoor menu board - enclosure</p><p><br></p><p><strong>**A 32gb or smaller USB drive is required, must download and unzip the provided installation files needed to set up the new media player.**</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Link to file download: https://coatesgroup.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/CoatesExternalFileRepository/Shared%20Documents/Commissioning%20Images/sb-mp-image-3.0.0.zip?csf=1&amp;web=1&amp;e=4et1QS</strong></p><p><br></p><p>When heading to site, TEXT BRANDPOING SUPPORT AT&nbsp;-&nbsp;(856) 382-2645. They will be your support and troubleshoot with you through the duration of the call.&nbsp;</p><p>Must check in and out with support to confirm total time onsite and obtain checkout code from support to process work order.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>MANDATORY TOOLS REQUIRED:</strong> 9mm socket, L shaped tool, needle nose pliers, basic tools, security T40 and security T20 bit, deep socket kit, Adjustable Wrench capable of 1/2?-1? sizes</p><p><br></p><p><strong>INFO NEEDED :&nbsp;</strong>SERIAL NUMBER LABEL | PICTURE OF OLD AND NEW&nbsp;CONTENT SHOWING |&nbsp;BEFORE AND AFTER PICTURE OF THE FRONT OF THE BOARD |&nbsp;MANAGERS NAME ON DUTY.&nbsp;</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T08:00","end":"2026-09-24T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":220},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $220 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"20