{"job":{"id":20004660,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"SenSource, Inc.","title":"Fayetteville State University - Chesnutt Library | Site Survey for Overhead People Counting Sensor(s) | Low Voltage Cabling (Estimate)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Fayetteville State University - Chesnutt Library - Site Survey for Multiple Traffic Counters (8-12) w/ Cable Run Estimate</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Address - 1200 Murchison Road Fayetteville, NC 28301</li>\n<li>Site Contact - Larry Treadwell IV - 910- 672-1232</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>SenSource Contacts:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><em>Chase Taylor</em></strong> - Project Manager - (330)-915-4776 <strong><em>Call to Check-In!</em></strong></li>\n<li><strong><em>Moe Syed -</em></strong> (330) 423-0591 -<strong><em>Call if Chase is unavailable</em></strong></li>\n<li>SenSource Support - 1-800-239-1226 EXT 601 - <strong>Call for Device Configuration!!</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Site Visit Scope:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Traffic counters needed at 8+ entrances</li>\n<li>Survey for mounting and cable run</li>\n<li>Reference placement photos and Self Survey PDF in attached docs to finalize project plan</li>\n<li>Communicate with site contact to confirm, add to, or remove information in project plan</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Technician Needs to Bring:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cell Phone with GoCanvas Downloaded - <strong>Login Information under Confidential Information</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Laser Measuring Device</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tape Measure</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please let us know if you have any questions:</p>\n<p>-SenSource</p>\n<p><strong>-------------------READ BELOW-------------------</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How to perform a site survey:</strong>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cHNbeucqA10</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>You will need to download the GoCanvas application and log in with the credentials listed in the confidential section, once on site. This will be the tool used for performing and documenting the site survey.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Once in the app, choose Site Survey &gt; General</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Google Play:&nbsp;</strong>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gocanvas&amp;hl=en_US</li>\n<li><strong>Apple App Store:</strong>&nbsp;https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gocanvas-business-forms/id418917158</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Site Survey - SenSource People Counter</u></strong></p>\n<p>I need a site survey performed at a customer site. This survey will probably result in an actual installation, and we prefer to have the same person do both the survey and install.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Correct measurements are critical.</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Need <strong>dimensions</strong> of the entrance widths, and ceiling heights. Even a few inches off can be the difference between needing one sensor or two.&nbsp;Need<strong>pictures</strong> of the entrance(s) and ceiling above the entrances. Take close ups, then also a panoramic view of the doorway, and the ceiling directly above it. Different angles are also helpful. See attached \"Survey mistake\" picture to see why.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Briefly review all pics attached to this work order, things to keep in mind during the survey.&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Note</strong> HVAC, or other heat / cold generating devices, lights, exit signs, etc., and take measurements of anything in the way.&nbsp;People counting sensors are normally mounted 3.5-4 feet away from the wall, centered&nbsp;in the middle of the doorway.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>You may or may not be cabling this site, but survey as if you will be. <strong>Investigate</strong> cable path, and<strong>estimate</strong> how long it will take.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Once you have familiarized yourself with the site, you MUST text the Project Manager for release, while you are still onsite.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Look at the attached pictures for things to keep in mind when taking the survey.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tech must have:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tape measure</li>\n<li>Cell Phone</li>\n<li>Ladder</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Fayetteville State University - Chesnutt Library - Site Survey for Multiple Traffic Counters (8-12) w/ Cable Run Estimate**\n\n- Address - 1200 Murchison Road Fayetteville, NC 28301\n- Site Contact - Larry Treadwell IV - 910- 672-1232\n\n**SenSource Contacts:**\n\n- ***Chase Taylor*** - Project Manager - (330)-915-4776 ***Call to Check-In!***\n- ***Moe Syed -*** (330) 423-0591 -***Call if Chase is unavailable***\n- SenSource Support - 1-800-239-1226 EXT 601 - **Call for Device Configuration!!**\n\n**Site Visit Scope:**\n\n- Traffic counters needed at 8+ entrances\n- Survey for mounting and cable run\n- Reference placement photos and Self Survey PDF in attached docs to finalize project plan\n- Communicate with site contact to confirm, add to, or remove information in project plan\n\n**Technician Needs to Bring:**\n\n- Cell Phone with GoCanvas Downloaded - **Login Information under Confidential Information**\n- **Laser Measuring Device**\n- **Tape Measure**\n\nPlease let us know if you have any questions:\n\n-SenSource\n\n**-------------------READ BELOW-------------------**\n\n**How to perform a site survey:**<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cHNbeucqA10>\n\n- **You will need to download the GoCanvas application and log in with the credentials listed in the confidential section, once on site. This will be the tool used for performing and documenting the site survey.**\n\n**Once in the app, choose Site Survey > General**\n\n- **Google Play:** https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gocanvas&amp;hl=en_US\n- **Apple App Store:** <https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gocanvas-business-forms/id418917158>\n\n**Site Survey - SenSource People Counter**\n\nI need a site survey performed at a customer site. This survey will probably result in an actual installation, and we prefer to have the same person do both the survey and install.\n\n**Correct measurements are critical.**\n\n- Need **dimensions** of the entrance widths, and ceiling heights. Even a few inches off can be the difference between needing one sensor or two. Need**pictures** of the entrance(s) and ceiling above the entrances. Take close ups, then also a panoramic view of the doorway, and the ceiling directly above it. Different angles are also helpful. See attached \"Survey mistake\" picture to see why.\n- Briefly review all pics attached to this work order, things to keep in mind during the survey.\n- **Note** HVAC, or other heat / cold generating devices, lights, exit signs, etc., and take measurements of anything in the way. People counting sensors are normally mounted 3.5-4 feet away from the wall, centered in the middle of the doorway.\n- You may or may not be cabling this site, but survey as if you will be. **Investigate** cable path, and**estimate** how long it will take.\n\n**Once you have familiarized yourself with the site, you MUST text the Project Manager for release, while you are still onsite.**\n\n**Look at the attached pictures for things to keep in mind when taking the survey.**\n\n**Tech must have:**\n\n- Tape measure\n- Cell Phone\n- Ladder","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-28T09:00","end":"2026-09-28T11:00","latestStart":"2026-09-28T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":215},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":150},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":65}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":56},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $215 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-