{"job":{"id":20006422,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NCR Voyix - Retail","title":"ASSIST TECH - MUST bring Required Tools","description":{"html":"<p><strong>REQUIREMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Dress code</strong>-- Casual business attire, including <strong>COLLARED SHIRT (WITHOUT LOGOS)</strong>, jeans, and comfortable shoes during the entire installation process.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD: hats, baggy jeans, open-toed shoes, fatigues, or sweat suits be worn.</u></strong>&nbsp;Clothes must be worn in a professional manner, neatly pressed and tidy.</li><li><strong>NCR identification badge</strong> must be worn and visible at all times.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>MUST BE </strong>able to <strong>lift a minimum of 45 pounds</strong></li><li><strong><u>This job requires 8 hours onsite. OT will be added if onsite NCR lead confirms it. Break time needs to be confirmed with Tech Lead with clear start and finish.</u></strong></li><li>Work Order MUST BE fully completed while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (<strong>Smartphone</strong>)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS</strong></p><ul><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cordless Electric Drill &ndash; Very important&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Box cutter with new blades &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-function&nbsp;screwdriver with multiple tips is preferred. - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;11/32 nut driver &ndash; Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;¾\" socket with extension &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8mm socket - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Needle nose and regular pliers &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Diagonal cutters - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10\" crescent wrench &ndash; Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;¾\" open-ended combination wrench &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cable ties &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Complete socket set &ndash; Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Smart phone &ndash; Smart to have one</strong></li><li><strong>Packing Tape</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>OVERVIEW</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Follow the NCR Hardware Technician On-Site Deployment Strategy.</li><li>Inventory Hardware.</li><li>Unbox, place, install Self Checkout Hardware.</li><li>Clean up and throw away trash.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>ESCALATION PATH</strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>D2T.VendorManagement@ncrvoyix.com</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>CANCELLATION POLICY&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Cancellation when tech arrives on site in the first hour: 50% to the tech</li><li>Cancellation when tech arrives on site after the first hour: 100% to the tech</li></ul>","markdown":"**REQUIREMENTS**\n\n- **Dress code**-- Casual business attire, including **COLLARED SHIRT (WITHOUT LOGOS)**, jeans, and comfortable shoes during the entire installation process. **UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD: hats, baggy jeans, open-toed shoes, fatigues, or sweat suits be worn.** Clothes must be worn in a professional manner, neatly pressed and tidy.\n- **NCR identification badge** must be worn and visible at all times.\n- **MUST BE** able to **lift a minimum of 45 pounds**\n- **This job requires 8 hours onsite. OT will be added if onsite NCR lead confirms it. Break time needs to be confirmed with Tech Lead with clear start and finish.**\n- Work Order MUST BE fully completed while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (**Smartphone**)\n\n**YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS**\n\n- **• Cordless Electric Drill – Very important**\n- **• Box cutter with new blades – Important**\n- **• Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-function screwdriver with multiple tips is preferred. - Important**\n- **• 11/32 nut driver – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" socket with extension – Important**\n- **• 8mm socket - Important**\n- **• Needle nose and regular pliers – Important**\n- **• Diagonal cutters - Important**\n- **• 10\" crescent wrench – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" open-ended combination wrench – Important**\n- **• Cable ties – Important**\n- **• Complete socket set – Needed**\n- **• Smart phone – Smart to have one**\n- **Packing Tape**\n\n**OVERVIEW**\n\n- Follow the NCR Hardware Technician On-Site Deployment Strategy.\n- Inventory Hardware.\n- Unbox, place, install Self Checkout Hardware.\n- Clean up and throw away trash.\n\n**ESCALATION PATH**\n\n- **D2T.VendorManagement@ncrvoyix.com**\n\n**CANCELLATION POLICY**\n\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site in the first hour: 50% to the tech\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site after the first hour: 100% to the tech","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T19:00","end":"2026-10-07T27:00"},"payRange":{"min":225,"max":225},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":39},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $225 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:0