{"job":{"id":20006745,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CPT Network Solutions, Inc.","title":"Qbit Player Swap","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>High Level Overview</u></strong></p><p>Technicians&nbsp;are&nbsp;to&nbsp;replace&nbsp;the existing Mood Media device with the Qbit audio play system.</p><p>This job is expected to take 30 minutes to one hour.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools to Bring to Site:</u></strong></p><ol><li>Standard&nbsp;technician&nbsp;toolset</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>Screwdrivers</li><li>Phone</li><li>Spare Cat6 cables (3ft and 6ft)</li><li>Cable tester</li><li>Butt Set</li><li>Punch-Down Tool and Wire Strippers</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work</u></strong></p><ol><li>Check-In&nbsp;and&nbsp;Coordination</li><li>Remove&nbsp;Mood Media device</li><li>Mount and connect Qbit device</li><li>Call QSIC to confirm connectivity</li><li>Test audio in store</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Deliverables</u></strong></p><ol><li>Picture&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;new&nbsp;QSIC&nbsp;player&nbsp;installed</li><li>Photos&nbsp;of&nbsp;Completed&nbsp;Install</li></ol>","markdown":"**High Level Overview**\n\nTechnicians are to replace the existing Mood Media device with the Qbit audio play system.\n\nThis job is expected to take 30 minutes to one hour.\n\n**Required Tools to Bring to Site:**\n\n1. Standard technician toolset\n2. Label Maker\n3. Screwdrivers\n4. Phone\n5. Spare Cat6 cables (3ft and 6ft)\n6. Cable tester\n7. Butt Set\n8. Punch-Down Tool and Wire Strippers\n\n**Scope of Work**\n\n1. Check-In and Coordination\n2. Remove Mood Media device\n3. Mount and connect Qbit device\n4. Call QSIC to confirm connectivity\n5. Test audio in store\n\n**Deliverables**\n\n1. Picture of the new QSIC player installed\n2. Photos of Completed Install","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T08:00","end":"2026-10-01T09:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":60},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHou