{"job":{"id":20006896,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Zayo Group","title":"Pick-up equipment prior to arrival - install a VeloCloud, Wattbox, Cradlepoint, & NetGear switch | Est. Duration of Install: 2.5hrs","description":{"html":"<p><u>﻿</u><strong><u>OVERVIEW:</u></strong></p><ul><li>In need of a technician to pick-up equipment &amp; work with a remote team to install &amp; test a VeloCloud, Wattbox, Cradlepoint, new wireline circuit/modem, and NetGear switch</li><li>Estimated duration of install is 2.5hrs</li></ul><p><strong><u>Requirements/Expectation:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: red;\"><u>Arrive at equipment pick-up location and call the</u></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><u><del>**********</del></u></strong><strong style=\"color: red;\"><u>&nbsp;Activations team at the scheduled hard start time</u></strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">The equipment pick-up location can be found in the work order under the&nbsp;<strong><u>\"Pre-site Pickup\"</u></strong>&nbsp;section</li><li>If gas/travel is required, it must be requested as a counter offer for review before the ticket is assigned. Any requests made after assignment may be denied</li><li><strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;have the tools required listed in the “Service Description” section in the event they are needed. Note that materials used that remain onsite (e.g. cabling) can be reimbursed as an expense.</li><li>Exhibit professional behavior at all times (escalate to the Field Nation project manager listed in the work order with any issues)</li></ul><p><strong><u>Dress code:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Business casual Close-toed shoes, pants no holes, no short tanks, no sleeveless shirts</li></ul><p><strong><u>Tools Required:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Laptop with Ethernet connection</li><li>Laptop with console cable</li><li>Laptop with charger&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Standard network cabling tools&nbsp;</li><li>Basic hand tools</li><li>6-8' ladder&n