{"job":{"id":20007712,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IW Technologies","title":"Premium Brands- HP Engage POS Troubleshooting - MUST Call HD BEFORE Working","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Summary of Work:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>﻿The technician assigned to the work order MUST be the technician onsite NO EXCEPTIONS. Any violations will be taken very seriously and escalated to Field Nation and the work order will not be approved for payment.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>﻿Call the Service Desk at 7</strong><strong><del>***********</del></strong><strong>, Option 3, upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not begin work without talking to the Service Desk.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>IW Technologies is in need of a technician to go onsite at a local clothing retailer to troubleshoot the network connection for register 2 and replace the ethernet cable if necessary. Please confirm functionality with the service desk prior to checking out.<strong>&nbsp;Issue:</strong>Reg offline.</p>\n<p>You are to follow the attached documentation to replace a unit, then box up a the defective parts using the label provided. Leave defective parts onsite</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>NOTE: Tech must remain onsite until register load is complete. It is uncommon, but possible to take over 2 hours. If you are not willing to stay, do not accept work order. We are willing to reasonably compensate for added time.</u> <em><u>This is to be discussed with IW Technologies ONLY. Do not discuss time onsite or pay with the clients help desk EVER!</u></em></strong></p>\n<p>Register #: 2</p>\n<p><strong>The check in and out process requires you to check in and out with both IW Technologies as well as the client Premium Brands. THIS IS REQUIRED!! Do NOT begin work without contacting the help desk. Please remember to be courteous and professional when working with the help desk. Numbers are below.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE: Parts are scheduled to arrive before 4:30pm local time. Be sure to track the parts as not to arrive onsite before they do. We will not compensate for a second trip due to parts not being onsite.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Required Tools:</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Physical Drivers License or State Issued ID﻿</strong></p>\n<p><strong>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;USB Keyboard</strong></p>\n<p><strong>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;USB Mouse</strong></p>\n<p><strong>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Standard PC tool kit</strong></p>\n<p><strong>5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Velcro cable ties</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Pre-Visit Instructions:</strong></p>\n<p>Be sure to read and understand all of the instructions and download/print all documentation attached to work order</p>\n<p>Confirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.</p>\n<p><strong>Onsite Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check in on Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198</p>\n<p>Call Premium Brands Help Desk - 740-951-3911 select opt 3 for On-Site Hardware Technicians, give them their internal ticket number 1856553</p>\n<p>Locate onsite contact and introduce yourself as a technician from IW Technologies</p>\n<p>Locate parts shipped to location</p>\n<p>Install new parts/equipment utilizing the attached documentation.</p>\n<p><strong><em><u>If at any time the personalization is not progressing, and seams \"frozen\" for more than 10 minutes call the Premium Brands Help Desk - 740-951-3911 select opt 5</u></em></strong></p>\n<p>Validate Connectivity and/or Functionality with Support</p>\n<p><strong>Clean up Area</strong></p>\n<p>Call Premium Brands Help Desk - 740-951-3911 select opt 3 for On-Site Hardware Technicians,</p>\n<p>to confirm resolution and/or advise them of the status.</p>\n<p>Call IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site - 847-285-4198</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check In Time: (local)</p>\n<p>Check Out Time: (local)</p>\n<p>Store Contact Name:</p>\n<p>Help Desk Contact Name:</p>\n<p>Description of Issue Observed by Tech Upon Arrival:</p>\n<p>Description of Troubleshooting / Resolution: (concise, bulleted format)</p>\n<p>Parts Installed: Product Name, SN</p>\n<p>Parts Removed: Product Name, SN</p>\n<p>Return Tracking #:</p>\n<p>Return Authorization #:</p>\n<p>Store Check Out Contact:</p>\n<p>Picture of Completed Work:</p>\n<p><strong>Close-Out Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check out on the Field Nation App</p>\n<p>Ensure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables</p>\n<p>Leave defective parts onsite</p>\n<p>Submit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.</p>\n<p><strong>Special Instructions for technician:</strong></p>\n<p><em>(Include any pertinent information from the case here)</em></p>","markdown":"**Summary of Work:**\n\n**﻿The technician assigned to the work order MUST be the technician onsite NO EXCEPTIONS. Any violations will be taken very seriously and escalated to Field Nation and the work order will not be approved for payment.**\n\n**﻿Call the Service Desk at 7****\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*****, Option 3, upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not begin work without talking to the Service Desk.**\n\nIW Technologies is in need of a technician to go onsite at a local clothing retailer to troubleshoot the network connection for register 2 and replace the ethernet cable if necessary. Please confirm functionality with the service desk prior to checking out. **Issue:**Reg offline.\n\nYou are to follow the attached documentation to replace a unit, then box up a the defective parts using the label provided. Leave defective parts onsite\n\n**NOTE: Tech must remain onsite until register load is complete. It is uncommon, but possible to take over 2 hours. If you are not willing to stay, do not accept work order. We are willing to reasonably compensate for added time. *This is to be discussed with IW Technologies ONLY. Do not discuss time onsite or pay with the clients help desk EVER!***\n\nRegister #: 2\n\n**The check in and out process requires you to check in and out with both IW Technologies as well as the client Premium Brands. THIS IS REQUIRED!! Do NOT begin work without contacting the help desk. Please remember to be courteous and professional when working with the help desk. Numbers are below.**\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Parts are scheduled to arrive before 4:30pm local time. Be sure to track the parts as not to arrive onsite before they do. We will not compensate for a second trip due to parts not being onsite.\n\n**Required Tools:**\n\n**1. Physical Drivers License or State Issued ID﻿**\n\n**2. USB Keyboard**\n\n**3. USB Mouse**\n\n**4. Standard PC tool kit**\n\n**5. Velcro cable ties**\n\n**Pre-Visit Instructions:**\n\nBe sure to read and understand all of the instructions and download/print all documentation attached to work order\n\nConfirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.\n\n**Onsite Tasks:**\n\nCheck in on Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198\n\nCall Premium Brands Help Desk - 740-951-3911 select opt 3 for On-Site Hardware Technicians, give them their internal ticket number 1856553\n\nLocate onsite contact and introduce yourself as a technician from IW Technologies\n\nLocate parts shipped to location\n\nInstall new parts/equipment utilizing the attached documentation.\n\n***If at any time the personalization is not progressing, and seams \"frozen\" for more than 10 minutes call the Premium Brands Help Desk - 740-951-3911 select opt 5***\n\nValidate Connectivity and/or Functionality with Support\n\n**Clean up Area**\n\nCall Premium Brands Help Desk - 740-951-3911 select opt 3 for On-Site Hardware Technicians,\n\nto confirm resolution and/or advise them of the status.\n\nCall IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site - 847-285-4198\n\nCheck In Time: (local)\n\nCheck Out Time: (local)\n\nStore Contact Name:\n\nHelp Desk Contact Name:\n\nDescription of Issue Observed by Tech Upon Arrival:\n\nDescription of Troubleshooting / Resolution: (concise, bulleted format)\n\nParts Installed: Product Name, SN\n\nParts Removed: Product Name, SN\n\nReturn Tracking #:\n\nReturn Authorization #:\n\nStore Check Out Contact:\n\nPicture of Completed Work:\n\n**Close-Out Tasks:**\n\nCheck out on the Field Nation App\n\nEnsure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables\n\nLeave defective parts onsite\n\nSubmit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.\n\n**Special Instructions for technician:**\n\n*(Include any pertinent information from the case here)*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00","end":"2026-09-24T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":60},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":35},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $60 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T17: