{"job":{"id":20008118,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Comm-Works","title":"Fiber Technician Required Survey to to extend a 200M DIA circuit (Fiber) and provide a quote","description":{"html":"<p>SCOPE: 2-part request - 1st visit to conduct a site survey to extend a 200M DIA circuit (Fiber) and provide a quote</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please schedule a technician to conduct a site survey to extend a 200M Lumen circuit from main telephone room to the Robert Half network closet in Suite 240.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please update the work order to note the circuit handoff is SMF/LC, utilizing the copper port 3 on the ADVA NID installed in our network closet. Here’s the picture of the ADVA device (Lumen carrier device).&nbsp; Customer will provide the media convertor The fiber run is roughly 150ft</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Circuit ID &amp; demarc information</p>\n<p>Lumen Circuit ID: 449983896</p>\n<p>Circuit demarc: 2nd Floor, Electrical Room, Wall Mounted, Port 11, Single Mode Fiber, tagged with circuit id - NC/KXFN/172593/LUMN.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>NID Demarc:&nbsp;2nd Floor, Suite 240, Wall Mounted ADVA - GNBO37594P001, Port 3, Copper port, tagged with circuit id - NC/KXFN/172593/LUMN</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please provide the quote which includes the breakdown of time and materials. Once quote is approved, will schedule the work to be done.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>If additional information is needed for this request, please reach out to me.</p>\n<p>Corp Contact: Rose Hilbert&nbsp;(925) 913-1415</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Site Contact: Katie Carter&nbsp;(336) 668-2996</p>","markdown":"SCOPE: 2-part request - 1st visit to conduct a site survey to extend a 200M DIA circuit (Fiber) and provide a quote\n\nPlease schedule a technician to conduct a site survey to extend a 200M Lumen circuit from main telephone room to the Robert Half network closet in Suite 240.\n\nPlease update the work order to note the circuit handoff is SMF/LC, utilizing the copper port 3 on the ADVA NID installed in our network closet. Here’s the picture of the ADVA device (Lumen carrier device). Customer will provide the media convertor The fiber run is roughly 150ft\n\nCircuit ID & demarc information\n\nLumen Circuit ID: 449983896\n\nCircuit demarc: 2nd Floor, Electrical Room, Wall Mounted, Port 11, Single Mode Fiber, tagged with circuit id - NC/KXFN/172593/LUMN.\n\nNID Demarc: 2nd Floor, Suite 240, Wall Mounted ADVA - GNBO37594P001, Port 3, Copper port, tagged with circuit id - NC/KXFN/172593/LUMN\n\nPlease provide the quote which includes the breakdown of time and materials. Once quote is approved, will schedule the work to be done.\n\nIf additional information is needed for this request, please reach out to me.\n\nCorp Contact: Rose Hilbert (925) 913-1415\n\nSite Contact: Katie Carter (336) 668-2996","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-23T14:00","end":"2026-09-23T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":69},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1790109906072}
