{"job":{"id":20008261,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"URGENT - VIP SITE!! NEED DONE ASAP!! Kiosk Service - Break/Fix - Troubleshoot Power Issue","description":{"html":"<p>**KIOSK #: NS5369**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**Door key required for this task?: Yes**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Overview:</p>\n<p>The kiosk is currently offline, use the work instructions link for troubleshooting steps</p>\n<p>Verify kiosk is plugged in &amp; not tripped</p>\n<p>Communicate if the screen is frozen or displaying anything unusual upon arrival</p>\n<p>Power cycle internally if needed &amp; pay attention to both the CPU power supply fan as well as the motherboard fan when attempting to boot</p>\n<p>If fans fail to spin, confirm CPU PSU is not dead</p>\n<p>If the issue is resolved complete 1 test transaction to verify functionality</p>\n<p>Please remember to enter a task to clear the Power Issue ADS. This will also prompt you to complete a survey.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please ensure photos are emailed to Support including the NS# in the subject line for:</p>\n<p>- Any issues found during the visit</p>\n<p>- General environment before / after replacing any parts</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check out with SSN.</p>\n<p>SUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables**</p>\n<p>**Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app**</p>\n<p><strong>**Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site**</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*KIOSK #: NS5369\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Door key required for this task?: Yes\\*\\*\n\nOverview:\n\nThe kiosk is currently offline, use the work instructions link for troubleshooting steps\n\nVerify kiosk is plugged in & not tripped\n\nCommunicate if the screen is frozen or displaying anything unusual upon arrival\n\nPower cycle internally if needed & pay attention to both the CPU power supply fan as well as the motherboard fan when attempting to boot\n\nIf fans fail to spin, confirm CPU PSU is not dead\n\nIf the issue is resolved complete 1 test transaction to verify functionality\n\nPlease remember to enter a task to clear the Power Issue ADS. This will also prompt you to complete a survey.\n\nPlease ensure photos are emailed to Support including the NS# in the subject line for:\n\n\\- Any issues found during the visit\n\n\\- General environment before / after replacing any parts\n\nCheck out with SSN.\n\nSUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!\n\n\\*\\*All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app\\*\\*\n\n**\\*\\*Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T10:00","end":"2026-09-25T11:00","latestStart":"2026-09-25T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":65},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":52},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $65 is below minimum threshold $400"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso Durham"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"star