{"job":{"id":20008575,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"KIOSK Information Systems","title":"Spectrum | Payment Kiosk | Check Reader Replacement","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>This WO is to help us get our customer back up and running.</u></strong></p><p><strong>Documentation:</strong></p><p><strong>*Please review the attached pictures and documents to help you be ready for this WO*</strong></p><p><br></p><p><u>Reported Issue:</u></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><p>__ Standard Tool Set</p><p>__ Nut Drivers or Socket Set</p><p>__ Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth</p><p>__ A to B USB Cable</p><p>__ VGA Cable</p><p>__ Compressed air/Canned Air</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p><p><strong>**Please take before &amp; after pictures**</strong></p><p><strong>**MUST CALL KIOSK SUPPORT TO CHECK IN AND CHECK OUT**</strong></p><p>__Check in with the Work Order Manager.</p><p>__Check in with Store Manager.</p><p>__ Call Support regarding any issues with scope of work</p><p>__ Take pictures of existing damage.</p><p>__ Disconnect check reader.</p><p>__ Remove thumb screws on each side.</p><p>__ Remove hardware underneath check reader bracket (BE CAREFUL not to lose hardware &amp; washers).</p><p>__ Remove check reader from tray.</p><p>__ Remove nuts holding brackets to check reader and transfer to new check reader.</p><p>__ Install check reader into tray and make sure it is properly aligned against door when it slides in and out.</p><p>__ Secure check reader.</p><p>__ Reconnect check reader.</p><p>__ Take after pictures.</p><p>__ Reboot the PC (Press the PC Power Button once).</p><p>__ Check with site to confirm if check is an available payment option OR have a customer pay by check.</p><p>__ Have customer sign off on attached customer acceptance form.</p><p>__ Call the Work Order manager to check out.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>MUST RETURN ALL PARTS TO KIOSK SUPPORT UNDER RMA NUMBER ON TITLE OF WORK ORDER. Do not leave any parts on site. If we do not see return tracking when you close WO we will not process for payment until we do.</u></strong></p><p><strong>Company:</strong>&nbsp;Kiosk Information Systems Inc.</p><p>346 S Arthur Ave.</p><p>Louisville, CO 80027</p>","markdown":"**This WO is to help us get our customer back up and running.**\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n**\\*Please review the attached pictures and documents to help you be ready for this WO\\***\n\nReported Issue:\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n\\_\\_ Standard Tool Set\n\n\\_\\_ Nut Drivers or Socket Set\n\n\\_\\_ Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth\n\n\\_\\_ A to B USB Cable\n\n\\_\\_ VGA Cable\n\n\\_\\_ Compressed air/Canned Air\n\n**Scope of work:**\n\n**\\*\\*Please take before & after pictures\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*MUST CALL KIOSK SUPPORT TO CHECK IN AND CHECK OUT\\*\\***\n\n\\_\\_Check in with the Work Order Manager.\n\n\\_\\_Check in with Store Manager.\n\n\\_\\_ Call Support regarding any issues with scope of work\n\n\\_\\_ Take pictures of existing damage.\n\n\\_\\_ Disconnect check reader.\n\n\\_\\_ Remove thumb screws on each side.\n\n\\_\\_ Remove hardware underneath check reader bracket (BE CAREFUL not to lose hardware & washers).\n\n\\_\\_ Remove check reader from tray.\n\n\\_\\_ Remove nuts holding brackets to check reader and transfer to new check reader.\n\n\\_\\_ Install check reader into tray and make sure it is properly aligned against door when it slides in and out.\n\n\\_\\_ Secure check reader.\n\n\\_\\_ Reconnect check reader.\n\n\\_\\_ Take after pictures.\n\n\\_\\_ Reboot the PC (Press the PC Power Button once).\n\n\\_\\_ Check with site to confirm if check is an available payment option OR have a customer pay by check.\n\n\\_\\_ Have customer sign off on attached customer acceptance form.\n\n\\_\\_ Call the Work Order manager to check out.\n\n**MUST RETURN ALL PARTS TO KIOSK SUPPORT UNDER RMA NUMBER ON TITLE OF WORK ORDER. Do not leave any parts on site. If we do not see return tracking when you close WO we will not proc